      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/37d9c06f700097035e4da1bfc9e76fee9c0979fe.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=5681c04afe51033245feff270c61b11f"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/468d91b9ecc9e7d678a117f58edc0dda84cdcc53.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=b6502fd2dace780df46f3c07edc7eba5"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Thrive in any off-grid element!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Don’t just survive in the modern outdoors—thrive. Our newest &lt;em&gt;For Dummies&lt;/em&gt; bundle features some of the hottest and most useful ebooks for individuals looking to have fun in the wild or start a craft career. Get amazing titles like &lt;em&gt;Solar Power Your Home For Dummies, 2e&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Vegetable Gardening For Dummies, 3e&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;How to Fix Everything For Dummies&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Ham Radio For Dummies, 4e&lt;/em&gt;. Plus, your purchase helps support Covenant House. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cast-ironcookingfordummies2ndedition"&gt;Cast-Iron Cooking For Dummies, 2nd Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#organicgardeningfordummies2ndedition"&gt;Organic Gardening For Dummies, 2nd Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt10"&gt;Pay $10 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#two-wayradiosandscannersfordummies"&gt;Two-Way Radios and Scanners For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#hobbyfarmingfordummies"&gt;Hobby Farming For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#windpowerfordummies"&gt;Wind Power For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#alternativeenergyfordummies"&gt;Alternative Energy For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt18"&gt;Pay $18 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#solarpoweryourhomefordummies2ndedition"&gt;Solar Power Your Home For Dummies, 2nd Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#vanlifefordummies"&gt;Van Life For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#howtofixeverythingfordummies"&gt;How to Fix Everything For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#vegetablegardeningfordummies3rdedition"&gt;Vegetable Gardening For Dummies, 3rd Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#hamradiofordummies4thedition"&gt;Ham Radio For Dummies, 4th Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#homemaintenancefordummies3rdedition"&gt;Home Maintenance For Dummies, 3rd Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#backyardhomesteadingall-in-onefordummies"&gt;Backyard Homesteading All-in-One For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#raisingchickensfordummies2ndedition"&gt;Raising Chickens For Dummies, 2nd Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#electronicsfordummies3rdedition"&gt;Electronics For Dummies, 3rd Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#gardeningbasicsfordummies2ndedition"&gt;Gardening Basics For Dummies, 2nd Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#canningandpreservingfordummies3rdedition"&gt;Canning &amp; Preserving For Dummies, 3rd Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#sewingfordummies4thedition"&gt;Sewing For Dummies, 4th Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#raisinggoatsfordummies2ndedition"&gt;Raising Goats For Dummies, 2nd Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#photovoltaicdesignandinstallationfordummies"&gt;Photovoltaic Design &amp; Installation For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildingchickencoopsfordummies"&gt;Building Chicken Coops For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#growingyourownfruitandvegfordummiesukedition"&gt;Growing Your Own Fruit and Veg For Dummies, UK Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#makingcandlesandsoapsfordummies"&gt;Making Candles and Soaps For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#breadmakingfordummies"&gt;Bread Making For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#electriccarsfordummies"&gt;Electric Cars For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="cast-ironcookingfordummies2ndedition"&gt;&lt;a id="cast-ironcookingfordummies2ndedition" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/cast-ironcookingfordummies2ndedition_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651106~exp=1788737506~hmac=324b1318f35f03f0dbebbd7d831b9d39b2b63510a475ae8d2dd2439e134bf097"&gt;Cast-Iron Cooking For Dummies, 2nd Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/61e43980cd120284addffc682debaf86ff7dca39.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6d1594d2ca6d3afa3e9ab0e082949c42"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cast iron for the modern age!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Despite being popular for thousands of years, cast-iron has much to offer modern-day cooks; it's easy to use, easy to care for, economical, versatile, and durable. Most cast-iron cooks will tell you that food cooked in cast-iron tastes better than food cooked using other methods! Cast-Iron Cooking For Dummies, Second Edition will teach you all you need to know about making great food using cast-iron, and provides you with dozens of recipes for the best dishes suited for cast-iron. You will learn how to select the right cast-iron cookware for you; how to season and care for your cast-iron cookware; and how to make your cast-iron cookware last longer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Updates to this edition include:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;New color insert - with photos of cast-iron cookware and meals&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;A guide to all of the new cast-iron cookware companies - what to look for/be aware of&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;New section covering food styling and catering using cast-iron cookware, and current trends in the food service industry, and how this can elevate your next party or event.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;New recipes for cooking with meat - will no longer just focus on American classics, but will include meat dishes that represent different cultures and more modern/popular recipes.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Stronger focus on explaining cast iron's versatility and how it allows cooks to maximize different cooking techniques.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Updated fish recipes that reflect popular fish used in restaurants and focusing on different cooking techniques that can be used to produce the dish.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The veggie chapter focuses on seasonal vegetables and the benefits of using in-season products. Recipes are simple and teach the reader how to enhance the flavors&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Totally updated chapter with global recipes that reflect a multitude of cultures.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="organicgardeningfordummies2ndedition"&gt;&lt;a id="organicgardeningfordummies2ndedition" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/organicgardeningfordummies2ndedition_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651106~exp=1788737506~hmac=d658eedaed4e6549817ff76189c4e5046fec41f57f35eac198bea59bcb73a149"&gt;Organic Gardening For Dummies, 2nd Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/566c55d6a62b6f8849e1bd30e82ac729e159ea69.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=caef71cd2eb45b0366d610e88892b418"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Organic Gardening For Dummies, 2nd Edition shows readers the way to ensure a healthy harvest from their environmentally friendly garden. It covers information on the newest and safest natural fertilizers and pest control methods, composting, cultivation without chemicals, and how to battle plant diseases. It also has information on updated equipment and resources. It helps readers plant organically year-round, using herbs, fruits, vegetables, lawn care, trees and shrubs, and flowers. The tips and techniques included in Organic Gardening For Dummies, 2nd Edition are intended to reduce a garden's impact on both the environment and the wallet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt10"&gt;Pay $10 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="two-wayradiosandscannersfordummies"&gt;&lt;a id="two-wayradiosandscannersfordummies" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/two-wayradiosandscannersfordummies_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651106~exp=1788737506~hmac=20f2e1663fb8a6c74e4ded4b2defd5810c0a562ad49d23b91998015d9e0f60ee"&gt;Two-Way Radios and Scanners For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6e24a2df66c30defc9135b3bdf3907930e49b415.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c8669c5de57d27b3bb4409d84fb6ef7c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The book is a survey of all the radio options for the individual, such as short-wave listening, all the different unlicensed radio services (those neat handheld radios you can buy everywhere, for example), Citizens Band and Amateur Radio, marine HF and VHF communications for sailors, aviation radio, public safety, TV-FM-AM DXing, and using a scanner to listen to public safety or at sporting events (air shows, auto races), weather information and other broadcast signals. Each topic includes definitions, operating conventions, equipment availability, licensing (if required), and any special technical information.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Also includes instruction on how to use antennas and the electronics and installation required for good results in the home, car, and portably.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="hobbyfarmingfordummies"&gt;&lt;a id="hobbyfarmingfordummies" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/hobbyfarmingfordummies_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651106~exp=1788737506~hmac=a43e32c50909ac059d8323c6e22f242df7355b0b5cdb80818880bd508dd4208f"&gt;Hobby Farming For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ac7f3af6b1627ba166631356e080db3b81f4573a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5ebd81c23d36444ded2f2a085ac2bbba"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hobby Farming For Dummies is a strategic addition to our sustainable/green publishing initiative, as it introduces a back-to-basics and self-sufficient segment that appeals to many readers interested in green living. The addition of a foundational title for this back-to-basics segment will allow us to align a number of existing titles, such as Canning and Preserving For Dummies and Beekeeping For Dummies (40,000+ net unit shipped, each, RTD) more closely with the overall sustainable/green initiative.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="windpowerfordummies"&gt;&lt;a id="windpowerfordummies" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/windpowerfordummies_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651106~exp=1788737506~hmac=73b425451db6292798df533e27146a07d383a0331d87e29263ef23d334f8fd9c"&gt;Wind Power For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2ba205e1b4ba6d57733732ad10cd08ab76ea0ade.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=7bb14a15a9d56dc5a8a1ba0e41269e72"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wind Power For Dummies guides readers through each step of the process in acquiring, installing, and maintaining a home-scale wind turbine system. Coverage includes conducting a home energy audit to assess current energy use; determining if wind power is right for their home; explanations of the mechanics of wind power at home; how to tie into the grid and sell energy back to the power company; how to finance the project; and how to work with contractors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="alternativeenergyfordummies"&gt;&lt;a id="alternativeenergyfordummies" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/alternativeenergyfordummies_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651106~exp=1788737506~hmac=29dd4970cc73c904083233c465882128c686ea5e271c09e42c3fe76765bdbea1"&gt;Alternative Energy For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/200112ebe6e687663b4e72ff5f97f267f034b63a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=269d25813507883b3315301770c7871d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Alternative Energy For Dummies presents readers with a multifaceted examination of various forms of alternative energy, including solar, wind, nuclear, biomass, geothermal, biofuel, and other sources. Each alternative scenario is compared to current fossil-fuel intensive practices in the scientific, environmental, social, political, and economic realms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt18"&gt;Pay $18 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="solarpoweryourhomefordummies2ndedition"&gt;&lt;a id="solarpoweryourhomefordummies2ndedition" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/solarpoweryourhomefordummies2ndedition_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651106~exp=1788737506~hmac=1a128b8531a175f06110471903440535170b850462da37d4677ab1f6c0a43a00"&gt;Solar Power Your Home For Dummies, 2nd Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/85dc1f310baeb8fa4dc50923c1423cad003a5305.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a81774d6b5c99ad58adc88de20437a71"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Solar Power Your Home For Dummies is the bestselling consumer guide to solar power in North America. Updates for the second edition ensure that this title continues to provide readers with accurate and timely information on a subject that is constantly evolving. Solar Power Your Home For Dummies, 2nd Edition, includes updates on changes to federal, state, and local regulations, laws, and tax incentives that seek to make solar-power adoption more feasible. Expanded coverage of the technology that underpins full-scale solar-power systems for the home have been added in direct response to consumer demand. With this information, readers are better positioned to weigh the pros and cons of embarking on what can be an expensive undertaking. New small and mid-sized solar products, projects, and applications are discussed, along with updated pricing information for the same.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="vanlifefordummies"&gt;&lt;a id="vanlifefordummies" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/vanlifefordummies_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651106~exp=1788737506~hmac=0c96610ed40fb83ac265e9ce7c1f967b35b55246063492eb5ba896b2f570e7d5"&gt;Van Life For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4de0d4e4cd980dfd4541fe9e1976c8e443ea0d0c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=62778c7587bf277eb9949065f42625d1"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;When I LIVE IN A VAN DOWN BY THE RIVER sounds like a great option!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The lure of the open road is hard to resist. Who doesn't love the notion of days spent in placid woods and evenings watching the sunset. But, it's difficult to consistently experience those moments other than one the few days a year you have for vacation. Van life changes that paradigm. Van lifers enjoy a life untethered to an address, taking careers on the road in a simplified way of living. This book demystifies how to step into van life, from preparing to make the switch to customizing a vehicle to making it all work in the locations of your choosing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inside... &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Evaluating if van life if for you&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Deciding to go part- or full-time&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Customizing a vehicle to your needs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Exploring how to take your career on the road with you&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Answering the big question "Where do I use the bathroom?"&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Living the off-grid life&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Getting tips from experienced van lifers&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="howtofixeverythingfordummies"&gt;&lt;a id="howtofixeverythingfordummies" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/howtofixeverythingfordummies_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651106~exp=1788737506~hmac=b171b1e482520f15b50485d0fb49996e94f1ef86a14eb1c09dc56a462084e506"&gt;How to Fix Everything For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0315f2a768d00ef6cdecca07d9c74d3997b7dae2.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4cd29b988db7cca1dfa2a4db03c9bcb8"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;This hands-on, informative Do-it-Yourself (DIY) manual shows readers not only how to fix faulty appliances but also tend to all those irritating repairs that cost more to have someone else fix than the item is worth. Featuring clear, concise directions, How to Fix Everything For Dummies will explain how to fix furniture (like wobby chair or table legs and fixing nicks, etc), vacuum cleaners, refrigerators, washers, dryers, dishwashers, garbage disposals, toasters, blenders, radios, televisions, and even computers and printer glitches. How to Fix Everything For Dummies will also cover using the proper tools and materials to get the job done correctly without breaking the bank.  It's an excellent reference guide to have in the home for fixing everyone's stuff.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="vegetablegardeningfordummies3rdedition"&gt;&lt;a id="vegetablegardeningfordummies3rdedition" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/vegetablegardeningfordummies3rdedition_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651106~exp=1788737506~hmac=bbf0b3ace86b603a617be2a6707dd9be92e28f8381c6f62beaf6a235e8e67921"&gt;Vegetable Gardening For Dummies, 3rd Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/98d0b0bedc25d2e9e3f48b337b649f518b43bc38.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=94fb689d4cd485f3f6ba6fcbe90a3a0e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Vegetable Gardening For Dummies, 3rd Edition provides readers with information on how to plant, care for, harvest, and enjoy the fruits of their home gardens. It offers advice on planning a garden, environmentally friendly ways to combat pests, and tips on preserving foods grown at home.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Updates include:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Expanded chapter on edible landscape (fruits, herbs, flowers, and unique vegetables)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;New information about 4 advanced techniques (Hugelkultur, strawbale gardening, herb spirals, aquaponics)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Entirely updated appendix, with detailed planning guidelines and other resources&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="hamradiofordummies4thedition"&gt;&lt;a id="hamradiofordummies4thedition" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/hamradiofordummies4thedition_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651106~exp=1788737506~hmac=e3b8d72589779ae28f8288c03a0fc9ffbe2a2386537737e04d6036225f160fba"&gt;Ham Radio For Dummies, 4th Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/07b0f80ed1cddc2ba10db370085b11aed22f0332.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e436b78f61aa24b95e0b65c567110d2e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your how-to guide to become a ham&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Amateur radio has been a popular pastime for years, and its popularity continues to grow. Ham Radio For Dummies is your guide to everything there is to know about ham radio. This updated edition provides new and additional information on digital mode operating, as well as use of amateur radio in student science and new operating events. If you're looking to join a college radio club or just want to learn the latest tips and tricks, this book is a helpful reference guide to beginners, or those who have been "hams" for years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Inside:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Successfully set up your radio&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Communicate with people around the world&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Prepare for and pass the licensing exam&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Provide communication during an emergency&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="homemaintenancefordummies3rdedition"&gt;&lt;a id="homemaintenancefordummies3rdedition" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/homemaintenancefordummies3rdedition_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651106~exp=1788737506~hmac=232bf7c1b52e5b64b24d48d1443ade2d1f92b876882015b7b463411c4c2e2d23"&gt;Home Maintenance For Dummies, 3rd Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a2d5b4e05395fb77c91e942034d991e571ca57c2.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=fa51f810dbba2f57ef3d61db8a575a24"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;THE SINK IS MAKING THAT NOISE AGAIN.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stop putting Band-Aids on every problem and save thousands in repair costs with Home Maintenance For Dummies, 3rd Edition. This comprehensive update will make it possible for any first-time homeowner or DIY rookie to keep up with basic home repairs in any room of the house. Learn how to conduct routine inspections, keep major appliances running efficiently, and avoid costly mistakes. Make a list for the must-have tools in your toolbox. Find how to determine when its time for maintenance and recognize the difference between an easy DIY repair and something an expert should handle. With Dummies hands on, step-by-step guides, detailed diagrams, and instructions for every room of the home, youll finally be able to stop that leaky faucet or calm that roaring fan.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;UPDATES INCLUDE: &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Heating and cooling systems&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Tankless water heaters&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;LED lighting Solar power &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Guide to a basic home repair tool kit&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="backyardhomesteadingall-in-onefordummies"&gt;&lt;a id="backyardhomesteadingall-in-onefordummies" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/backyardhomesteadingall-in-onefordummies_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651106~exp=1788737506~hmac=73f90e171e2afbb1957198aa8a4007289cbf51cdca208cf1d4cb93209d19e354"&gt;Backyard Homesteading All-in-One For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b714f1f0b67a7ecd1a84cc7d13caef862119e5a0.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a08261c196fd9bb824bd40d60a69c3e0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Backyard Homesteading AIO For Dummies has a little bit of everything. It walks you through the basics of creating your own sustainable homestead.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Topics include:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Raising and keeping chickens&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Beekeeping&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Composting Canning &amp;amp; preserving&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Sustainable landscaping&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Organic gardening&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="raisingchickensfordummies2ndedition"&gt;&lt;a id="raisingchickensfordummies2ndedition" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/raisingchickensfordummies2ndedition_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651106~exp=1788737506~hmac=866af6197329bf6f8517d84fca9b4c9421bc16011432220cc85ab212d2040c44"&gt;Raising Chickens For Dummies, 2nd Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/672cc9577524cbf5875836677592239393bd1c86.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4471a8b97de3521f4ede78e133454354"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your hands-on guide to modern chicken-raising methods&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thinking about raising chickens? You've come to the right place! This new edition of Raising Chickens For Dummies provides the most up-to-date, thorough information on the many aspects of keeping chickens in your backyard. Inside, you'll find hands-on, easy-to-follow instructions on choosing and purchasing chickens, constructing housing for your birds, feeding your chickens for optimal health, combating laying issues, controlling pests and predators, optimizing egg production, and much more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Raising chickens on a small scale is a popular—and growing—pastime. If you're interested in keeping chickens as pets or as a source for eggs, Raising Chickens For Dummies gives you plain-English explanations of everything you need to know to about caring for chickens. Inside, you'll learn about basic chicken biology, breeds, and behavior, which chicken breed is best for you, how many you need, ways to spot healthy chickens, how to build a chicken coop, best practices for mating your chickens, how to incubate eggs, how to hatch and nurture chicks, manage laying hens, collect and store eggs, and butcher meat birds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Offers practical advice on choosing and purchasing chickens Helps you construct the right housing for your chickens Provides tips on feeding and caring for your chickens Includes top tips for raising healthy chickens Whether you're a first-time poulterer or you've been raising chickens for years, this comprehensive guide provides practical how-to advice for keeping chickens in virtually any backyard.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Raising Chickens For Dummies (9781119675921) was previously published as Raising Chickens For Dummies (9781118982785). While this version features a new Dummies cover and design, the content is the same as the prior release and should not be considered a new or updated product.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="electronicsfordummies3rdedition"&gt;&lt;a id="electronicsfordummies3rdedition" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/electronicsfordummies3rdedition_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651106~exp=1788737506~hmac=a2d114f7c694d202499b91c4a36185127c2310919b0bd18abafbf7b16609df20"&gt;Electronics For Dummies, 3rd Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/15c5e36c00890a6d42784843996eaceb2894ea34.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=585dcbd200879ba5940ec17556994b2c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explore the basic concepts of electronics, build your electronics workbench, and begin creating fun electronics projects right away! Circuit basics: learn what voltage is, where current flows (and doesnt flow), and how power is used in a circuit. Critical components: discover how resistors, capacitors, inductors, diodes, and transistors control and shape electric current. Versatile chips: find out how to use analog and digital integrated circuits to build complex projects with just a few parts. Analyze circuits: understand the rules that govern current and voltage and learn how to apply them. Safety tips: get a thorough grounding in how to protect yourself--and your electronics--from harm. Electronics For Dummies, 3rd Edition covers the latest advancements in circuitry, transmitters, hardware, robotics, microcontrollers, tools and amplifiers. It will be full color, and several new projects and breadboard projects are being developed for the book.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The content covers:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Very brief overview of the science of electronics&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Required tools and safety&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Learning all about the multimeter&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Other test tools of the trade (oscilloscope, logic probe, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Common electronic components (e.g. resistors, capacitors, transistors)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Making circuits using breadboards and printed circuit boards&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Microcontrollers (implementation and programming)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Practical circuits to try (10 minutes or less)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="gardeningbasicsfordummies2ndedition"&gt;&lt;a id="gardeningbasicsfordummies2ndedition" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/gardeningbasicsfordummies2ndedition_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651106~exp=1788737506~hmac=a520ec28998f9bb3c1eecc1ce809460ef2b9a69f169318238c9461c8e67587e0"&gt;Gardening Basics For Dummies, 2nd Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e506f8ce1746afbbd1017a8b8451326d1b00171a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b843f624536393fb7b3fe16e3a3b84d6"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create the garden of your dreams with the right plants and equipment Gardening Basics For Dummies 2e gives gardeners tips, plans, and insider know-how for getting started with flower beds, borders, vegetables, trees, shrubs, lawns, and more. Packed with advice, resources, illustrations, and plant recommendations, this friendly guide covers all the tools that make gardening today easier than ever before!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Updates include:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;New section on bienniels&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;New section on summer flowering bulbs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;New chapter, Multiplying Your Plants, provides more information on seed starting and other ways of multiplying plants&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Completely updated appendix detailing resources&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="canningandpreservingfordummies3rdedition"&gt;&lt;a id="canningandpreservingfordummies3rdedition" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/canningandpreservingfordummies3rdedition_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651106~exp=1788737506~hmac=fb9f3dca1083036f7018eed195495c85252b6a0530a1328699acb12a51fbda62"&gt;Canning &amp; Preserving For Dummies, 3rd Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8f3f993ac7514aae5eebab47c56dab0fea9b35f7.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=272d041f22533addd0f5e29d0f5ac5bb"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Craving a peach in the middle of winter? Or, want tomato soup before the seeds are in the ground? Be in control of your food supply year round with Canning &amp;amp; Preserving For Dummies, 3rd Edition. This long-time top seller from the For Dummies family will keep your kitchen versatile long after harvest. Included among the topics are easy-to-follow guides for freezing, canning, preserving, pickling, dehydrating, juicing, and root cellaring.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Updates include:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Additional reasons for preserving food, including food shortages and how to make use of the food that is available&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Expanded section on food storage spaces in urban living&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Updated safety guidelines (reusable lids &amp;amp; Star San as a sanitizer)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Easy-to-follow charts 10 new recipes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="sewingfordummies4thedition"&gt;&lt;a id="sewingfordummies4thedition" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/sewingfordummies4thedition_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651106~exp=1788737506~hmac=cc7ba2bb5c4d0e083a5471fad078d5729833e1d18d7d57c346a3df9487a071c6"&gt;Sewing For Dummies, 4th Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6a1b8185f9455edcf448622f87f87b6367954a6a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=67d42b949b7e65ecb7ea7ba99bde3510"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sewing For Dummies, Fourth Edition is the complete guide to sewing basics. Learning to sew provides you with a creative outlet and the skills to create or repair clothing and furnishings that fit your personal style, your measurements, and your aesthetic. Sewing For Dummies 4E is a friendly guide to the best sewing techniques and tips for beginners, and contains easy-to-follow instructions and step-by-step illustrations that make it easier to learn, including a full-color insert, a discussion about common sewing mistakes and how to avoid them, and information on how to alter and tailor your wardrobe to fit you perfectly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;New to this edition:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;An introduction to the numerous independent pattern companies that are popular today&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Detailed instructions on how to use downloadable patterns from your favorite online sites&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Even more sustainable fashion and décor tips, including several new projects that start out as thrift store finds and are given a new life - you'll see the before and after results&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Many more quick-fix alterations and repairs readers need to maintain their wardrobes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Learn about innovative fabrics such as glow-in-the-dark fabric and trims, and chalkboard fabric&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Completely updated resources for readers - new websites, trade and consumer organizations, and fabric and notion companies/catalogs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="raisinggoatsfordummies2ndedition"&gt;&lt;a id="raisinggoatsfordummies2ndedition" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/raisinggoatsfordummies2ndedition_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651106~exp=1788737506~hmac=36a13255d6433416b93398e6e650529541225efedd9497e25c86415a0383ba76"&gt;Raising Goats For Dummies, 2nd Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/cdf19ba913b0719559a9e5a86af8c65d63f907ba.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2154bd42287b785530496cdcee7ead8e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Raising Goats For Dummies provides readers with an introduction to all aspects of owning and raising goats. Topics covered include purchasing goats, building and maintaining appropriate housing, and the proper care, feeding, and breeding of goats. Raising Goats For Dummies is a one-stop reference for raising goats whether readers are caring for milk goats or meat goats.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Updates include:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;More information on miniature goats (Nigerian Dwarf, Pygmy, and crosses of larger breeds), which have gained in popularity, in part due to an increase in urban goats being allowed&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Instructions for building a milk stand would be helpful because all goat owners need one for trimming hooves and other routine tasks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;New section on taking your goat to birthday parties or day care (Currently page 135 addresses schools and nursing homes)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Using social media to find answers to questions and problems with goats. There are groups run by veterinarians, as well as some by experienced goatkeepers&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Changes to laws regarding drugs given to livestock and regarding selling goat milk (e.g. Oregon removed the prohibition of advertising&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Some really nice and easy milking machines have been invented since the book was published.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Updated prices for milk and fiber&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Virtual goat showing has become a thing since publication&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;New section in:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Making Money from Goats&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chapter about boarding goats for others&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="photovoltaicdesignandinstallationfordummies"&gt;&lt;a id="photovoltaicdesignandinstallationfordummies" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/photovoltaicdesignandinstallationfordummies_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651106~exp=1788737506~hmac=4354a732452c1377ac219ce63cb729c9f8565f93d86dd7bea7bbe0594033f254"&gt;Photovoltaic Design &amp; Installation For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c5a0f2b993053ed88db4eb13b6f1e58cce13d895.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f302820abf122eb4c750225b933c3190"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Photovoltaic Design &amp;amp; Installation For Dummies contains the basic knowledge necessary to understand the operation of solar-panel systems, including information on the electrical and mathematical concepts that are necessary to understand solar-panel systems. In addition, Readers can use this book to help study for the NABCEP exam and as a resource for courses on photovoltaics.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildingchickencoopsfordummies"&gt;&lt;a id="buildingchickencoopsfordummies" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/buildingchickencoopsfordummies_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651106~exp=1788737506~hmac=0feeef8e42e662d0067f4174b1279d79500816755b0964f6011e59b546b69613"&gt;Building Chicken Coops For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/446b95321e8f090a8b8181653af8214a4574d20b.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f9194ea6b8a3d66c92810e885c4cfbfe"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Building Chicken Coops For Dummies teaches readers the basic construction skills they need to design and build their own coops. Materials lists, instructions, and schematic plans for building a host of different chicken coops are all included in this comprehensive guide.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="growingyourownfruitandvegfordummiesukedition"&gt;&lt;a id="growingyourownfruitandvegfordummiesukedition" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/growingyourownfruitandvegfordummiesukedition_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651106~exp=1788737506~hmac=ba8e107111f82c0a526c2a2b65aa5136823103dddfdfb1fd99b349f5da22f4fc"&gt;Growing Your Own Fruit and Veg For Dummies, UK Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3952c4741fb2011b8b679770d49d72890491788f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=725c5dec83fad6eff590bfa3ad5d6e99"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A complete hands-on guide to growing delicious fruit and veg, this expert guide gives you the low-down on everything from assessing your plot and getting your hands on the right tools, to choosing the plants to grow, to nurturing your crops and bringing in your harvest. The For Dummies approach gives you clear, easy-to-follow expert advice, so you can get started in the garden right away, build your knowledge and confidence, and become a successful back garden or allotment gardener.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Growing Your Own Fruit &amp;amp; Veg For Dummies includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Part I: Getting Going With Growing&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chapter 1: Becoming a 'Grow Your Own' Gardener&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chapter 2: Assessing Your Territory&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chapter 3: Deciding What, When, and Where to Grow&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Part II: Preparing Your Plot&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chapter 4: Understanding and Maintaining Your Soil&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chapter 5: Feeding and watering your plants&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chapter 6: Growing Organic&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chapter 7: Spotting Signs of Trouble&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Part III: Growing tasty vegetables Chapter 8: Looking After Leaf Crops    &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chapter 9: Raising Root Crops&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chapter 10: Growing a Mediterranean Selection&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chapter 11: Planting Pods and Grains&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chapter 12: Becoming an Adventurous Gardener&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Part IV: Growing Your Own Fruit Salad&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chapter 13: Planting Quick-Growing Fruit&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chapter 14: Very Berry! - Growing Berries, Currants and Nuts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chapter 15: Caring for Slow-Growing Tree Fruit&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chapter 16: Growing Greenhouse Fruit&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chapter 17: Harvesting Your Wares&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Part V: The Part of Tens&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chapter 18: Ten Projects&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chapter 19: Ten Tips on Planting a Herb Garden&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chapter 20: Ten tips for Organic Growing&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="makingcandlesandsoapsfordummies"&gt;&lt;a id="makingcandlesandsoapsfordummies" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/makingcandlesandsoapsfordummies_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651106~exp=1788737506~hmac=5defedffb56c98081cae9b829adef26e19f78db8b2987bb8b1b793fb7781285a"&gt;Making Candles and Soaps For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6494032318d537eeacecc6714123ed61bf4cfe51.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=befa3b6d0f2c7b5f7caab9298eff1ddf"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Whether you're a beginner or seasoned craftsperson, this fun, fragrant book offers all the information to get started right away! With everything from the "how-tos" of candle making and soap making to a wealth of tips and information, this jam- packed guide combines two of the most popular crafts today! Making Candles &amp;amp; Soaps For Dummies will feature quick, inexpensive and fun ways to make your own candles and soap at a fraction of the cost of store-bought ones. Detailed step-by-step illustrations and photos help the reader follow along with ease. Full color insert will feature beautiful, bright colored candles and soap products you can make in your own home. Candle projects will cover a wide range of candle making and decorating techniques, including learning how to dye wax wonderful colors, pour it into unusually shaped molds, perfume it, model with it, and embed it with decorative objects.  In addition, create candles for the holidays, for entertaining, and gift giving. Learn how to even create floating candles for a pool or pond. Home soap making projects will cover directions for fragrant hand soaps of all shapes and sizes, inexpensive laundry soaps, leather soaps, medicinal soaps, shaving lather, liquid soaps, herbal soaps and shampoos.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="breadmakingfordummies"&gt;&lt;a id="breadmakingfordummies" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/breadmakingfordummies_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651106~exp=1788737506~hmac=e573e88a6dda2df68f738cbe2afc4447054462162e6a611eacb132dafec42e01"&gt;Bread Making For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3fd650c3a5be66b9dc0908e4806ca1e0be9ae1fe.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b877d8bb222646fdaa12569be6fddb70"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Craving fresh baked bread? Bread Making For Dummies has got you covered! With more than 65 mouth-watering recipes, you'll find so much more about how to make consistently delicious breads, from classic yeast breads to sourdough. to pretzels and sweet treats. Perhaps you've never cultured your own yeast and desire the freedom to add fermented breads to your weekly menu. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bread Making For Dummies will also cover no-knead and sourdough recipes that have become popular over the past decade. Get your butter knives ready, and discover how easy bread baking can be!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="electriccarsfordummies"&gt;&lt;a id="electriccarsfordummies" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/electriccarsfordummies_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651106~exp=1788737506~hmac=0d95c5e2d8df789a43043d13527078d099f78852387f8fdd271475bc4da7ab48"&gt;Electric Cars For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/53b377761bc35f7cce1c8424fb7f791b9feb860f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ebeaac373a6be8eabb015ab668e08e5b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Charge into the future in your electric car&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tired of paying higher gas prices or for regular maintenance on a gas-powered car? An electric vehicle may be the answer to your needs! Electric cars are gaining popularity as car prices come down, gas prices go up, and the need to reduce emissions becomes greater. This book is your fun and easy guide to the steps in buying and owning an electric car. From calculating total cost of ownership of an electric car vs a gas-powered vehicle to prepping your living space for an electric car's charging needs, this book demystifies electric car ownerships and answers all your electric car questions, even those you haven't thought to ask yet!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Inside...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Explore electric car options&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Set your purchase and maintenance budget&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Discover how and when to charge your vehicle&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Get to know how an electric car differs from a gas-powered vehicle&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Build a standard maintenance schedule&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Deal with charging emergencies&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Add solar to your charging options&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
