      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/96086f8302b87ad578dcc0313cddfda9959b2a79.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=60a11c910fe3e6fdc2bae8717d16aa69"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/29c825e9423f6aff763b79b487a9f59701d51117.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=695af3b27a7ccd6bd5e94724959a7d23"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Ace your tech exams with confidence&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;It’s time to level up your expertise in tech—develop the fundamental skills needed to prepare for career-changing exams with our latest Book Bundle. This comprehensive curriculum of first-time Humble Exclusives by Mammoth Club offers a variety of books like &lt;em&gt;Google Cloud Certified Generative AI Leader with Practice Exam&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Databricks Generative AI Engineer Associate with Practice Exam&lt;/em&gt;, and more. Ace your AWS, CompTIA, Microsoft Azure, and Google Cloud certification exams with confidence, and help support Children's Miracle Network today. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#comptiacloudnetxwith10practiceexams"&gt;CompTIA CloudNetX with 10 Practice Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#comptiaserverpluswith10practiceexams"&gt;CompTIA Server+ with 10 Practice Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt30"&gt;Pay $30 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#microsoftcertified_developingaiappsandagentsonazureai-103withpract"&gt;Microsoft Certified: Developing AI Apps and Agents on Azure (AI-103) with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#offensivesecuritycertifiedprofessionaloscpwithpracticeexam"&gt;Offensive Security Certified Professional (OSCP) with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#googlecloudcertifiedgenerativeaileaderwith10practiceexams"&gt;Google Cloud Certified Generative AI Leader with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#databricksgenerativeaiengineerassociatewithpracticeexam"&gt;Databricks Generative AI Engineer Associate with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cissp_informationsystemssecuritypro_practiceexams"&gt;Certified Information Systems Security Professional (CISSP) with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#googleprofessionalcloudarchitectgcp-pcawithpracticeexam"&gt;Google Professional Cloud Architect (GCP-PCA) with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#ceh_certifiedethicalhacker_practiceexams"&gt;Certified Ethical Hacker (CEH) with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#awscertifieddevopsengineerprofessionaldop-c02withpracticeexam"&gt;AWS Certified DevOps Engineer Professional (DOP-C02) with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#microsoftazureadministratoraz-104withpracticeexam"&gt;Microsoft Azure Administrator (AZ-104) with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#microsoftcertified_azureaifundamentalsai-901withpracticeexam"&gt;Microsoft Certified: Azure AI Fundamentals (AI-901) with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#databricks_dataengineerpro_practiceexams"&gt;Databricks Data Engineer Professional with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#expansivecomptiasecaipluscertificationprepwith2practiceexams"&gt;The Expansive CompTIA SecAI+ Certification Prep with 2 Practice Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#awscertifiedaipractitionerwithpracticeexam"&gt;AWS Certified AI Practitioner with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#awscertifiedgenerativeaideveloper_professionalwith10practiceexamsf"&gt;AWS Certified Generative AI Developer - Professional with 10 Practice Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#awscertifiedmachinelearningengineer_associatewith10practiceexamsfi"&gt;AWS Certified Machine Learning Engineer - Associate with 10 Practice Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#comptiapentestcertificationwith10practiceexams"&gt;CompTIA PenTest+ Certification with 10 Practice Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#awscertifiedsolutionsarchitect_associatewithpracticeexam"&gt;AWS Certified Solutions Architect - Associate with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#comptiasecurityxcertificationwith10exams"&gt;CompTIA SecurityX Certification with 10 Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#comptiacybersecurityanalystpluscertificationwith10practiceexams"&gt;CompTIA Cybersecurity Analyst+ Certification with 10 Practice Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#awscertifiedsolutionsarchitect_professionalwithpracticeexam"&gt;AWS Certified Solutions Architect - Professional with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#comptiaapluscertificationwith10exams"&gt;CompTIA A+ Certification with 10 Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#awscertifiedsecurity_specialtywithpracticeexam"&gt;AWS Certified Security - Specialty with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#definitivecomptiaprojectpluscertificationwith10practiceexams"&gt;The Definitive CompTIA Project+ Certification with 10 Practice Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#awscertifiedcloudopsengineer_associatefirst-timeexclusivehumblebun"&gt;AWS Certified CloudOps Engineer - Associate with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#completecomptiasecuritypluscertificationpathwith10practiceexams"&gt;The Complete CompTIA Security+ Certification Path with 10 Practice Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#awscertifiedadvancednetworking_specialtywithpracticeexam"&gt;AWS Certified Advanced Networking - Specialty with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#comptiasecotpluscertificationprepwithpracticeexam"&gt;CompTIA SecOT+ Certification Prep with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#definitivecomptianetworkpluscertificationcertificationwith10exams"&gt;Definitive CompTIA Network+ Certification Certification with 10 Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#awscertifiedcloudpractitionerwithpracticeexam"&gt;AWS Certified Cloud Practitioner with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#awscertifieddeveloper_associatewithpracticeexam"&gt;AWS Certified Developer - Associate with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#awscertifieddataengineer_associatedea-c01with10practiceexamsfirst"&gt;AWS Certified Data Engineer - Associate (DEA-C01) with 10 Practice Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#comptiadataxcertificationft10practiceexams"&gt;CompTIA DataX Certification ft 10 Practice Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#comptia_dataplus_10practiceexams"&gt;CompTIA Data+ with 10 Practice Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="comptiacloudnetxwith10practiceexams"&gt;&lt;a id="comptiacloudnetxwith10practiceexams"&gt;CompTIA CloudNetX with 10 Practice Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7424101820c70b1085a6ada3a5f3079e752ca329.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=590853494722f9f041b282a26e79fb3f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hybrid environments only work if the network connecting them actually holds up. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This 400+ page guide focuses on the connectivity skills that bridge on-prem and cloud systems into one working environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Connecting on-prem and cloud networks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► High-availability and load balancing design.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Network security across hybrid environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Troubleshooting complex connectivity issues.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anyone can build a cloud environment. Fewer people know how to connect it properly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exams with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;That's the gap this certification fills.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="comptiaserverpluswith10practiceexams"&gt;&lt;a id="comptiaserverpluswith10practiceexams"&gt;CompTIA Server+ with 10 Practice Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/46c7f7561ae27fae381208bd09b4eb50dc082622.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=bce52be720263e24cded22e91dd7434d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Someone has to keep the data center running long after the initial setup is done. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This 420+ page guide covers the hardware and software skills behind that work, from server architecture to disaster recovery.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Server hardware and storage systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Security for hybrid data centers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Disaster recovery and troubleshooting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Virtualization in enterprise environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Server administrators rarely get the spotlight, but they keep everything else standing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exams with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This one's built for the people who do that work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt30"&gt;Pay $30 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="microsoftcertified_developingaiappsandagentsonazureai-103withpract"&gt;&lt;a id="microsoftcertified_developingaiappsandagentsonazureai-103withpract"&gt;Microsoft Certified: Developing AI Apps and Agents on Azure (AI-103) with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b0c04b0d74e34df040872426ba9e7d5356a5b2a4.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6933f084e3b70e4a521f51f25fc10511"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Building an AI app is one skill. Designing an agent that can act on its own is a different one, and it's quickly becoming a core part of Azure development.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This guide covers the foundations the AI-103 certification is built around, from application design to agent behavior.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Core concepts behind AI app development on Azure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Designing and structuring intelligent agents.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Integrating AI services into working applications.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Principles for reliable, responsible AI behavior.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Agent-based AI development is still new enough that early certification holders stand out.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ First-time exclusive release.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Exam version: AI-103.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exam with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pick up this guide and get ahead of where Azure AI development is headed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="offensivesecuritycertifiedprofessionaloscpwithpracticeexam"&gt;&lt;a id="offensivesecuritycertifiedprofessionaloscpwithpracticeexam"&gt;Offensive Security Certified Professional (OSCP) with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b9bb805b852a5fb264bb71be738306d02a1c7eb7.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c07372d089e598fdb434c2b360d2f530"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Penetration testing under real pressure looks different from reading about it in isolation. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This guide breaks down the systematic thinking behind the OSCP, built around how professional engagements actually unfold.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll work through the same reasoning examiners expect, one methodical step at a time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► A repeatable methodology for enumeration and exploitation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Connecting scattered vulnerabilities into one attack path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Privilege escalation and pivoting across networks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Time management for demanding, hands-on assessments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;OSCP is respected because it tests execution, not just recall.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ First-time exclusive release&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exams with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Work through this guide and build the tradecraft the exam is designed to test.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="googlecloudcertifiedgenerativeaileaderwith10practiceexams"&gt;&lt;a id="googlecloudcertifiedgenerativeaileaderwith10practiceexams"&gt;Google Cloud Certified Generative AI Leader with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6b5b05072b8f305144a59f9faa764f1b813c1827.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4a3127f2b9b3891083e1e9f60dcd08fc"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Leading AI initiatives takes more than technical fluency. It takes the judgment to know where AI actually fits inside an organization.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This guide covers that judgment, built around the Generative AI Leader certification path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► What the certification path actually requires.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Core generative AI concepts and terminology.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Evaluating AI projects from a leadership perspective.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Applying generative AI across different industries.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Spotting where AI creates real strategic value.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Organizations need leaders who can separate genuine AI opportunity from hype.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ First-time exclusive release.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exams with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Start reading and build the strategic vocabulary this role demands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="databricksgenerativeaiengineerassociatewithpracticeexam"&gt;&lt;a id="databricksgenerativeaiengineerassociatewithpracticeexam"&gt;Databricks Generative AI Engineer Associate with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/22de4fc6e9e5c1ac3f3fc67e3fc96beed098ab2a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=220dadc90bf246bdf4d5d33e584256b0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Building generative AI applications on Databricks means juggling a specific set of tools, and this guide covers exactly which ones matter. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's built around the Databricks Certified Generative AI Engineer Associate exam.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Breaking down requirements before writing a single line.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Choosing the right models and frameworks for the job.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Key tools: Vector Search, Model Serving, and MLflow.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Designing and deploying RAG apps and LLM chains.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Data governance with Unity Catalog and semantic search.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Generative AI engineering on Databricks is a specific, in-demand skill set, not a generic AI credential.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ First-time exclusive release.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exams with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pick up this guide and start connecting the tools this role actually uses.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="cissp_informationsystemssecuritypro_practiceexams"&gt;&lt;a id="cissp_informationsystemssecuritypro_practiceexams"&gt;Certified Information Systems Security Professional (CISSP) with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ab8255ce771ca3529423b7b07fc945a563611e3e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=acb1b9a449cf734ac6718a36e6b1e1e2"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;CISSP asks you to think like the person responsible for an entire security program, not just one piece of it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This guide covers the management-level perspective the exam is built around.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Security governance, risk management, and compliance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Security architecture, engineering, and cryptography.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Identity and access management fundamentals.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Security assessments and SDLC integration.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;CISSP is often called the gold standard for a reason, it tests breadth as much as depth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ First-time exclusive release.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exams with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Read through this guide and start framing your experience the way the exam expects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="googleprofessionalcloudarchitectgcp-pcawithpracticeexam"&gt;&lt;a id="googleprofessionalcloudarchitectgcp-pcawithpracticeexam"&gt;Google Professional Cloud Architect (GCP-PCA) with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/05faa1e6c649fa6dfdc73a482be0ac6bff4f1152.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=920b5fc09babb0d95152fd13bbb732bc"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Designing Google Cloud solutions well means understanding a wide range of services and how they connect. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This guide covers what the Professional Cloud Architect exam actually tests.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From networking to deployment, it's built to give you the full picture.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Cloud fundamentals, VPC setup, and networking concepts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Identity-Aware Proxy and Managed Instance Groups.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Load balancing types and Cloud Armor security.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Cloud Deployment Manager and DNS best practices.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Stackdriver, GKE, serverless computing, and BigQuery.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cloud Architect is one of the more demanding Google Cloud certifications, and it rewards broad, practical knowledge.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ First-time exclusive release.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exams with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get this guide and prepare for the exam with the full picture in view.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="ceh_certifiedethicalhacker_practiceexams"&gt;&lt;a id="ceh_certifiedethicalhacker_practiceexams"&gt;Certified Ethical Hacker (CEH) with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ee2e0a1d5706efeb3ff53cf203226ba2c0eaedb2.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=352bbd78922fb2d4b7478f39ee1a9ced"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every phase of ethical hacking follows a logic, from the first bit of reconnaissance to the final report. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This guide walks through that logic using the same methods seen in real threats, applied legally.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Core methodologies for identifying vulnerabilities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Testing networks, applications, and endpoints.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Malware analysis and social engineering tactics.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Privilege escalation and lateral movement techniques.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Writing reports that communicate risk and remediation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;CEH validates that you can think like an attacker without becoming one.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ First-time exclusive release.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exams with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Start reading and sharpen the instincts this certification is built to test.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="awscertifieddevopsengineerprofessionaldop-c02withpracticeexam"&gt;&lt;a id="awscertifieddevopsengineerprofessionaldop-c02withpracticeexam"&gt;AWS Certified DevOps Engineer Professional (DOP-C02) with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ecafa0d6fad5e1ba90792aa962c0db2a252a6256.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3662c0ae26aecd5b62478388052b2e50"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;AWS Certified DevOps Engineer Professional (DOP-C02) with Practice Exam&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;DevOps on AWS touches automation, security, and monitoring all at once, and the DOP-C02 exam tests all of it. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This guide breaks that scope into pieces you can actually study.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► CI/CD pipelines with CodeCommit, CodeBuild, and CodeDeploy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Infrastructure as code with CloudFormation, ECS, and Lambda.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Monitoring and logging with CloudWatch and X-Ray.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Security automation with WAF, VPC, and compliance policies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Incident response and multi-region disaster recovery.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;DevOps Engineer Professional is one of the more demanding AWS certifications, and the scope reflects that.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ First-time exclusive release.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Exam version: DOP-C02.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exams with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Work through this guide and take the DOP-C02 with real preparation behind you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="microsoftazureadministratoraz-104withpracticeexam"&gt;&lt;a id="microsoftazureadministratoraz-104withpracticeexam"&gt;Microsoft Azure Administrator (AZ-104) with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b27e2ca2d2b294b065c73b7d20f9f1b410325f5a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4347a43524e5e05ed32f21788c15e845"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Administering Azure well means understanding identities, networks, and storage as one connected system, not separate topics. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This guide builds that understanding in the order the AZ-104 exam expects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Managing Azure identities and access.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Configuring and securing virtual networks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Deploying and managing Azure resources.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Storage solutions and hybrid network integration.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;AZ-104 is a common entry point into Azure administration roles, and a solid one.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ First-time exclusive release.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Exam version: AZ-104.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exam with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Start here and build toward the AZ-104 one Azure service at a time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="microsoftcertified_azureaifundamentalsai-901withpracticeexam"&gt;&lt;a id="microsoftcertified_azureaifundamentalsai-901withpracticeexam"&gt;Microsoft Certified: Azure AI Fundamentals (AI-901) with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5d7e4051a667812044bf6ce5c5bd77d43f665b3f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6edc83efb4d8164a5bf9e6a1234b80a9"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;AI is showing up in more cloud roles than ever, and AI Fundamentals is where a lot of people start proving they understand it. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This guide covers the core concepts and how they show up across Azure's AI services.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► AI workload types and considerations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Machine learning fundamentals on Azure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Computer vision features in Azure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Natural language processing capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Generative AI workloads on Azure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;AI-900 doesn't require a technical background, just a clear explanation of the concepts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ First-time exclusive release. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exams with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Begin here and build the foundation the rest of the Azure AI path depends on.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="databricks_dataengineerpro_practiceexams"&gt;&lt;a id="databricks_dataengineerpro_practiceexams"&gt;Databricks Data Engineer Professional with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8d65ba915e47c80808b89e2547a3eccdafbe8b5c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=206d638b98a702efeba6b3e18f0d741f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Basic ETL only gets you so far. The Professional level expects you to design data solutions, not just build them.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This guide covers the modeling, optimization, and governance work senior data engineers are actually responsible for.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Advanced data modeling and medallion architecture.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Deep optimization for Spark and Delta Lake.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Data governance and access control with Unity Catalog.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Troubleshooting production pipelines and performance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This certification is built for engineers making architectural decisions, not just writing pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ First-time exclusive release.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exams with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Read through this guide and prepare for the depth the exam actually expects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="expansivecomptiasecaipluscertificationprepwith2practiceexams"&gt;&lt;a id="expansivecomptiasecaipluscertificationprepwith2practiceexams"&gt;The Expansive CompTIA SecAI+ Certification Prep with 2 Practice Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c48981e079ac4eaa1890437a3b72fa39c1ea3fd3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6fbf05f76d83f0cdac723b5c6ad1826e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Artificial intelligence changed the threat landscape, and security teams need to catch up fast. This 400+ page guide walks you through the SecAI+ certification, built around the security challenges unique to AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll get a clear, structured path into a certification that barely existed a few years ago.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Recognizing AI-specific threats and attack surfaces.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Building defenses around machine learning pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Applying core security principles to AI-driven systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Preparing for real-world AI risk scenarios.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;AI security is one of the fastest-growing niches in the field, and early certification holders stand out.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exams with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pick up this guide and get ahead of a skill set most of the industry hasn't caught up to yet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="awscertifiedaipractitionerwithpracticeexam"&gt;&lt;a id="awscertifiedaipractitionerwithpracticeexam"&gt;AWS Certified AI Practitioner with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4c1c3b90cfe621f190f278ee8e3e217e7fa3b1f4.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=856d4df83c81fe786f719faf00e80c7b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;AI is no longer optional knowledge. Whether you are a developer, a manager, or transitioning into tech, understanding how AI works on AWS gives you a real edge.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This 300+ page book makes that knowledge accessible and exam-ready.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Core AI and ML concepts explained plainly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► AWS AI services: Rekognition, Comprehend, Bedrock, and more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Responsible and ethical AI on the AWS platform.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Applying AI solutions to real-world business scenarios.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You do not need a data science background to pass this exam. You just need the right resource.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Exam version: AIF-C01.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exam with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pick this up and start building your AI credentials today.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="awscertifiedgenerativeaideveloper_professionalwith10practiceexamsf"&gt;&lt;a id="awscertifiedgenerativeaideveloper_professionalwith10practiceexamsf"&gt;AWS Certified Generative AI Developer - Professional with 10 Practice Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b9d02c526e3d7a275fe61083a42492da562e019c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=da62472e8e548857c4ab1dd92acecfe3"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;The GenAI space is moving fast, and this is your guide to staying ahead of it. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Written for professionals who want to go beyond the basics and prove their expertise in building generative AI solutions on AWS.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;► Prompt engineering and model customization&lt;br&gt;► RAG architecture and knowledge base integration&lt;br&gt;► Deploying and managing foundation models on Bedrock&lt;br&gt;► Responsible AI and security best practices on AWS&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;✔️ First-time exclusive release&lt;br&gt;✔️ Exam version: AIP-C01&lt;br&gt;✔️ Includes 1 online practice exam with unlimited attempts&lt;br&gt;✔️ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This book gives you everything you need to walk into the exam with confidence, not guesswork.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Get certified and position yourself at the cutting edge of AI on AWS.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="awscertifiedmachinelearningengineer_associatewith10practiceexamsfi"&gt;&lt;a id="awscertifiedmachinelearningengineer_associatewith10practiceexamsfi"&gt;AWS Certified Machine Learning Engineer - Associate with 10 Practice Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/47e33dc1c873db3ba3597bd4ccbb34d53112c608.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=27cd54fee69bc59c9665749c4c635bb8"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Machine learning on AWS is about more than building models. It's about getting them into production, keeping them monitored, and making sure they're secure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This associate-level course covers the full workflow from data to deployment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Data Preparation and Ingestion for ML on AWS&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Model Development and Generative AI integration&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Deployment and workflow Orchestration&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Monitoring, Security, and Governance in production&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✔️ Lifetime access to all modules&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✔️ 10 practice exams with unlimited attempts&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The ML Engineer Associate is the credential that says you can take ML from idea to production on AWS. This course helps you earn it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build your AWS ML engineering credential. Start today.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="comptiapentestcertificationwith10practiceexams"&gt;&lt;a id="comptiapentestcertificationwith10practiceexams"&gt;CompTIA PenTest+ Certification with 10 Practice Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d5b840fd795eca9c4f1536da5864be5a6f55ed99.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=dd9a065d09fb96b59254fee2dd51b1d0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every system has a weakness, and someone has to find it before the bad actors do. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This 230 page book walks you through the mindset and methods behind ethical hacking, built around the PenTest+ certification.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll move from scanning for vulnerabilities to writing the kind of report a client actually wants to read.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Vulnerability scanning techniques and tools.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Exploitation methods used in real assessments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Writing clear, professional pentest reports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Legal and ethical boundaries of the job.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Offensive security roles are competitive, and a PenTest+ credential is one way to stand apart.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exams with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grab this guide and start thinking like the person companies hire to break in first.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="awscertifiedsolutionsarchitect_associatewithpracticeexam"&gt;&lt;a id="awscertifiedsolutionsarchitect_associatewithpracticeexam"&gt;AWS Certified Solutions Architect - Associate with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/727e3af0902acd88c770fdb43399b11e3a0dca24.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=cb1606e071da8457ce519c0ac729a726"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Designing cloud systems on AWS starts with understanding the fundamentals. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This 500+ page book walks you through them clearly and gives you the tools to prove your skills on exam day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Core AWS services: EC2, S3, RDS, VPC, and more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► High availability and fault-tolerant architecture design.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Cost optimization and performance best practices.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Identity, access management, and security on AWS.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The SAA-C03 is one of the most recognized certifications in cloud. Let this book be what gets you across the finish line.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Exam version: SAA-C03.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exam with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grab your copy and start building the knowledge that opens doors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="comptiasecurityxcertificationwith10exams"&gt;&lt;a id="comptiasecurityxcertificationwith10exams"&gt;CompTIA SecurityX Certification with 10 Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5ceedbb5e24b610f9dfab07e750984d9cb6b343c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=688ed22976d278813495fd21f301ca86"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;SecurityX sits at the top of the CompTIA security track, and this 230+ page guide is built for the practitioners who work there. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's written for people already comfortable with security fundamentals and ready for harder problems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Designing security architecture at enterprise scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Governance frameworks for complex organizations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Risk management and compliance strategy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Advanced, scenario-based problem solving.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Few certifications validate senior-level security thinking the way SecurityX does.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exams with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you're aiming for architect or leadership roles, this preparation gets you there.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="comptiacybersecurityanalystpluscertificationwith10practiceexams"&gt;&lt;a id="comptiacybersecurityanalystpluscertificationwith10practiceexams"&gt;CompTIA Cybersecurity Analyst+ Certification with 10 Practice Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/df3bbb3136d6cf6e96b31c79989cd30f882785be.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=78a8e33e37bedb845645ce1149fcc527"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Spotting a threat is only half the job. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This 200+ page guide covers the analytical side of cybersecurity, where CySA+ certified professionals interpret data and catch problems before they escalate.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Gathering and applying threat intelligence.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Responding to and containing incidents.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Vulnerability management and reporting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Meeting compliance and regulatory requirements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Blue team roles need people who can read between the lines of raw data.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exams with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Work through this material and build the analytical instincts the exam is actually testing for.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="awscertifiedsolutionsarchitect_professionalwithpracticeexam"&gt;&lt;a id="awscertifiedsolutionsarchitect_professionalwithpracticeexam"&gt;AWS Certified Solutions Architect - Professional with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d1e4cf651ea1132d061fece9ab44a2d82e1aacdb.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5f73ff9e14e9fedc5325f1d0ff915cd7"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;You have already got the fundamentals. Now it is time to level up. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This 480+ book is built for architects who want to tackle the most complex AWS design challenges and earn one of the most respected credentials in the cloud industry.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Advanced multi-account and hybrid architecture design.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Migration strategies and workload modernization.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Cost governance at enterprise scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Disaster recovery planning and resilience patterns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Professional level is where architects separate themselves from the crowd. This is your guide to getting there.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Exam version: SAP-C02.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exam with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take on the SAP-C02 with the preparation it actually demands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="comptiaapluscertificationwith10exams"&gt;&lt;a id="comptiaapluscertificationwith10exams"&gt;CompTIA A+ Certification with 10 Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a34b93fb1e2fc667db2ec85c08b90d416dcba9d1.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c0e81a7abda16a8a31a90a82b3c4ad98"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;IT careers tend to start in the same place, fixing what's broken and figuring out why. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This 1290+ page guide covers the ground every technician needs to know, built around the A+ Core 1 and Core 2 exams.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Mobile devices and operating systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Networking fundamentals and troubleshooting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Hardware installation and repair.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Virtualization and cloud basics.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A+ shows up on more entry-level job postings than almost any other certification.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exams with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get ready to add it to your resume.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="awscertifiedsecurity_specialtywithpracticeexam"&gt;&lt;a id="awscertifiedsecurity_specialtywithpracticeexam"&gt;AWS Certified Security - Specialty with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/00a0513860a7749e7839a1da04dca4fcd2ac1302.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b182f596629da6b042224422741d76d7"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Security is not a feature you bolt on at the end. It is something you design from the start. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This 490+ page book is for engineers and architects who want to build secure AWS environments and prove it with one of the most respected specialty certifications available.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Identity and access control with IAM and Organizations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Data protection, encryption, and key management with KMS.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Threat detection using GuardDuty, Macie, and Security Hub.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Incident response and compliance frameworks on AWS.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cloud security expertise is not just valuable. It is critical. This certification puts that on your resume with credibility.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Exam version: SCS-C03.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exam with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get the book and start preparing for the SCS-C03 today.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="definitivecomptiaprojectpluscertificationwith10practiceexams"&gt;&lt;a id="definitivecomptiaprojectpluscertificationwith10practiceexams"&gt;The Definitive CompTIA Project+ Certification with 10 Practice Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/026d5874ba0f0c26e4f7899e9cfe2835efd769ad.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d5b0f38ce4e5ed76e973b1e822a34777"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Project+ is CompTIA's project management certification, and this course prepares you for it - from fundamentals to exam day. Across 5 sections, you will move through the full scope of what the exam tests: project planning, communication, team management, quality, risk, and procurement. No guessing what to study.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;► Project fundamentals, methodology, and charters&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;► Timelines, budgets, resources, and calendars&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;► Communication strategies and management skills&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;► Risk, procurement, quality control, and project closure This is a well-rounded certification that holds value across industries.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;✅ 10 graded practice exams with unlimited attempts The structured content here gets you ready chapter by chapter. Put in the work and walk out with a credential that speaks for itself.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="awscertifiedcloudopsengineer_associatefirst-timeexclusivehumblebun"&gt;&lt;a id="awscertifiedcloudopsengineer_associatefirst-timeexclusivehumblebun"&gt;AWS Certified CloudOps Engineer - Associate with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ff8961074417fb229c964f9c1f762aa3b814c40f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d0459a2a52349883fb8e6ceeeef83916"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Keeping cloud infrastructure running smoothly is a discipline in itself. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This book is your guide to mastering AWS operations, from monitoring and automation to incident management, and walking into the SOA-C03 fully prepared.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;► Infrastructure monitoring with CloudWatch and CloudTrail&lt;br&gt;► Automating operations with Systems Manager and EventBridge&lt;br&gt;► Managing deployments and rollbacks with AWS tools&lt;br&gt;► Reliability, backup, and disaster recovery strategies&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;✔️ First-time exclusive release&lt;br&gt;✔️ Exam version: SOA-C03&lt;br&gt;✔️ Includes 1 online practice exam with unlimited attempts&lt;br&gt;✔️ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Operations work is what keeps everything else running. This book gives that work the recognition it deserves.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Pick it up and make the SOA-C03 your next certification.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="completecomptiasecuritypluscertificationpathwith10practiceexams"&gt;&lt;a id="completecomptiasecuritypluscertificationpathwith10practiceexams"&gt;The Complete CompTIA Security+ Certification Path with 10 Practice Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/652fd6d828d3d6b39fa02c2296b43fda9ff5facd.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=78ee21c199954bc00ffd6f7b0c280e15"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Security+ is where most cybersecurity careers officially begin. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This 360+ page guide covers the core concepts behind today's security landscape, from threats and attacks to identity management.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Identifying threats, attacks, and vulnerabilities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Identity and access management basics.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Cryptography and secure network design.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Risk management and security operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Security+ opens more doors than almost any other entry point into the field.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exams with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Start with this book and walk into the exam room prepared, not just hopeful.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="awscertifiedadvancednetworking_specialtywithpracticeexam"&gt;&lt;a id="awscertifiedadvancednetworking_specialtywithpracticeexam"&gt;AWS Certified Advanced Networking - Specialty with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/015c3eb5c799d549071a8d2167348b3e14590baf.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5bebe7ebeea5b3451865db6f296f2d91"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Networking at scale on AWS is a different game. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This 590+ book is written for engineers who need to go deep on connectivity, routing, and network security across complex, multi-region AWS environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► VPC design, peering, Transit Gateway, and hybrid connectivity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► DNS management with Route 53 and advanced routing policies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Network security with WAF, Shield, and Network Firewall.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Optimizing performance and troubleshooting at scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Advanced networking knowledge is rare and highly valued. Earning this specialty certification puts you in a strong position.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Exam version: ANS-C01.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exam with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dive into the book and start preparing for the ANS-C01.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="comptiasecotpluscertificationprepwithpracticeexam"&gt;&lt;a id="comptiasecotpluscertificationprepwithpracticeexam"&gt;CompTIA SecOT+ Certification Prep with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1080c676dcc6f48191416c3ee35f1f4b1f850fe3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9f33eddb3782f76bf9afccf43429dbf9"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Somewhere between IT and the physical world sits operational technology, and it needs its own kind of security thinking. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This 700+ page guide covers the specialized world of ICS and SCADA networks that keep infrastructure running.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Securing industrial control systems and SCADA.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Protecting physical hardware and manufacturing lines.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Risk management for operational environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Bridging IT security with OT infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;OT security is a narrow field with outsized demand.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes 1 practice exam with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This resource gives you the depth to work in it with confidence.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="definitivecomptianetworkpluscertificationcertificationwith10exams"&gt;&lt;a id="definitivecomptianetworkpluscertificationcertificationwith10exams"&gt;Definitive CompTIA Network+ Certification Certification with 10 Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/693cedc94d89da9b34ac1fad1c94957b33b37254.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a3f9812957d73df0a68919302131af8d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nothing on the internet works without a network holding it together somewhere. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Spanning 400+ pages, this guide takes you from basic cabling to the kind of troubleshooting real networks demand.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► IP addressing and subnetting fundamentals.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Routing and switching protocols.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Network security essentials.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Cabling, hardware, and architecture basics.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Whether it's a home router or an enterprise switch stack, the fundamentals stay the same.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exams with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Make sure you actually know them before exam day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="awscertifiedcloudpractitionerwithpracticeexam"&gt;&lt;a id="awscertifiedcloudpractitionerwithpracticeexam"&gt;AWS Certified Cloud Practitioner with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b8c2ceb2db85302923ea0d5cdedb6b608f6ea7f2.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=387f6acdb10f18c1e4c9b7bb3df9ef3d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every cloud journey starts somewhere. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you are new to AWS, this is the 370+ page book that lays the groundwork clearly, so you can pass the exam and actually understand what you are working with going forward.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► AWS global infrastructure and core service overview.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Billing, pricing models, and cost management basics.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Cloud security fundamentals and the shared responsibility model.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Support plans, compliance, and governance on AWS.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The CLF-C02 is the entry point to the AWS certification path. There is no better time to start than now.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Exam version: CLF-C02.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exam with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Download your copy and take that first step into cloud.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="awscertifieddeveloper_associatewithpracticeexam"&gt;&lt;a id="awscertifieddeveloper_associatewithpracticeexam"&gt;AWS Certified Developer - Associate with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8a086301eeb7e65d2ef022dfbb70196eea0a6cb3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b2f75c3cf964c7e0f01617ceeaf13779"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Building applications on AWS takes more than just writing code. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It takes knowing which services to use, how to connect them, and how to make them work reliably. This 360+ page book covers all of it in a way that sticks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Developing and deploying serverless applications on AWS.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Working with Lambda, API Gateway, DynamoDB, and SQS.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Authentication, authorization, and Cognito integration.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Debugging, monitoring, and CI/CD with AWS developer tools.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Developers who understand the full AWS ecosystem are rare. This book helps you become one.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Exam version: DVA-C02.1.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exam with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Add this to your reading list and make the DVA-C02 your next win.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="awscertifieddataengineer_associatedea-c01with10practiceexamsfirst"&gt;&lt;a id="awscertifieddataengineer_associatedea-c01with10practiceexamsfirst"&gt;AWS Certified Data Engineer - Associate (DEA-C01) with 10 Practice Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/11e387fb8a0311c109bfa601d7428720022d2c40.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=7884ae80d94cb51a1b7485562973ff90"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The DEA-C01 tests whether you can build and manage data systems on AWS end to end.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This course covers all four exam domains so you know ingestion, storage, operations, and governance equally well.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Ingestion and Transformation with AWS data tools&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Data Store Management across AWS services&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Operations and Support for running data pipelines&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Security and Governance for compliant data systems&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✔️ Lifetime access to all modules&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✔️ 10 practice exams with unlimited attempts&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Data engineering on AWS is a skill with real demand behind it. This course gives you a clear, structured path to getting certified.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your DEA-C01 prep starts here. Enroll now.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="comptiadataxcertificationft10practiceexams"&gt;&lt;a id="comptiadataxcertificationft10practiceexams"&gt;CompTIA DataX Certification ft 10 Practice Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/55513c4be9171b6c0e9e02709723d73ab81ed021.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=85f835162732dbb402f4e55118f5fa82"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;DataX is built for people who've already moved past the basics of data work. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This 290+ page guide dives into the advanced side of data science and engineering that the certification is designed to test.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Advanced analytics and statistical methods.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Machine learning concepts for data teams.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Designing scalable data architecture.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Applying data science to real business problems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Few certifications go this deep into applied data science.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes online practice exams with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you're ready for that level, this one meets you there.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="comptia_dataplus_10practiceexams"&gt;&lt;a id="comptia_dataplus_10practiceexams"&gt;CompTIA Data+ with 10 Practice Exams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1caa52dbf445050a37442a6116c379bcb368c7c1.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=71728ca22effbee9a13fd725e8a8c655"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Data only becomes useful once someone knows how to read it. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; This 380+ page guide walks through the full lifecycle of data analysis, from collection to the kind of visualization that actually informs a decision.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; ► Data mining and analysis techniques.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; ► Visualization tools for clear reporting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; ► Statistical methods for decision making.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; ► Turning raw numbers into business insight.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Spreadsheets can only take an analysis so far.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; ✅ Includes online practice exams with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; ✅ Downloadable in PDF and EPUB for offline reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Go further, and back it with a certification that proves it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
