      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a424cae8c118aa38710326fd281d820ddd7d95a0.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=51b4d74b1e83929d13f7a2acfb970b7c"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a3f283e0bcbad307bb9123aaa0d6ffc8c0a70948.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=29f32b41e3d8df2d7acd1e8122a4d068"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Step into a world forged in steam and iron and tempered by war&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;In Warmachine the earth shakes during fierce confrontations between six-ton constructs of iron and steel clash with the devastating force of a locomotive, towering warbeasts hurl themselves at their foes in a frenzy of claw and fang, and bold heroes set the battlefield ablaze with with a tempest of of arcane magic as they forge the fate of nations in the fires of destruction. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Immerse yourself in Warmachine lore with this bundle of novels and short story anthologies, set in iconic locations and telling the stories of heroes, villains, and some of the Iron Kingdoms' most pivotal events. Collect each volume of the Iron Kingdoms Excursions, Warcaster Chronicles, Warlock Sagas, and Called to Battle series and more as you learn the backstories of key characters like The Butcher of Khardov and encounter a wealth of different peoples and cultures. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Grab this 41-ebook bundle at the price of your choice, and support the Child's Play charity with your purchase! &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Also returning by popular demand is a collection of 65 Iron Kingdoms RPG (IKRPG) items, including core and source books for the Full Metal Fantasy and 5e editions, GM toolkits, bestiary's, and maps, first presented in the March 2025 Iron Kingdoms Humble Bundle.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A world of adventure and full metal fantasy awaits in the Iron Kingdoms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#thewarlocksagas_vol1_instrumentsofwar"&g