n 1, Volume 5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#ironkingdomsexcursionsseason1volume6"&gt;Iron Kingdoms Excursions, Season 1, Volume 6&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#ironkingdomsexcursionsseason2volume1"&gt;Iron Kingdoms Excursions, Season 2, Volume 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#ironkingdomsexcursionsseason2volume2"&gt;Iron Kingdoms Excursions, Season 2, Volume 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#ironkingdomsexcursionsseason2volume3"&gt;Iron Kingdoms Excursions, Season 2, Volume 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#ironkingdomsexcursionsseason2volume4"&gt;Iron Kingdoms Excursions, Season 2, Volume 4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#ironkingdomsexcursionsseason2volume5"&gt;Iron Kingdoms Excursions, Season 2, Volume 5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#thebloodofkings"&gt;The Blood of Kings&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#wrathofthedragonfather"&gt;Wrath of the Dragonfather&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#godless"&gt;Godless&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#noquarteranthologyvolume1"&gt;No Quarter Anthology, Volume 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#noquarteranthologyvolume2"&gt;No Quarter Anthology, Volume 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#calledtobattle_vol1"&gt;Called To Battle, Volume 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#calledtobattle_vol2"&gt;Called To Battle, Volume 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#worthyvessel"&gt;Worthy Vessel&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#facevalue"&gt;Face Value&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#throughthedarkestoftimes"&gt;Through The Darkness: The Story of Machinations&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#scarsofcaen"&gt;The Scars of Caen&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#wickedways"&gt;Wicked Ways&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#ritesofpassage"&gt;Rites of Passage&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#movingtargets"&gt;Moving Targets&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#nightofthenecrotech"&gt;The Night of the Necrotech&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt60"&gt;Pay $60 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#ironkingdomscollectionbysteamforged"&gt;Iron Kingdoms Collection by Steamforged&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="thewarlocksagas_vol1_instrumentsofwar"&gt;&lt;a id="thewarlocksagas_vol1_instrumentsofwar" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/thewarlocksagas_vol1_instrumentsofwar_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=f7c5ff397928ca916c9c5ccd6161a6fed677206a3deb3219e4506a2d6de41944"&gt;Instruments of War&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/af953232ec03fc9459a7f25734b095277e7185b4.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a25ce82ba91e09cd61185a64d3fa4851"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The first release in the Warlock Saga series, Instruments of War tells the story of Supreme Archdominar Makeda's early years and rise to power, before the coming of the Conqueror.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="thewarlocksagas_vol2_mutagenesis"&gt;&lt;a id="thewarlocksagas_vol2_mutagenesis" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/thewarlocksagas_vol2_mutagenesis_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=3c6319350f6fba8718243cc49a397993d7f0319d4cf129e3392e7a9b7b428586"&gt;Mutagenesis&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/81162d0d155f14de265c02bed16a57c447fcc9f6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=7c37be78612a5ba73509dd776c81d770"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The second release in the Warlock Saga series, Mutagenesis tells the story of Thagrosh's orgins, as he escapes Khador only to fall under the spell of Everblight.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="thewayofcaine"&gt;&lt;a id="thewayofcaine" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/thewayofcaine_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=b1cd168be2071d2585c459fbe0579124b2afe48cb9085d9b0c1d9e8efcff4509"&gt;The Way of Caine&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b17fb728ef19c75b24077c4c8908720bf2cb4f27.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a3892ac3efc46ff158eca6b594eed8bd"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The first volume of the Warcaster Chronicles, and first in the Hellslingers series. The Way of Caine follows the dogged Cygnaran warcaster's early career and exploits.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="thebutcherofkhardov"&gt;&lt;a id="thebutcherofkhardov" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/thebutcherofkhardov_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=2d57f6e8b1ea94b7e32b8c17ca33b643ef98738ef4ef841118e5a214ba69842f"&gt;The Butcher of Khardov&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/76ea54a04a354a06e254bc89f7eed06469c793e8.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=aff206d6db3713198653d04324819d30"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The second volume of the Warcaster Chronicles, The Butcher of Khardov follows the fan favourite Khadoran warcaster of the same name and explores his origins story.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="bloodandiron"&gt;&lt;a id="bloodandiron" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/bloodandiron_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=5c0efe47b35f3dd146d032ccffcc9017798bbc8aa79c614fe5df3a464f391cbf"&gt;Blood &amp; Iron&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/623f0641c8ae867fdcbf80b5ada9776e8f69e82a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3f89d9f51ca14e4813bc382ba730437e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The third volume of the Warcaster Chronicles, Blood &amp;amp; Iron follows Talion Charter warcaster Phinneus Shae, and serves as the first part in the Privateers series.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="wyrmbane"&gt;&lt;a id="wyrmbane" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/wyrmbane_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=e6095c0258e5882544f5a88cf299d9d920eee8d716261d7384016ec9736cf54a"&gt;Wyrmbane&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/739d93348113d5e8fa7a1c3bf16b998ad6016a47.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=8291314eae6c379ada0e69e4f780bee5"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The fourth volume of the Warcaster Chronicles, featuring Lich Lord Venethrax, Toruk's agent tasked with hunting down reports of Toruk's spawn on the mainland.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="devilspay"&gt;&lt;a id="devilspay" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/devilspay_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=d52712f66f274cf3dbaa247ce3495305ae8945a5f7a266567c063d964f8e6a00"&gt;The Devil's Pay&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8f513115027f0cbacacece8f4bede88d0cb1c2de.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=8a02b0f86f29850c5291bde98c370de2"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;First part of the Dogs of War series, this novel follows the Devil Dogs mercenary company as they search for a mysterious warjack in the dangerous Wythmoor region.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="darkconvergence"&gt;&lt;a id="darkconvergence" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/darkconvergence_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=e1fc879b0d005c931eec3b7d25b82950b2008e8ad63a92cb79e8bad0b5ff9ede"&gt;Dark Convergence&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/392c95ebf3d8386be54a47e5bce33a38cfa7d1b6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ba929a8d602b21c991b56a334947e6bc"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Second part of the Dogs of War series, this novel features Sebastan Nemo as he attempts to disrupt the Convergence of Cyriss' great work and comes into conflict with his estranged daughter, Aurora.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="murderincorvis"&gt;&lt;a id="murderincorvis"&gt;Murder in Corvis&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6152afe6d445984ccacab035db3598d056c7e99a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e8452037d06357653c996afceab107d9"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A mystery novel where the Black River Irregulars mercenary group are hired to track down a brutal killer stalking the dark undercity tunnels of Corvis&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="atwhatcost"&gt;&lt;a id="atwhatcost" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/atwhatcost_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=4d546b71cd92889f318e0f4d42f215fa73a2d879bdb310ee7b6f392339347584"&gt;At What Cost&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/fec214303765e2f7216c68f59d790cba3e5c98fd.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ecb5815e03f272921a6044405f369653"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A powerful standalone novel which explores Victoria Hayley's recovery after being poisoned in an encounter with her corrupted twin sister, Deneghra.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="extraordinaryzoology"&gt;&lt;a id="extraordinaryzoology" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/extraordinaryzoology_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=feb4b1d92ddd0dd41273bdb906bd97ba3e512f23a678eb193a06050207459340"&gt;Extraordinary Zoology&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1032add3db12af410ec9164cbc9acf1fc43758da.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f960e5e92ef5286015c394b2b236fc57"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The first release in the Tales from the Monsternomicon series, Extraordinary Zoology follows Victor Pendrake, Lynus Wesselbaum, and Iosan Edrea Lloryrr as they investigate a mysterious attack by an unknown beast.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="thehellslingers_vol1_markofcaine"&gt;&lt;a id="thehellslingers_vol1_markofcaine" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/thehellslingers_vol1_markofcaine_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=b68be1de373d9509149b696640e124f27b8e5bc974b1e20d9ab766fba668cc17"&gt;Mark of Caine&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8c2bd40f91044fd47f649d4b87a55da5cee8db00.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c9a092f8b4aac2f4335aa939a7cc8a31"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The second volume in the Hellslingers series, Mark of Caine follows the newly outlawed warcaster as attempts to clear his name of the crimes committed by the msyterious Hellslinger Phantom.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="theprivateers_vol1_waterygraves"&gt;&lt;a id="theprivateers_vol1_waterygraves" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/theprivateers_vol1_waterygraves_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=7838d03c7b11d9d07c2954f425356519d37295ffa1a6b6f13c817c44a0ab139a"&gt;Watery Graves&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d54b0339f7757ebfef52ccc7c5cf82afc48a5305.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=380683c245e4a9719ea2a834fac06335"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The second story in the Privateers series, Captain Phinneus Shae and the crew of the Talion are hired to salvage a mysterious cargo barrel from a wrecked ship, buy they aren't the only interested party…&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="bloodinthewater"&gt;&lt;a id="bloodinthewater" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/bloodinthewater_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=763ce66b231c531618459d7c55e10797b8abc4dfb4e5cf1325c1b4abe072ac85"&gt;Blood in the Water&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3215a074d85c2ee1458d44cadfb0a85064bdb3d0.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3d971e462e51bb031f9a0f71f236495e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The first release in the Unleashed Legends series, Blood in the Water features the bounty hunter characters Longchops and Alten Ashley.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="sacredcharge"&gt;&lt;a id="sacredcharge" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/sacredcharge_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=940277460b2c1e82ea73cb6f689c399b1a82738ce4621fde1e3d33d454a57bd9"&gt;Sacred Charge&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6fcc211411605866c2fc421ee61550df9e0cf7bb.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=72464c68379e8a9f28491170de326798"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The second release in the Unleashed Legends series, Sacred Charge features the Skorne and a navigation of the morality of sacral stones.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt30"&gt;Pay $30 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="ironkingdomsexcursionsseason1volume1"&gt;&lt;a id="ironkingdomsexcursionsseason1volume1" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/ironkingdomsexcursionsseason1volume1_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=bd1b1d7c20856869f8e4fc34f7fe390b5df9c4e21582db1e7dbae4cf78ad7bad"&gt;Iron Kingdoms Excursions, Season 1, Volume 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/51020a0df47f5a5a8c88631246019e4289fdf06e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2b2c1250922df7795f506bcdbb218e5e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A compilation of tales set in the classic Iron Kingdoms setting, featuring the Llaelese Reistance, Searforge Commission, and the Retribution of Scyrah.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="ironkingdomsexcursionsseason1volume2"&gt;&lt;a id="ironkingdomsexcursionsseason1volume2" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/ironkingdomsexcursionsseason1volume2_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=7460c1da6272bb54e683f295f2b6e04631b0a71c820ee5f29f7cf56a931d7df8"&gt;Iron Kingdoms Excursions, Season 1, Volume 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8d97d2cf20d1b176b34db26c8ce60716de92bcc1.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=403cebf46c85820af035b053368a6f9b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A compilation of tales set in the classic Iron Kingdoms setting, featuring Cygnar, Circle Oroboros, and the Skorne.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="ironkingdomsexcursionsseason1volume3"&gt;&lt;a id="ironkingdomsexcursionsseason1volume3" href="https://cd