3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a40713f1dcb413520a8d5dad7f3a22a3be85ebcb.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c51dc96cd2330dd9b3df3677cc88d9ab"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A compilation of tales set in the classic Iron Kingdoms setting, featuring Khador, Cryx, and the Circle Oroboros.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="thebloodofkings"&gt;&lt;a id="thebloodofkings" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/thebloodofkings_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=a40a2a7ed9440f5c9b409cf92136dfde61d6056064fb6c67c660d985e7b6fe75"&gt;The Blood of Kings&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/67b368f2ed79778a3043e23ba0d8a0f8a304621d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=8bea9be6a94acd5142737828c99609e0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A thrilling standalone novel that dives into the events around Vinter Raelthorne and the second Cygnaran Civil War. Essential reading for the Hellslingers series after Way of Caine!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="wrathofthedragonfather"&gt;&lt;a id="wrathofthedragonfather" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/wrathofthedragonfather_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=9b540df78165e7b5504566bea112179af25d0dc59adbea2b3e82d321c3859680"&gt;Wrath of the Dragonfather&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/82f41888e3fdfd7309740619f127d1c4ddbf8c9a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a3d620770ff5bc6a5b511eedbfac9b19"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A must read for fans of the setting, this novella depicts a continent-shaking conflict centered on the reappearance of Toruk, the Dragonfather, on the mainland of Western Immoren as he pursues the athanc of his most powerful spawn.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="godless"&gt;&lt;a id="godless" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/godless_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=98fa49e521857a7f9d5f8dd55f071b50ceaace15684d599617d4eeac08fcabfc"&gt;Godless&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/320dd3ffe819dc67837e41e7e3f6baad8c177134.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=cfcf52636f2924591ea491dc3175e7dc"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The first volume of the Fires of Faith series, following Tristain Durant and the Skorne siege of Imer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="noquarteranthologyvolume1"&gt;&lt;a id="noquarteranthologyvolume1" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/noquarteranthologyvolume1_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=52170bb1330a5db17ddf6cfe3f6ea1becfbabe9ef147937dd1be207cdb27a5f6"&gt;No Quarter Anthology, Volume 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6295f50fd870e40cd225f962d532e266661807de.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=50082f7d543a4900f939a1fdbfd7118f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The first anthology of exciting stories from the pages of No Quarter Magazine, set in the classic Iron Kingdoms setting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="noquarteranthologyvolume2"&gt;&lt;a id="noquarteranthologyvolume2" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/noquarteranthologyvolume2_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=aa1f1a0b52cd63f9d04fc2344e1e47690a9f90e147d61aaf5122335e6a22325e"&gt;No Quarter Anthology, Volume 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4c87151f57f59ea8bcefccfa219131be3fa09168.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4c075d2c09578529573b54f39c7c041f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The second anthology of exciting stories from the pages of No Quarter Magazine, set in the classic Iron Kingdoms setting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="calledtobattle_vol1"&gt;&lt;a id="calledtobattle_vol1" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/calledtobattle_vol1_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=7a57f37f89002861e2dbb44c0d846ca9f766c53058e95d07835fe404bf46ac52"&gt;Called To Battle, Volume 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/cfd