fe8fd61faaadf660dee4037dd70203530f3e54c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=cda1fc1cd68480814add96087c7019a9"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A standalone short story in the Called to Battle series, following the Cryxian necromancer Darragh Wrathe as he tries to overcome the frailties of his rotting flesh.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="throughthedarkestoftimes"&gt;&lt;a id="throughthedarkestoftimes" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/throughthedarkestoftimes_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=a984d86c80bbd0150365ccaf705e51dbc13ea0eba68e4738be96848c661a099b"&gt;Through The Darkness: The Story of Machinations&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bc41f9825f7c56226bf2cee2c2b707d16448c346.png?auto=compress,format&amp;w=180&amp;s=16dcebff55313976b51f7eb806e43957"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/aeae5cc1f58552656b3e2cd77807433c36fbef6f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4c2e8ae6f400a791bccf289cab874c0c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Through the Darkness is the compilation of stories from the 2013 Organised Play League for Warmachine and Hordes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="scarsofcaen"&gt;&lt;a id="scarsofcaen" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/scarsofcaen_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=32414416648eadbb3e6554fb94a214fc2863ee483fed3d2e08f69baa086cb3e0"&gt;The Scars of Caen&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/13f3afb9270cb8193db9c69a7dc7acbec0a7d783.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=fe3acaf08d41907ca059d60231917aaa"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Scars of Caen is the compilation of stories from the 2014 Organised Play League for Warmachine and Hordes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="wickedways"&gt;&lt;a id="wickedways" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/wickedways_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=702d19e7255df3e33076a1d29cd398d21767db28070eea030ba0e8e4a0fb38f9"&gt;Wicked Ways&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b7d5bcce9bae09b7f1a87fe5042fbcb76fdb7a01.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=0a90daa636f00b2ad5a7ad5d31e4c4b6"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A collection of stories themed around the Strangelight Workshop, an enterprise dedicated to investigating paranormal and occult phenomena in the Iron Kingdoms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="ritesofpassage"&gt;&lt;a id="ritesofpassage" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/ritesofpassage_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=4537fe4de95cca3f780def16938a9160852ced21cd5d6ac678e8d369accb804d"&gt;Rites of Passage&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/84dd8b469e435b8399231739cdc624de16ed251b.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=8dd36cc9fb6072ec65c9b5ed74f23500"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;An anthology of six stories, featuring the journeyman warcaster characters Allison Jakes, Tristain Durant, Andrei Malakov, Aiakos, Elara, and Gastone Crosse&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="movingtargets"&gt;&lt;a id="movingtargets" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/movingtargets_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=f041ae91c118659e3de6aef949ee70a4bbdca0a1323821cd49433266aaeab490"&gt;Moving Targets&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f728b303a957a81fea8fc615249cdae169d902be.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=67298398d62e027fec7c98b47db41c68"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Volume one of the Exiles in Arms series, this novel follows Rutger Shaw, a battle-hardened mercenary, and his companion, Taryn di la Rovissi, a cynical Llaelese gun mage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="nightofthenecrotech"&gt;&lt;a id="nightofthenecrotech" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/nightofthenecrotech_preview.pdf?t=st=1788651113~exp=1788737513~hmac=eb45f13b7468bcc6aedc0817038fae9275345784313cff1f1a672c7dd39ceca7"&gt;The Night of the Necrotech&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ba7bb5dcb52b858268aefca1776d8e803c806e51.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f2acad099c37933f70ab505fcff5d0d3"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Volume two of the Exiles in Arms series, this novel follows mercenaries Rutger Shaw and Taryn di la Rovissi as they navigate the treacherous, crime-ridden port city of Five Fingers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt60"&gt;Pay $60 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="ironkingdomscollectionbysteamforged"&gt;&lt;a id="ironkingdomscollectionbysteamforged"&gt;Iron Kingdoms Collection by Steamforged&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ab26468998a05711ebe73b3db74a3902662b6ca5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2e67346154a552087bdc5715b018960e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;A collection of 65 Iron Kingdoms RPG (IKRPG) items, including core and source books for the Full Metal Fantasy and 5e editions, GM toolkits, bestiary's, and maps. First presented in the March 2025 Iron Kingdoms Humble Bundle, this collection contains all 65 items from the $50 tier in that promotion.&lt;/div&gt; &lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Alchiere Map&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Cryx Map&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;VTT Tokens&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms Unleashed Catacomb Map Tiles&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms Unleashed GM Toolkit&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms FMF: Kings, Nations, and Gods&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms Unleashed: Core Rule Book&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms Unleashed: Skorne Empire&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms Unleashed: Wild Adventure&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms Unleashed: Hogwash&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Into the Deep Wild&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Nightmare Empire&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Tales from the Blackwater Cantina&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Guts &amp;amp; Gear The Poison Dart&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Borderlands and Beyond&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Monsternomicon the Lost Pages&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Deep Wild Expeditions&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Book of the East 3 (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Lich Lords of Cryx (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Soldiers of Fortune (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Something Wicked (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Gravediggers (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Pieces de la Resistance (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Science of Destruction (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Tharn (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Way of Keeping (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Widowmakers (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Desperate Measures (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: The Cold Road Home (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Twisted Fairy Tales (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Minds of Metal (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Divine Mechanics (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Mind Slavers (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Secret Masters (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Sinking Feeling (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Reclaimers (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Stormsmiths (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Man-O-War (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: It's a Jungle Out There (Alchiere Adventure)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms FMF: Monsternomicon&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms FMF: Bad Moon Rising&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms FMF: Immortality&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms FMF: Bitter Medicine&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms FMF: Full Metal Fridays&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Monsternomicon&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Local Secrets Exciting Locations in the Scharde Islands&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Scoundrel's Guide to the Scharde Islands&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Borderlands Survival Guide&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Shadow of the Seeker&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Wesselbaum's Wild Guide: Volume 1 Bordertowns and Badlands&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Edreas Encounters&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Doom Reavers (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Assassins Way (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: First We Feast (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Exemplar (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Book of the East 2 (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Flameguard (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Mysteries of the Maiden (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms: Full Metal Fantasy Roleplaying Game Core Rules&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms FMF: Iron Kingdoms Urban Adventure&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms FMF: Expanded Bestiary&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Requiem The Roleplaying Game&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Legend of the Witchfire&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Character Sheet&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Iron Kingdoms 5E: Book of the East (DLC)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
