      <title>Make &amp; Play Games in Godot</title>
      <author>GameDev.TV</author>
      <link>https://humblebundle.com//games/make-play-games-in-godot-software</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">f72d81d35238d543b87b7201ebec2e9d333cd0d5</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 18:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bc5fc54b23f0f05f139e0dac48caba29b1e5d9dc.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=fee4b0bc441f4b71354392f6934f3dde"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a9d800fc5c88f4e103f8af9688ab042ff4b1ffbf.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=9d8ff63ceda70b9b247a88cfe3015bc8"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Make &amp; play your own games!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Become a game dev mastermind when you harness the power of Godot! Learn how to create your own action RPG from the ground up with compelling combat mechanics, develop your own gravity-defying 3D platformer, build a 2D action-adventure game, and so much more with this curated bundle of approachable learning courses. Harness the power of Godot to bring your dream game to life, all for a price you choose. Plus pick up three games created with Godot: &lt;em&gt;Buckshot Roulette&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Windowkill&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;The Electrifying Incident: A Monster Mini-Expedition&lt;/em&gt;! Unlock the very best from GameDev.TV and help support Girls Who Code with your purchase.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#godotcharactercontroller"&gt;Godot Character Controller&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#godot4_createandmastercustompluginscourse"&gt;Godot 4: Create and Master Custom Plugins Course&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#fromblendertogodotcourse"&gt;From Blender to Godot Course: Game-Ready Assets, Characters and Animation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#godot4shaderscourse_craftstunningvisuals"&gt;Godot 4 Shaders Course: Craft Stunning Visuals&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt25"&gt;Pay $25 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#leveldesignfundamentalscourse_getgoodatmakinggamelevelsthatwork"&gt;Level Design Fundamentals&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#godot4_builda2daction-adventuregamecourse"&gt;Godot 4: Build a 2D Action-Adventure Game Course&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#godot4_buildanactioncombatrpgcourse"&gt;Godot 4: Build an Action Combat RPG Course&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#godot4cactionadventurecourse_buildyourown25drpg"&gt;Godot 4 C# Action Adventure Course: Build your own 2.5D RPG&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#completegodot3dcourse_developyourown3dgamesusinggodot4"&gt;Complete Godot 3D Course: Develop Your Own 3D Games Using Godot 4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#godotui"&gt;Godot UI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#windowkill_torcado"&gt;Windowkill&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#electrifyingincident_amonstermini-expedition"&gt;The Electrifying Incident: A Monster Mini-Expedition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buckshotroulette"&gt;Buckshot Roulette&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="godotcharactercontroller"&gt;&lt;a id="godotcharactercontroller" href="https://youtu.be/1ayV8_3uhB0"&gt;Godot Character Controller&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Want to build a slick 3D game without starting from scratch?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This Godot Character Controller is your fast-pass to playable goodness.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Jump into a ready-to-roll demo scene with first- and third-person camera views, built-in UI, and sweet real-time settings.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Add your own 3D models, animations, and style—because generic ain’t your thing.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll master movement, level flow, and customisation without banging your head against the wall.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Perfect for Godot newbies, game jam junkies, or anyone who just wants to get stuff moving now.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Skip the setup grind and start crafting the game world in your head.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Grab the bundle and get your character moving in no time.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="godot4_createandmastercustompluginscourse"&gt;&lt;a id="godot4_createandmastercustompluginscourse" href="https://youtu.be/mjCHead_ur8"&gt;Godot 4: Create and Master Custom Plugins Course&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Ever wished Godot just did that one thing you need? &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Time to stop wishing and start plugin-ing! &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This course shows you how to install, build, and submit your very own custom Godot plugins—no wizard robe required. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Snap nodes into place, control selections from scripts like a boss, and make your tools feel right at home in the editor. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll even hook into the undo-redo system like it’s NBD. Hands-on, practical, and packed with aha! moments. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Whether you’re fixing your workflow or flexing your dev muscles, this one’s a game-changer. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Grab the bundle now and start bending Godot to your will.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="fromblendertogodotcourse"&gt;&lt;a id="fromblendertogodotcourse" href="https://youtu.be/GqqPEKbllIk"&gt;From Blender to Godot Course: Game-Ready Assets, Characters and Animation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Want to bring your Blender models into Godot without the export chaos? &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This course shows you a fast, clean pipeline for getting static assets, props, and fully rigged characters from Blender into Godot - no fluff, just what works. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll bake textures, build LODs, and rig + animate characters with confidence, then export them using formats that actually behave inside the engine. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Whether you’re working on environments or animated heroes, you’ll get your assets game-ready with less trial and error. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Perfect for devs and artists building their Blender-to-Godot workflow.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="godot4shaderscourse_craftstunningvisuals"&gt;&lt;a id="godot4shaderscourse_craftstunningvisuals" href="https://youtu.be/TIWY6aa1kLs"&gt;Godot 4 Shaders Course: Craft Stunning Visuals&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/53c7d5b4066ff5345d2eb73a8737ecb00950e6f3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f0c37a2aa739beff151015ffd696685e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Ever wondered how to make visuals that keep players’ eyes glued to the screen?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The secret sauce is Shaders and we’re here to help you pour it all over your game!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We'll take you from "What’s a shader?" to "Check out this cool visual effect I made!" in no time.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Jumpstart your journey with programming in Godot’s own shading language, moving swiftly from the basics to the cooler, more complex spells of the shader world.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Discover the magic behind fragment and vertex shaders in both 2D and 3D, and get hands-on with techniques that'll make your game scenes pop like never before.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This course is perfect if you’re familiar with Godot basics but itching to elevate your games from great to "Whoa, how did you do that?!"&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With just a sprinkle of Godot basics and a dash of enthusiasm, you're set to create something visually unforgettable.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Grab the bundle now, your future games will thank you – and so will your players.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt25"&gt;Pay $25 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="leveldesignfundamentalscourse_getgoodatmakinggamelevelsthatwork"&gt;&lt;a id="leveldesignfundamentalscourse_getgoodatmakinggamelevelsthatwork" href="https://youtu.be/42MirGlEv78"&gt;Level Design Fundamentals&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/560fd8576b5c649e9f724a200d4df11eda61bd3f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6be47c350f4748df8ba541775ff28de3"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;My levels feel... fine. But fine isn't fun.""&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;If that hits close to home, this course is for you. Good level design isn't magic - it's a craft. And once you learn how it works, you'll see it everywhere.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;We dig into real levels from real games to reverse-engineer what makes them stick. The tension, the pacing, the moment a level just gets you - none of that happened by accident. Someone designed every beat on purpose. This course shows you how they did it, and how you can too.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;You'll walk away with design frameworks, layout patterns you can swipe for your own games, a 10-step workflow, and greyboxing techniques that work in the real world - not just in theory.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Whether you're heading into your first game jam or building your dream indie project, stop hoping your levels turn out okay. Start designing them to be great.fix description&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="godot4_builda2daction-adventuregamecourse"&gt;&lt;a id="godot4_builda2daction-adventuregamecourse" href="https://youtu.be/M-Mb0TpK0G8"&gt;Godot 4: Build a 2D Action-Adventure Game Course&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Ever dreamt of making your own 2D action-adventure game?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll build one from scratch in Godot 4—puzzles, combat, dialogue, and all.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Master GDScript so you can make slimes attack, switches unlock secrets, and NPCs drop cryptic (or snarky) hints.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Craft a full world using tilemaps, terrains, and hidden treasure rooms.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Build puzzles with pressure plates and moveable blocks, and make enemies that actually put up a fight.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We go from blank project to fully playable game—no half-baked demos here.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Perfect for beginners or anyone switching to Godot and ready to dive in headfirst.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Grab the bundle now and start building the epic adventure that’s been living in your head.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="godot4_buildanactioncombatrpgcourse"&gt;&lt;a id="godot4_buildanactioncombatrpgcourse" href="https://youtu.be/q06L5hbtBx0"&gt;Godot 4: Build an Action Combat RPG Course&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to build a 3D RPG where your hero levels up, equips epic gear, and smashes baddies in style?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this course, you’ll create characters with stats, gear that changes how they look and fight, and combat animations that feel oh-so-satisfying.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn to light up your game world with global illumination and craft UIs that actually make sense.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build systems for levelling, inventory, stat boosts, and gear-swapping that’ll have players hooked.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’ll even cover smart scripting tricks to keep your code clean and your gameplay tight.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Perfect if you’ve got some Godot 3D know-how and want to go full RPG dev mode.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pick up the bundle now and bring your dream game world to life—XP grind optional.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="godot4cactionadventurecourse_buildyourown25drpg"&gt;&lt;a id="godot4cactionadventurecourse_buildyourown25drpg" href="https://youtu.be/KKrhTSTSnUE"&gt;Godot 4 C# Action Adventure Course: Build your own 2.5D RPG&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to conquer the 2.5D RPG realm and forge your adventure with Godot 4 &amp;amp; C#?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll build a classic dungeon RPG, blending 2D and 3D graphics, where your hero battles against smart enemies, uses bomb attacks, and unleashes combo attacks with lightning strikes!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn to craft pixel-perfect UIs using Godot’s control nodes and give your game a polished look with shaders and particle systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dive deep into Godot's APIs, mastering everything from physics to scalable game architecture.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get hands-on experience in building a fully-featured RPG, complete with combat systems, abilities, and immersive UIs, while also mastering the art of scalable and maintainable code.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Whether you’re a C# developer venturing into game creation, an RPG enthusiast dreaming of your own title, or simply looking to get it right the first time with clean, efficient code, this is the course for you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us to forge your own epic RPG in Godot 4 now!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="completegodot3dcourse_developyourown3dgamesusinggodot4"&gt;&lt;a id="completegodot3dcourse_developyourown3dgamesusinggodot4" href="https://youtu.be/ajgaLjyUoLU"&gt;Complete Godot 3D Course: Develop Your Own 3D Games Using Godot 4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jump into the thrilling world of 3D game development with this fun, online course using Godot 4 and GDScript! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explore the essentials of Godot 4 by creating cool 3D video games, from building immersive levels and environments to animating with Tweens, AnimationPlayers, and Shaders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You’ll create 3 spectacular games in Godot 4…&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Project Boost: a rocket adventure exploring physics and level navigation. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Barbarian Blaster: a Tower Defence game where you’ll learn essential skills like firing projectiles, dealing damage, spawning game objects, making animations and more. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Robo Rampage: First Person Shooter game where you’ll build custom interior levels, enemies with AI and hone your 3D game dev skills. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Whether you’re a complete beginner or have dabbled in Godot before, this course has something for you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Godot 4 is an amazing engine and this course is the perfect place to dive into it!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="godotui"&gt;&lt;a id="godotui"&gt;Godot UI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4961b4b65ca9eb44da3753851fa788da4a6fca36.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=98afccff95fdb6f03d00d56708c1abda"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Want to build menus and UI for your game that look like they shipped with a finished, professional title? &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Learn to structure any UI properly using Godot’s container system, then theme it with StyleBoxes, Nine Patch textures and custom fonts. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Use Godot’s Theme resource and Theme Type Variations to restyle an entire scene in one go, and animate every transition, hover and menu change with Tweens and Offset Transforms. By the end you’ll have built a main menu, pause menu, HUD and level select screen, all fully playable, themed and animated.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ideal if you’ve already got some Godot experience under your belt and want to level up your UI skills specifically.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="windowkill_torcado"&gt;&lt;a id="windowkill_torcado" href="https://youtu.be/vA60y3bpKBs"&gt;Windowkill&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Windowkill is a twin-stick shooter, but the game window itself is constantly closing in on you. Shoot the window edges to push it around your screen as you fight and dodge enemies and bosses in their own windows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;h3 id="electrifyingincident_amonstermini-expedition"&gt;&lt;a id="electrifyingincident_amonstermini-expedition" href="https://youtu.be/wmMKW3jjAkQ"&gt;The Electrifying Incident: A Monster Mini-Expedition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;An adorable bite-sized adventure from the creators of A Monster’s Expedition - explore the facility, avoid the live electricity, and repair the malfunctioning reactor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buckshotroulette"&gt;&lt;a id="buckshotroulette" href="https://youtu.be/JEGxnpGqEaE"&gt;Buckshot Roulette&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c5d58db2a8323b921ab4907aa40f7df323ea1456.png?auto=compress,format&amp;s=d5efb82e8e9b1343b4401260c7129c49"&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Play Russian roulette with a 12-gauge shotgun. Four enter. One leaves. Roll the dice with your life. Good luck!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
