      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f955c855beaef7c927a78915f55b2dd1c47ead78.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=f2f9380b3a20cc0d3f075ccacaebb027"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/52110114fb7c5b273710140c68c3834eade70576.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=ec944ebc6a7049b88877b4e50d0b974c"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Foundational Unreal Engine Assets&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width="430" height="250" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/senobKGCBKE?si=6cvp2BZNhnYP0vbk" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Level up your asset library with The Builder’s Vault Collection of detailed environmental assets specifically designed for Unreal Engine. These ready-to-use environmental assets are designed specifically for Unity by the creatives at Hivemind. Make games faster with modular assets that plug and play with your existing tools for frictionless creation at any skill level. Pay what you want for access to themed packs like &lt;em&gt;Toskov: Post Apocalyptic City Megapack&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Ravenhold: Modular Dark Fantasy Megapack&lt;/em&gt;, and more. Speed through your next development process with elite environmental assets and help support Make-A-Wish with your purchase!  &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style="color: #ef9741;"&gt;Keys Expire. Please redeem before August 22th, 2027. Professional Fab Marketplace keys provided. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#naniteseries_harborkitfabprofessionallicensekey"&gt;Nanite Series: Harbor Kit (FAB Professional License Key)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#europeanandfrenchvillagefabprofessionallicensekey"&gt;European / French Village (FAB Professiona