nstances: 29&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Number of Textures: 87&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Texture Resolutions: (4096x4096)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supported Development Platforms:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Windows: (Yes)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mac: (Yes)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Console: (Yes)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="europeanandfrenchvillagefabprofessionallicensekey"&gt;&lt;a id="europeanandfrenchvillagefabprofessionallicensekey"&gt;European / French Village (FAB Professional License Key)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bfcbfcea80f4796bfb9fdf6f7de92a6b234530a7.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c0daa33adf0827f109b4fda3f930e272"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check It Out On Fab Marketplace &lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/c31422c0-8980-47dd-a884-206d3eeada46"&gt;Here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Professional Fab Marketplace Key is provided!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;UE5 - The map was made specifically for UE5 using Lumen to drastically enhance visuals and performance!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Materials - High quality materials to be used across all of your projects!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;House Prefabs - All architecture comes pre assembled so you can easily build you own French streets with ease!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foliage - Colorful lively foliage to add to any of your scenes!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Number of Unique Meshes: 40&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collision: (Yes automatically generated)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vertex Count: 110 - 2900&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LODs: (Yes/No)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Number of Materials and Material Instances: 41&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Number of Textures: 88&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Texture Resolutions: (2048x2048, 4096x4096)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supported Development Platforms:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Windows: (Yes)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mac: (Yes)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt20"&gt;Pay $20 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="toskov_postapocalypticcitymegapackfabprofessionallicensekey"&gt;&lt;a id="toskov_postapocalypticcitymegapackfabprofessionallicensekey" href="https://youtu.be/Mjjgi59-XdM"&gt;Toskov: Post Apocalyptic City Megapack (FAB Professional License Key)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check It Out On Fab Marketplace &lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/05f96d6a-bab8-40a3-9f59-0790824b17b6"&gt;Here&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Professional Fab Marketplace Key is provided!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Toskov Silent Zone: Post-Apocalyptic City Megapack&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create a massive abandoned city with ruined residential blocks, industrial structures, overgrown streets, damaged architecture, debris, mud, asphalt roads, cables, pipes, cranes, foliage, and a full atmospheric demo map.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Toskov: Silent Zone is a large-scale post-apocalyptic urban environment &lt;strong&gt;megapack &lt;/strong&gt;built from selected Hivemind content and expanded with a huge amount of brand-new work created specifically for this release.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The pack includes hundreds of new assets, new foliage, new PCG workflows, updated materials, new technical tools, optimized Packed Level Actor setups, vertex painting improvements, and a fully assembled Silent Zone city map designed for real Unreal Engine productions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;p&gt; Built From Our Best Work, Expanded With Hundreds Of Brand-New Assets into one cohesive megapack&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Toskov: Silent Zone&lt;/strong&gt; brings together selected content from some of our strongest post-apocalyptic environment packages and expands it with hundreds of brand-new assets, new foliage, new PCG workflows, new technical tools, optimization work, vertex painting improvements, material updates, and a fully assembled large-scale city environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is not a simple bundle of existing products. To turn this into one cohesive &lt;strong&gt;production-ready package&lt;/strong&gt;, we spent over a year expanding, reworking, optimizing, and assembling the content into a &lt;strong&gt;complete post-apocalyptic city toolkit&lt;/strong&gt; for Unreal Engine.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Many assets and systems were heavily transformed for this release, including optimized Packed Level Actor setups, improved scene organization, new foliage workflows, new vertex painting support, updated materials, PCG-assisted ground dressing, and additional environment detail created specifically for Toskov: Silent Zone.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;p&gt; Built For Real Games And Actual Productions&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;From the start, Toskov: Silent Zone was built with &lt;strong&gt;practical game development&lt;/strong&gt; in mind. The goal was not only to create a beautiful post-apocalyptic city, but to make a package that can be used in real commercial game environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The pack uses production-focused optimization techniques such as modular construction, hidden mirroring, tiling, instancing, Packed Level Actors, reusable building assemblies, optimized set dressing, PCG-assisted workflows, and carefully organized level sections to help large scenes remain easier to manage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It also uses &lt;strong&gt;AAA-style material and optimization techniques&lt;/strong&gt; such as world-space grunge blending, instancing, tiling, and hidden mirroring to maintain high visual fidelity while keeping textures at 2K where possible.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Instead of simply placing thousands of loose assets into a map, many large structures and city sections are prepared using optimized workflows designed to reduce overhead and make the environment more practical for real projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Whether you are developing a shooter, survival game, horror project, open-world experience, third-person game, or cinematic environment, Toskov: Silent Zone gives you a strong &lt;strong&gt;production-ready foundation&lt;/strong&gt; for building dense ruined urban levels.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;p&gt; Content Sources And New Additions&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;This megapack includes selected and reworked content from previous Hivemind post-apocalyptic packages, including:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/df316c19-ce3b-443e-8172-f32662f1b34d" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modular Sewers &amp;amp; Tunnels&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/02708474-5331-4c47-b55c-3cbadc51fb4f" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modular Industrial Factory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/2d532309-f049-4d61-80e8-e8fa63688d35" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modular Destroyed Buildings &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/1f0875c0-f6e0-40aa-b15a-35c2d815a99f" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modular Horror Hospital &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/7add140e-278b-4582-92b7-5401f3f5c3f7" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Abandoned Factory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you already own one or more of these packages, please note that Toskov: Silent Zone may include selected overlapping content. However, this megapack also includes extensive new work, including hundreds of brand-new assets, new foliage, new PCG setups, updated materials, optimized Packed Level Actor workflows, new technical tools, improved organization, vertex painting updates, and a complete Silent Zone demo map created specifically for this release.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;p&gt; Full Post-Apocalyptic City Environment&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explore and customize a complete abandoned city scene filled with damaged apartment buildings, broken walls, cracked roads, overgrown rooftops, industrial areas, construction cranes, utility poles, hanging cables, pipes, trash, debris, broken glass, and atmospheric details.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The included Silent Zone demo map gives you a strong starting point for cinematic scenes, survival games, horror projects, shooters, open-world levels, or any project that needs a &lt;strong&gt;grounded ruined urban setting&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;p&gt; Modular Damaged Building System&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build your own&lt;/strong&gt; destroyed city blocks using modular building pieces, damaged walls, floors, ceilings, rooftops, windows, balconies, exterior details, interior set dressing, and prebuilt building assemblies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The assets are designed to be modular from the ground up&lt;/strong&gt;, giving you the flexibility to create buildings in different shapes, sizes, and layouts while keeping your workflow fast and reusable.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Walkable Interiors For Gameplay&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;The pack includes damaged building setups and city structures designed with practical gameplay use in mind.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Many building pieces and prebuilt structures are suitable for FPS, third-person, survival, horror, and exploration-style projects, allowing you to create environments that are not only visually impressive, but also usable for real player navigation and level design.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;⚙️ Optimized Packed Level Actor Workflow&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Many large set pieces are organized as &lt;strong&gt;Packed Level Actors&lt;/strong&gt; to improve performance and reduce CPU overhead in large scenes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You can still edit the assets inside each Packed Level Actor directly in the viewport, making it easy to adjust individual meshes, move props, customize layouts, or adapt the environment to your own project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This workflow helps give you the benefits of &lt;strong&gt;large-scale optimized city assembly &lt;/strong&gt;while still keeping the environment editable and flexible.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;p&gt; Advanced Materials, Vertex Painting, And Surface Variation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;The pack includes master materials for opaque assets, glass, and foliage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The material system is designed to reduce repetition and give surfaces a more natural, production-ready look. Features include texture variation, world-space grunge blending, vertex painting support, customizable material controls, and surface wear options for damaged urban assets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Where applicable, assets support color customization, wear-and-tear variation, grunge blending, and foliage or cable motion through wind-based World Position Offset.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="ravenhold_modulardarkfantasymegapackfabprofessionallicensekey"&gt;&lt;a id="ravenhold_modulardarkfantasymegapackfabprofessionallicensekey" href="https://youtu.be/f3bpMruohYA"&gt;Ravenhold: Modular Dark Fantasy Megapack (FAB Professional License Key)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check It Out On Fab Marketplace &lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/3bfee149-0741-4892-ba2c-b7a245e45de7"&gt;Here&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Professional Fab Marketplace Key is provided!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;p&gt; Ravenhold: Modular Medieval Castle &amp;amp; Fortress Megapack&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build massive medieval castles, fortress walls, gatehouses, bridges, ruins, mountain strongholds, and atmospheric fantasy environments with one complete Unreal Engine megapack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ravenhold is a large-scale modular castle and fortress toolkit designed to help developers create high-quality medieval environments faster, with less setup and more creative flexibility.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The pack includes modular castle architecture, prebuilt fortress assemblies, natural environment assets, foliage, advanced materials, an organized asset gym, and a full atmospheric demo map showing how everything works together in a finished scene.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is an original medieval castle megapack created for building complete environments, not just isolated wall pieces.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a bonus, Ravenhold also includes our &lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/7672b21c-89aa-4884-9661-f96511d3ad6f" target="_blank"&gt;Nanite Quality Medieval Prop Pack&lt;/a&gt; at no additional cost, giving you extra medieval set dressing assets for courtyards, interiors, ruins, and gameplay spaces.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;p&gt; Build Large Castle Environments Faster&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ravenhold gives you the core pieces needed to create believable medieval locations without starting from scratch.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Use modular walls, curtain walls, towers, gatehouse pieces, bridges, arches, pillars, columns, windows, trims, and decorative architecture to quickly assemble castles, fortresses, ruins, fortified roads, and fantasy strongholds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The pack is designed for flexible worldbuilding, so you can create clean fortress layouts, abandoned ruins, overgrown castle sections, mountain passes, or large cinematic medieval scenes using one cohesive asset library.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;p&gt; Clean, Damaged &amp;amp; Ruined Building Pieces&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ravenhold includes damaged and ruined variants for key modular building pieces, allowing you to create everything from clean fortress walls to broken, aged, collapsed, or abandoned castle sections without needing to manually destroy assets yourself.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;⚙️ Prebuilt Fortress Assemblies For Faster Production&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;To speed up level creation, Ravenhold includes prebuilt Packed Level Actors for common fortress structures such as large wall sections, curtain walls, gatehouse towers, and window assemblies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;You can place these larger structures quickly, then break them apart when you want to customize the layout, swap pieces, add damage, create ruined variations, or fine-tune individual meshes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;This gives you a faster workflow for building large environments while keeping the pack editable and practical for real projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;p&gt; More Than A Castle Wall Kit&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ravenhold includes the surrounding environment assets needed to turn your castle into a complete scene.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The pack includes cliffs, mountains, boulders, rocks, trees, plants, grass, and foliage assets, making it easier to build the world around your fortress instead of relying on separate environment packs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Use these assets to create cliffside castles, forested ruins, mountain keeps, overgrown courtyards, rocky paths, and dramatic medieval landscapes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;p&gt; Materials Built For Variation And Control&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Large stone environments can become repetitive quickly, so Ravenhold includes flexible master materials designed to help you add variation across walls, rocks, ruins, and foliage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The architecture material supports vertex painting, moss, mortar, ruined stone variation, tri-planar mapping, grime controls, UV2 grunge, and detail normal support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The geology material includes controls for moss, dirt, edge wear, ambient occlusion, vertex painting, and terrain blending, helping rocks and cliffs feel more naturally integrated into the scene.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Foliage materials include wind, color variation, subsurface scattering, and normal blending to make plants feel more alive inside the environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Demo Map And Asset Gym Included&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ravenhold includes a full demo level that shows the pack used as a complete atmospheric medieval environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You also get an asset gym level where the included pieces are displayed in a clean, organized space, making it easier to browse the library, understand what connects together, and start building your own levels faster.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;p&gt; Bonus Medieval Props Included&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ravenhold also includes our &lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/7672b21c-89aa-4884-9661-f96511d3ad6f" target="_blank"&gt;Nanite Quality Medieval Prop Pack&lt;/a&gt; as bonus content at no additional cost.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;These additional medieval props give you more options for set dressing, storytelling, courtyards, interiors, ruins, and gameplay areas.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you already own the Nanite Quality Medieval Prop Pack separately, please note that this bonus content overlaps with that product. The main Ravenhold castle and fortress megapack itself is original content created for this release.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="modularhauntedmansionfabprofessionallicensekey"&gt;&lt;a id="modularhauntedmansionfabprofessionallicensekey" href="https://youtu.be/JdwhsceIiMM"&gt;Modular Haunted Mansion (FAB Professional License Key)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check It Out On Fab Marketplace &lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/434c503b-cd0e-4efb-abc9-347b5ae41b3d"&gt;Here&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Professional Fab Marketplace Key is provided!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Modular Haunted Mansion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create dark, atmospheric haunted mansions, abandoned estates, eerie interiors, foggy gardens, and horror-ready environments with a fully modular building kit designed for fast level creation in Unreal Engine.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Whether you are building a survival horror game, cinematic scene, mystery adventure, gothic estate, abandoned manor, or creepy exploration level, Modular Haunted Mansion gives you the structural pieces, props, foliage, and atmosphere tools needed to create a complete environment quickly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h5&gt;&lt;p&gt; Fully Modular Mansion Building Kit&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Build custom haunted mansions using modular walls, roofs, floors, windows, doors, stairs, columns, and architectural pieces&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Create unique mansion layouts, interiors, exteriors, gardens, balconies, rooftops, and multi-floor structures&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Designed for fast iteration, so you can quickly block out, adjust, and expand your level&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Perfect for haunted houses, gothic mansions, abandoned estates, horror maps, and dark cinematic environments&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Modular pieces make it easy to build small houses, large mansions, connected wings, courtyards, and estate grounds&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h5&gt;&lt;p&gt; Interior &amp;amp; Exterior Ready&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Includes assets for both exterior mansion construction and fully explorable interior spaces&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Build rooms, hallways, staircases, kitchens, bedrooms, libraries, entrance halls, and abandoned living areas&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Create immersive playable spaces where players can explore inside and outside the mansion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Great for first-person horror games, third-person adventure games, cinematic walkthroughs, and atmospheric storytelling&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Use the included furniture and set dressing props to make interiors feel old, abandoned, and lived-in&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h5&gt;&lt;p&gt; Hundreds of Meshes &amp;amp; Props&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt; Includes a large collection of structural pieces, furniture, decorations, ruins, fences, windows, doors, stairs, and mansion props&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Quickly populate scenes with beds, cabinets, bookshelves, tables, chairs, carpets, lamps, bathtubs, kitchen assets, chandeliers, broken objects, and more&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Includes exterior elements such as gazebos, fences, pillars, stone pieces, ruins, gates, garden props, and damaged architecture&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Save hours of manual asset creation by using ready-made pieces designed to work together&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Ideal for creating rich horror scenes without needing multiple separate asset packs&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Horror Atmosphere VFX Collection&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Includes powerful fog cards and atmospheric VFX to instantly create a dark, cinematic horror mood&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Add thick mist, low fog, creepy depth, and soft environmental haze to your scenes&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Includes crow VFX / bird elements to bring the environment to life and add tension&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Great for haunted forests, mansion entrances, graveyard-style paths, lakeside shots, and eerie interiors&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Helps you create a professional horror atmosphere directly inside the scene without complex setup&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h5&gt;&lt;p&gt; Scanned Foliage &amp;amp; Haunted Grounds&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt; Includes scanned foliage assets to create realistic mansion gardens, forests, overgrown paths, and abandoned estate grounds&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Build foggy outdoor areas with trees, bushes, grass, dead leaves, and natural set dressing&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Perfect for surrounding your mansion with creepy forest paths, overgrown gardens, and isolated horror environments&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Combine foliage with fog and lighting to create cinematic horror shots quickly&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Adds natural realism and variety to your environment without needing an extra vegetation pack&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Abandoned, Gothic &amp;amp; Horror-Ready Visual Style&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt; Designed with a dark haunted mansion atmosphere, including old brick walls, worn wood, broken interiors, dusty rooms, damaged props, and creepy lighting potential&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Perfect for horror games, mystery games, escape rooms, dark fantasy projects, gothic scenes, and cinematic trailers&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Includes both clean modular construction pieces and damaged set dressing elements for storytelling&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Create abandoned mansions, ghost houses, cursed estates, vampire homes, old family manors, and supernatural locations&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Works well for both gameplay environments and high-quality cinematic showcase scenes&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h5&gt;&lt;p&gt;⚡ Built for Fast Environment Production&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p&gt; Quickly go from blockout to final scene using modular pieces, ready-made props, foliage, and VFX&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Build large haunted mansion environments without starting from scratch&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Designed for level designers, environment artists, indie developers, cinematic creators, and horror game teams&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Useful for gameplay maps, vertical slices, trailers, prototypes, marketplace projects, and full production environments&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Includes the tools needed to create both close-up interior scenes and wide exterior establishing shots&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="hearthvale_medievalhousesandtavernbuildingkitfabprofessionallicens"&gt;&lt;a id="hearthvale_medievalhousesandtavernbuildingkitfabprofessionallicens" href="https://youtu.be/GFrKCwblDYE"&gt;Hearthvale: Medieval Houses &amp; Tavern Building Kit (FAB Professional License Key)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check It Out On Fab Marketplace &lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/fb890a55-be4e-45b1-9401-4e6299224e11"&gt;Here&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Professional Fab Marketplace Key is provided!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;p&gt; Hearthvale: Medieval Tavern &amp;amp; Homes Building Kit&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hearthvale&lt;/strong&gt; is a modular top-down fantasy environment kit designed for creating cozy medieval taverns, village homes, interiors, buildings, and fantasy RPG environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;With nearly &lt;strong&gt;400 assets and FX&lt;/strong&gt;, Hearthvale gives you the tools to build warm tavern halls, rustic homes, village interiors, market corners, storage rooms, libraries, and lived-in medieval spaces with ease. The pack includes modular architecture, furniture, props, lighting, VFX, PCG tools, Blueprints, and a fast tile-based building system to help you create detailed top-down environments, procedural levels, and reusable world layouts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Modular Architecture &amp;amp; Building System&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Five-Unit Grid Snapping:&lt;/strong&gt; All modular assets are designed for efficient placement using a five-unit grid snapping system, making it easy to build clean, consistent layouts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Top-Down Optimized Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Architecture is built specifically for top-down fantasy games, allowing you to create readable interiors and strong visual compositions from above.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Tavern &amp;amp; Home Construction:&lt;/strong&gt; Use modular walls, floors, stairs, and building pieces to create a wide variety of taverns, houses, rooms, halls, and village-style interiors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rotatable Layouts:&lt;/strong&gt; Tiles and modular pieces can be rotated 90 or 180 degrees to create new visual angles, layout variations, and fresh combinations from the same assets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;p&gt; Tile-Based Level Design &amp;amp; Fast World Building&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;12 Ready-to-Use Modular Tiles:&lt;/strong&gt; Hearthvale includes &lt;strong&gt;12 pre-packaged modular tiles&lt;/strong&gt; designed to make building taverns, homes, interiors, and top-down levels extremely fast and easy. Each tile acts as a ready-made layout section that can be connected with other tiles to quickly form larger buildings, multi-room interiors, taverns, homes, and complete fantasy environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fast Tile-Based Construction:&lt;/strong&gt; Instead of building every room from scratch, you can use the included tiles as reusable building blocks. Snap tiles together, duplicate them, rotate them, and combine them in different ways to create new layouts in minutes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideal for Procedural Worlds &amp;amp; Levels:&lt;/strong&gt; The tile system is especially useful for procedural level generation and randomized world building. Because the tiles are modular and connectable, they can be used as building chunks for procedural taverns, houses, village interiors, settlements, and top-down RPG levels.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Endless Layout Combinations:&lt;/strong&gt; Tiles can be mixed and matched to create many different building shapes and level layouts. Use them to quickly block out a cozy tavern, a connected village home, an inn interior, or a larger medieval location.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rotatable Tile Layouts:&lt;/strong&gt; Each tile can be rotated 90 or 180 degrees to create different visual angles, new room shapes, and fresh layout variations from the same base pieces.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partially Decorated Tiles:&lt;/strong&gt; Most tiles are partially populated with assets, giving you a strong starting point while still leaving room to customize, randomize, and decorate each space further.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Demo Scene:&lt;/strong&gt; Includes the demo scene shown in screenshots, giving you a complete example of tile connections, lighting, composition, layout design, and asset usage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;p&gt; Tavern, Home &amp;amp; Village Props&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Decorate your environments with a wide variety of medieval fantasy props, including:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tables and chairs&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bookshelves and books&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Barrels and crates&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Carts and storage props&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Candles, torches, and wall lights&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Flags, decor, and household objects&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tavern furniture and cozy interior details&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;These assets are ideal for creating warm, believable medieval spaces, from quiet homes and storage rooms to busy tavern halls and fantasy village interiors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Smart Blueprints &amp;amp; PCG Tools&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hearthvale includes &lt;strong&gt;11 Blueprints&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;8 PCG assets&lt;/strong&gt; to help speed up scene creation and reduce manual placement work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamic Lighting Blueprints:&lt;/strong&gt; Candles, torches, and wall candlesticks include exposed controls for removing lights, removing FX, adjusting lumens, radius, and color temperature.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Barrel Stack Generators:&lt;/strong&gt; Quickly create varied barrel arrangements and rustic storage areas using PCG barrel stack tools.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spline-Based Chains:&lt;/strong&gt; Create flexible chain shapes with adjustable gravity, slope smoothing, sharp corners, and spline controls.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Table Decoration PCG:&lt;/strong&gt; Automatically place items on and around tables to quickly generate believable tavern clutter and lived-in interior detail.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bookshelf &amp;amp; Book Generation:&lt;/strong&gt; Generate books and bookshelf variations using PCG Grammar for faster interior decoration and more natural shelf variety.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="modularmilitarybasemegapackfabprofessionallicensekey"&gt;&lt;a id="modularmilitarybasemegapackfabprofessionallicensekey" href="https://youtu.be/oRHRSG9mzrw"&gt;Modular Military Base Megapack (FAB Professional License Key)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt