rst&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;light&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adjustable &lt;strong&gt;smoke&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;fume flash&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;light scale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Includes &lt;strong&gt;3 variations per weapon type&lt;/strong&gt;, each with different shapes and styles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Bullet Ejections Effects ️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Five weapon types&lt;/strong&gt; with plug-and-play Niagara-based bullet ejections. Simply attach to the &lt;strong&gt;weapon socket&lt;/strong&gt; and play—no need for blueprint-based physics.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Designed for both &lt;strong&gt;First&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Third Person Camera View&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adjustable &lt;strong&gt;bullet velocity&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;scale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Includes &lt;strong&gt;loop&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;single-burst variations&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Overheat Smoke Effects &lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Plug-and-play Niagara &lt;strong&gt;ribbon-based smoke trails&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Includes &lt;strong&gt;thick&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;thin variants&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;2 unique smoke trail textures&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Includes &lt;strong&gt;loop&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;single-burst variations&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Bullet Trail Effects &lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Includes &lt;strong&gt;bullet-shaped head&lt;/strong&gt; and smoke trails.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adjustable &lt;strong&gt;scale&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;color&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;speed&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Bonus: Flare Effect ✨&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Includes a &lt;strong&gt;looping projectile trail&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;smoke&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;flare&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;flash&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;embers&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;light&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="smokeandfogvfxfabprofessionallicensekey"&gt;&lt;a id="smokeandfogvfxfabprofessionallicensekey" href="https://youtu.be/JFeCqtep2NM"&gt;Smoke &amp; Fog VFX (FAB Professional License Key)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check It Out On Fab Marketplace &lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/bc9691f9-1ed3-49ff-babe-f241262d9072"&gt;Here&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Professional Fab Marketplace Key is provided!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;☁️ &lt;/strong&gt;Features&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;☁️Environmental fog effects:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create immersive and dynamic environments with customizable fog effects that add depth and realism to your scenes. Anything from ground fog to panoramic fog we have got you covered!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;☁️Material &amp;amp; System Controls:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Control everything with ease! Change color, size, sharpness and even direction using splines in seconds! Create everything from general fire smoke to pretty much anything: clouds, smoke machines, gun exhaust effects or anything else that you can think of!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;☁️Spline-based smoke plumes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Utilize spline-based systems to effortlessly create and control dynamic smoke plumes that react realistically to in-game events and environmental factors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;☁️Smoke effects:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Enhance the visual impact of your projects with a variety of smoke effects, from subtle wisps to billowing clouds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;☁️Car exhaust effects:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bring vehicular action to life with realistic and customizable exhaust effects, perfect for adding authenticity to your in-game vehicles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;☁️And much more: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explore a wealth of additional VFX elements, such as particle systems, lighting effects, and atmospheric enhancements to elevate the visual quality of your projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="dungeonbuilder_modulartopdownrpgenvironmentkitunrealengine"&gt;&lt;a id="dungeonbuilder_modulartopdownrpgenvironmentkitunrealengine" href="https://youtu.be/Y2noEIyqFf8"&gt;Dungeon Builder: Modular Top Down RPG Environment Kit (Unreal Engine)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check It Out On Fab Marketplace&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/10cbf8dd-ef59-48f8-bbea-606a2b66774d"&gt;Here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt; &lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Professional Fab Marketplace Key is provided!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Dungeon Builder: Ultimate Modular Environment Kit&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Dungeon Builder&lt;/p&gt; is a comprehensive collection of &lt;strong&gt;high-quality assets&lt;/strong&gt; designed specifically for top-down fantasy RPGs. With nearly &lt;strong&gt;500 unique assets&lt;/strong&gt;, this pack provides everything you need to construct intricate, immersive subterranean worlds with ease. &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Advanced Modularity &amp;amp; Architecture&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Snap-to-Grid Precision:&lt;/strong&gt; All modular assets are designed for efficient placement using a &lt;strong&gt;10-unit grid snapping&lt;/strong&gt; system.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;360° Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Architecture is optimized for top-down views, allowing modules to be rotated 90/180 degrees to create entirely new visual perspectives.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Universal Transitions:&lt;/strong&gt; Seamlessly connect modular walls, floors, and stairs to create vast, non-linear dungeon layouts.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Level Design &amp;amp; World Building Tools&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;18 Ready-to-Use Tiles:&lt;/strong&gt; A collection of pre-packaged dungeon rooms that can be instantly snapped together to form a full level.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expandable Layouts:&lt;/strong&gt; Tiles are partially populated with assets, giving you the freedom to further randomize and decorate on top of the base prefabs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Demo Scene:&lt;/strong&gt; Includes the master demo map seen in screenshots, showcasing best practices for lighting and composition.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Smart Blueprints &amp;amp; PCG Tools&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt;Reduce manual placement time with 15 specialized Blueprints and 10 Procedural Content Generation (PCG) assets:&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Procedural Fire Pits (BP_FirePit):&lt;/strong&gt; Dynamically generate fire pits to any size by simply moving editor dummies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Smart Barrel Stacks:&lt;/strong&gt; Instantly generate varied clutter with BP_Rack_Barrel and BP_BarrelStack, featuring adjustable counts and seeds.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spline-Based Chains:&lt;/strong&gt; Create realistic, gravity-defying chains with BP_Chain, featuring adjustable gravity, slope smoothing, and corner sharpness.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dynamic Lighting Prefabs:&lt;/strong&gt; Quick-placeable torches, candles, and wall candlesticks with exposed controls for lumens, radius, and color temperature.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="cryptforge_modulardungeonbuildingkitfabprofessionallicensekey"&gt;&lt;a id="cryptforge_modulardungeonbuildingkitfabprofessionallicensekey" href="https://youtu.be/PBc8LnVhSxg"&gt;CryptForge: Modular Dungeon Building Kit (FAB Professional License Key)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check It Out On Fab Marketplace &lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/c298771f-fb40-4a3f-9d41-57c930e91677"&gt;Here&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Professional Fab Marketplace Key is provided!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;⚔️&lt;p&gt; Features&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;⚔️ &lt;strong&gt;Fully Modular&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;h5&gt;Craft your own dungeons, ruins, halls, and catacombs with a highly modular kit designed for maximum flexibility and creativity.&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;⚔️ &lt;strong&gt;Boulder Kit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;h5&gt;Craft your own massive underground passes and caves using the highly versatile boulder kit.&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;⚔️ &lt;strong&gt;Tunnel System&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;h5&gt;Easily build expansive dungeon layouts with detailed props, ruins, mountain passes, and more for maximum atmosphere.&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;⚔️ &lt;strong&gt;Overgrown Foliage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;h5&gt;Bring your ruins to life with carefully placed foliage that gives your environments an abandoned, ancient feel.&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;⚔️ &lt;strong&gt;Smart Materials&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;h5&gt;Fine-tune the look of your environment with customizable materials - adjust moss coverage, surface wear, and grime levels to perfectly match your scene.&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;⚔️ &lt;strong&gt;Massive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enjoy An Asset Library &lt;/strong&gt;With over 100 unique meshes and a powerful modular system, this kit gives you everything you need to build your next dark fantasy masterpiece.&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;⚔️ &lt;strong&gt;VFX Library&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;h5&gt;Includes a rich collection of effects: Candles, hanging torch flames, ambient fog, light shafts, and more - to bring your environments to life.&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="ultimatebuildingsystemfabprofessionallicensekey"&gt;&lt;a id="ultimatebuildingsystemfabprofessionallicensekey" href="https://youtu.be/zNQJEx8W8XQ"&gt;Ultimate Building System (FAB Professional License Key)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check It Out On Fab Marketplace &lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/4f60f71f-76bf-46ef-a79c-ccbbfb7bb29b"&gt;Here&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Professional Fab Marketplace Key is provided!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Key Features&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modular and Flexible Design&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Integrate seamlessly with your game mechanics.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Provide reusable logic for placement, actions, and interaction to simplify integration and customization.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Snap-to-Grid Placement&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Configurable snapping system with socket-based alignment for precise object placement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Supports multi-object connections with customizable rotational offsets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Custom Placement and Trace Logic&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Define placement rules that fit your gameplay (e.g., attach to specific surfaces, detect terrain height).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Use trace logic for context-sensitive placement, from snapping to foundations to free-floating options.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structural Integrity System&lt;/strong&gt; ️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Enable dependencies between objects for realistic structural behavior.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Unsupported structures collapse dynamically, enhancing immersion and realism. ⚙️&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Action System&lt;/strong&gt; ⚙️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Add interactive functionality to buildables (e.g., doors, traps, crafting stations).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Combine actions to create complex, multi-functional objects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Design&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Easily adjust gameplay values without leaving the play session in PIE (Play In Editor).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fine-tune parameters and test changes instantly for a more efficient iteration process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Developer-Friendly Settings&lt;/strong&gt; ️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Preconfigured materials show valid/invalid placement states instantly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Easy-to-change socket and structural setup options simplify and accelerate your development pipeline.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visual and Audio Effects Support&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Full support for adding custom VFX and SFX, making it easy to integrate your own audio and visual effects to match your game's style.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="modularmedievalkingdommegapackfabprofessionallicensekey"&gt;&lt;a id="modularmedievalkingdommegapackfabprofessionallicensekey" href="https://youtu.be/c48L5UNHs4U"&gt;Modular Medieval Kingdom Megapack (FAB Professional License Key)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check It Out On Fab Marketplace &lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/42d4a792-2b66-423d-9b20-84d6b2c578d8"&gt;Here&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Professional Fab Marketplace Key is provided!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Features&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Interiors/Enterable - All buildings including the castle are fully enterable and fully furnished!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Massive - 580 Unique meshes to build vast medieval kingdoms, towns, villages and everything in between!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Wall Spline Tool - Lay down massive city walls in minutes using our wall spline tool!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt; ​Fully Modular - Enjoy a fully modular kit to create your own Medieval towns, cities and everything in between. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li