ong&gt;&lt;p&gt;⚒️ Key Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⚒️ Diverse Modular Components&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;️ Build expansive sewer systems and tunnel networks with a variety of modular pieces, including pipes, walkways, walls, floors, and junctions. Easily create intricate layouts tailored to your project.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Optimized for Real Game Environments (Check out the playable demo above)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;️ Built with gameplay in mind, the pack delivers top-tier visual quality while maintaining excellent performance, even in large-scale projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Single-Sided and Double-Sided Walls&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Optimize your levels with both single-sided walls for efficient interior-only spaces and double-sided walls for seamless integration of interior and exterior environments. This ensures performance optimization while offering flexibility.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt; High-Quality Decals&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;️ Enhance your scenes with a variety of high-resolution decals, including graffiti, stains, cracks, and signage, allowing you to add intricate details and storytelling elements to any surface.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⚡ Electrical Cables and Boxes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Include intricate electrical cable setups and electric box props to enhance the realism of your tunnels or industrial environments. Perfect for creating functional, believable spaces.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;️ Ventilation System Set&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Add modular ventilation systems, including ducts, grates, and fans, to build realistic industrial and underground spaces.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;️ Modular from the Ground Up&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Every element is modular, allowing for endless combinations to create tunnels and sewers of any size and complexity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Hyper-Realistic Textures and Materials&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;️ Access a library of detailed, high-resolution textures, including rusted metal, damp concrete, algae-covered surfaces, graffiti, and more. These materials are crafted to bring your environments to life with authenticity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Foliage and Environmental Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Populate your tunnels with debris, trash, Ivy and other atmospheric clutter to enhance the believability of your world.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Atmospheric Lighting and Fog&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt; The pack features eerie lighting, misty fog, and light shafts to create a chilling, immersive atmosphere.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 id="modulargothiccathedralfabprofessionallicensekey"&gt;&lt;a id="modulargothiccathedralfabprofessionallicensekey" href="https://youtu.be/50kekOgd6Fs"&gt;Modular Gothic Cathedral (FAB Professional License Key)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check It Out On Fab Marketplace &lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/e5e58587-b38c-4ab1-a423-d56256dbbbd7"&gt;Here&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Professional Fab Marketplace Key is provided!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;❓ &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;What Is the Pack All About?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Modular Gothic Cathedral Kit is a meticulously designed asset pack for creating breathtaking Gothic-inspired interiors. Perfect for RPGs, fantasy, horror, or medieval games, this kit empowers creators to craft immersive, atmospheric environments with ease.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;⛪ &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Key Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⛪ Fully Modular Components&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;p&gt;Build your Gothic interiors from the ground up with a wide array of modular assets, including walls, arches, ceilings, floors, windows, and pillars. The assets are double-sided and versatile, giving you maximum flexibility for intricate designs.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⛪ Expansive Prop Library&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;p&gt;Populate your cathedral with over 130 unique props, such as benches, bookshelves, statues, chandeliers, altars, and more. These detailed assets add richness and storytelling potential to your environments.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⛪ Incense Burners with Smoke VFX&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;p&gt;Bring life to your scenes with incense burners featuring realistic smoke effects, perfect for adding a mystical and immersive ambiance to your Gothic interiors.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⛪ Candles with Atmospheric Lighting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;p&gt;Add candles with customizable lighting to create a warm, dramatic, or eerie mood, enhancing the Gothic atmosphere.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⛪ Blueprint Prefabs for Quick Integration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;p&gt;Speed up your workflow with blueprint prefabs, allowing you to quickly place fully assembled props, such as chandeliers, pews, or decor clusters, into your levels.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⛪ Chain Spline Tool&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;p&gt;Easily create dynamic and natural-looking hanging chains with the included chain spline tool, perfectly suited to Gothic interiors.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⛪ Highly Optimized Assets&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;p&gt;Built using an AAA pipeline, the assets feature optimized materials to ensure they maintain high visual quality while being efficient in resource usage. Every detail, from weathered stone to intricate carvings, has been carefully crafted for both beauty and practicality.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⛪ Authentic Gothic Atmosphere&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;p&gt;Immerse your players in a world of Gothic grandeur, with soaring arches, intricate details, and a timeless, atmospheric design.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⛪ Perfect for Diverse Game Genres&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;p&gt;From dark fantasy RPGs to horror games or medieval-themed adventures, this pack adapts seamlessly to a wide variety of projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="modulardungeon_halloweddepthsfabprofessionallicensekey"&gt;&lt;a id="modulardungeon_halloweddepthsfabprofessionallicensekey" href="https://youtu.be/kWB1SsV-SQw"&gt;Modular Dungeon: Hallowed Depths (FAB Professional License Key)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check It Out On Fab Marketplace &lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/6db7a85d-aa42-4e2b-8ae6-85b434faf0fe"&gt;Here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Professional Fab Marketplace Key is provided!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Fully Modular&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;h5&gt;Craft your own dungeons, halls, and catacombs with a highly modular kit designed for maximum flexibility and creativity.&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Tunnel System&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;h5&gt;Easily build expansive dungeon layouts with detailed props, jail cells, skeletons, and more for maximum atmosphere.&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;h5&gt; &lt;/h5&gt; &lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Overgrown Foliage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;h5&gt;Bring your ruins to life with carefully placed foliage that gives your environments an abandoned, ancient feel.&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;h5&gt; &lt;/h5&gt; &lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Smart Materials&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;h5&gt;Fine-tune the look of your environment with customizable materials - adjust moss coverage, surface wear, and grime levels to perfectly match your scene.&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;h5&gt; &lt;/h5&gt; &lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Massive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;h5&gt;Enjoy An Asset Library With over 100 unique meshes and a powerful modular system, this kit gives you everything you need to build your next dark fantasy masterpiece.&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;h5&gt; &lt;/h5&gt; &lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt; VFX Library&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;h5&gt;Includes a rich collection of effects: Candles, hanging torch flames, ambient fog, light shafts, and more - to bring your environments to life.&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Physics-Based Hanging Torches&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt; &lt;h5&gt;Medieval-style metal torches suspended by chains that swing or react when struck - adding a dynamic, immersive touch to your dungeons.&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;h3 id="modularshootingrange_firelinecompoundfabprofessionallicensekey"&gt;&lt;a id="modularshootingrange_firelinecompoundfabprofessionallicensekey" href="https://youtu.be/f0glWMufxzU"&gt;Modular Shooting Range: Fireline Compound (FAB Professional License Key)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check It Out On Fab Marketplace &lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/f36f9fed-49a1-41b0-98fa-959908c9e1b3"&gt;Here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Professional Fab Marketplace Key is provided!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;Features&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&g