      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/258ca3e502739ac05784be4e24b00a037fd686db.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=604a2ac2ea3edb861b1f75e234c41cdd"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a82c9c2af95ea601fb7c977ec9ed95d2e2d6531c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=ef369650cd3acf8dfe7b117ea91f6897"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Hey now, Asset All-Star!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discover the Meshingun All-Stars Bundle, bringing together some of Meshingun’s biggest hits and best-selling Mega Packs in one massive collection. Get thousands of high-quality, production-ready assets covering horror, apocalyptic, abandoned, historical, Feudal Japan, World War themes, and more. Whether you’re building your next game, cinematic, or environment, this bundle gives you a huge range of assets to create more while saving serious production time. Professional License included. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;span style="color: #ef9741;"&gt;Keys expire. Please redeem your keys before September 24th, 2027.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#gothicfurniturepropsvol1"&gt;Gothic Furniture Props Vol1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#nanitefoliagevol1"&gt;Nanite Foliage Vol1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#woodenstructure"&gt;Wooden Structure&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#rockset"&gt;Rock Set&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#medicalpropsvol1"&gt;Medical Props Vol1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt30"&gt;Pay $30 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#carnival_meshingun"&gt;THE CARNIVAL - [Theme Park / Amusement Park]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#apocalyptichospital"&gt;Apocalyptic Hospital&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#feudaljapanmegapackextrapack"&gt;Feudal Japan Megapack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#gothicinteriormegapack"&gt;Gothic Interior Megapack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#france_wwiiliberation_worldwar2andww2"&gt;WW2 - France Liberation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#gothicmegapackue"&gt;Gothic Exterior Megapack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#medievalvillagemegapack"&gt;Medieval Village Megapack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#stylizedvillagefatpack"&gt;Stylized Village Fatpack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#lighthouse_meshingun"&gt;THE LIGHTHOUSE&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bazaar_meshingunstudio"&gt;The Bazaar&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="gothicfurniturepropsvol1"&gt;&lt;a id="gothicfurniturepropsvol1"&gt;Gothic Furniture Props Vol1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/180eb3b145919312fe5da91f5db8c6f196a381d8.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4165abc06e6551e7d05927684286aabe"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supported Unreal Engine Versions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;4.26 - 4.27, 5.0 - 5.4&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤Number of Unique Meshes: 143&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤Collision: Yes&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤LODs: Yes&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤Number of Materials and Material Instances: 80&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤Number of Textures: 124&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤Number of Blueprints: 23&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤Texture Resolutions: 512x512, 1024x1024,2048x2048&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➤Supported Development Platforms: Windows, Linux, MacOS&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="nanitefoliagevol1"&gt;&lt;a id="nanitefoliagevol1"&gt;Nanite Foliage Vol1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b0d9cde304f11a47488974bd8ff9683b9f72ab77.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b8709ac708269f7726489df3c909d704"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Description&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Introducing &lt;strong&gt;TrueNanite&lt;/strong&gt;, foliage made entirely from pure mesh,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;with no alpha, and fully optimized for the Nanite Foliage workflow.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A high-quality collection of Nanite foliage assets with unmatched detail,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;perfect for use in games or cinematic projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; The same foliage variations with alpha are also included in the pack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keywords:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;foliage, vegetation, trees, bushes, grass, plants, leaves, vines, ground cover,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;forest, jungle, tropical, temperate, woodland, nature, environment, landscape,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nanite, high quality, game ready, cinematic, Unreal Engine, modular, optimized,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;PBR, real-time, photoreal, realistic, performance, LOD, wind ready, next-gen,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;open world, level design, stylized&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="woodenstructure"&gt;&lt;a id="woodenstructure"&gt;Wooden Structure&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/957d49f49f2848bba8aee2c4e6c03264eeb5a3a6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a9ff3a28771cae683bbc7b8be4e89f1c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A modular collection of weathered wooden structures designed to shape vertical gameplay and believable dungeon spaces, adding depth, traversal, and atmosphere to medieval and fantasy environments. All assets are game-ready and ideal for flexible set dressing. &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Get the original package that contains this set and much more: &lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/f4b42271-f82d-4758-a573-da321eb32b7b" target="_blank"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;The Dungeons&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/a&gt; &lt;p&gt;======================================&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Keywords: wood, wooden, scaffolding, platforms, stairs, ladders, walkways, bridges, planks, beams, supports, structures, dungeon, medieval, fantasy, rustic, worn, construction, framework, environment, props, set dressing, level design, world building, verticality, modular, realistic, gritty, underground, ruins, architecture, timber, wooden floors, wooden stairs, wooden platforms, game ready, 3d assets, environment art, interior, exterior, traversal&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="rockset"&gt;&lt;a id="rockset"&gt;Rock Set&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/afd967333e3d4f81c17d3427b0ced1dfa0e35d32.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=04ac086ec664a27a7b3116e0503f3e4d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Description&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt;A versatile collection of realistic rock and cave assets designed to build moody underground spaces, enhancing dungeons, caverns, and natural environments with strong atmosphere and visual depth. All assets are game-ready and ideal for immersive level creation. &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Get the original package that contains this set and much more: &lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/f4b42271-f82d-4758-a573-da321eb32b7b" target="_blank"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;The Dungeons&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/a&gt; &lt;p&gt;======================================&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Keywords: rock, rocks, stone, cave, cavern, dungeon, stalactites, stalagmites, cliff, wall, ground, terrain, debris, rubble, boulders, pillars, limestone, underground, natural, environment, set dressing, level design, world building, fantasy, medieval, realistic, gritty, moody, game ready, 3d assets, prop pack, environment art, ruins, geology, rock formations, cave walls, platforms, floors, ancient, dark &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Tags: Props Environment Rocks Cave Dungeon Modular Realistic Fantasy Medieval Set Dressing Nature Terrain Stone Ruins Underground Cliffs Level Design World Building Assets Environment Art Ground Scenery Debris Modular Environment Natural &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="medicalpropsvol1"&gt;&lt;a id="medicalpropsvol1"&gt;Medical Props Vol1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/dd60350f5bad97d34faeaf7938fa2032cf38e75c.png?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=45da35082f890c1cff78634bc65b3f6f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;4.26 - 4.27, 5.0 - 5.3&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Are you looking to populate your environment with top-notch assets? This is a small collection of high-quality props included in our Apocalyptic Hospital&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;pack. (Volume 1)&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Number of Unique Meshes and Tri counts:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Number of Unique Meshes: 123&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Collision: Yes&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;LODs: Yes&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Number of Materials and Material Instances: 62&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Number of Textures: 174&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Number of Blueprints: 31&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Texture Resolutions: 512x512, 1024x1024,2048x2048&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt30"&gt;Pay $30 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="carnival_meshingun"&gt;&lt;a id="carnival_meshingun" href="https://youtu.be/cVwYWZE354s"&gt;THE CARNIVAL - [Theme Park / Amusement Park]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;☃️ NEW CHRISTMAS UPDATE ☃️&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;A new free Christmas upgrade is available which includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;New cozy snowy level with holiday decoration&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;A beautiful Christmas tree and many holiday gifts and props&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Advanced snow shader with many controls&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Snow particle system&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;New Christmas theme park music&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;More!&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://discord.gg/3TUktend3w" target="_blank"&gt;Join our Discord&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;to get the latest updates, support, participate in contests, and win prizes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.artstation.com/artwork/0lad05" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detailed Images and Videos&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/environments/fantasy/the-carnival-304088" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unity Store&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://youtu.be/cVwYWZE354s" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Watch Trailer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/15qLiv2P-w7x8te1-AXC01WwZbgnclAiO/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Playable Demo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1M32n96pe-Jg1TdlZTxGDl49U00Metpd5/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4K Wallpapers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1FpUEjkbdDEAtHhKrv_NxmuRCsWVoy5cKCNDhUBDId7k/edit" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documentation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1FpUEjkbdDEAtHhKrv_NxmuRCsWVoy5cKCNDhUBDId7k/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.a4g2uyha17in" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Asset List&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Carnival: Creepwood Wonderland&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;An immersive experience over a year in the making. This package delivers a highly polished and feature-rich carnival environment designed to elevate your projects with realism, atmosphere, and gameplay-ready systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Upgrades Roadmap&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5 Reviews:&lt;/strong&gt; Circus Upgrades&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;15 Reviews:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced Settings&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30 Reviews:&lt;/strong&gt; Drop Tower&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;45 Reviews:&lt;/strong&gt; Roller Coaster&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="h