      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/804697c6b85794104c5679526b9fd1305fdca7cb.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=f47e4c2b8d10860bd17698c8adeb0e11"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f62ccfc24590c358d459e6b4a3ba68a454af0c3e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=8a2620745da1bcd6a300acfb36768b8b"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Welcome to your all-inclusive Claude Coding resort!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Add the latest coding skills to your toolbelt with an all‑inclusive collection of Codex, Claude coding, and Python automation courses. Claude is an automated coding agent you can use to help create original code, check your work, and save yourself from spending countless hours overworking. Pay what you want for specialized lessons by Zenva like &lt;em&gt;Intro to Agentic Coding with Claude Code&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;Intro to Agentic Coding with Codex&lt;/em&gt; to assist your mainline Claude coding learning journey. Harness the ultra‑powerful techniques of this amazing bundle and help support Alzheimer’s Research UK with your purchase. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style="color: #ef9741;"&gt;Keys Expire. Please redeem before September 23, 2027. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#webscrapingwithpythonandbeautifulsoup"&gt;Web Scraping with Python and BeautifulSoup&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#readingdatafromapiswithpython"&gt;Reading Data from APIs with Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#pythonautomationproject_scrapingtabulardata"&gt;Python Automation Project - Scraping Tabular Data&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#introtowebscrapingwithpython"&gt;Intro to Web Scraping with Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt25"&gt;Pay $25 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#introtoagenticcodingwithcodex"&gt;Intro to Agentic Coding with Codex&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#practicalagenticworkflowswithcodex"&gt;Practical Agentic Workflows with Codex&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildareal-worldapplicationwithcodex"&gt;Build a Real-World Application with Codex&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bestpracticesforagenticcodingwithcodex"&gt;Best Practices for Agentic Coding with Codex&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#agenticaiwithclaudecodeandmcp"&gt;Agentic AI with Claude Code &amp; MCP&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bestpracticesforai-poweredcodingwithclaudecode"&gt;Best Practices for AI-Powered Coding with Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildafull-stackappwithclaudecode"&gt;Build a Full-Stack App with Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#introtoagenticcodingwithclaudecode"&gt;Intro to Agentic Coding with Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#practicalaidevelopmentworkflowswithclaudecode"&gt;Practical AI Development Workflows with Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#agenticaidevelopmentwithopencode"&gt;Agentic AI Development with OpenCode&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#learnvibecodingwithcursor"&gt;Learn Vibe Coding with Cursor&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildmulti-modalaiappswithollama"&gt;Build Multi-Modal AI Apps with Ollama&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#promptengineeringforprogrammers"&gt;Prompt Engineering for Programmers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#introtodevelopingaiagentswithpythonandcrewai"&gt;Intro to Developing AI Agents with Python &amp; CrewAI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#aiagentprojectwithpythonandcrewai"&gt;AI Agent Project with Python &amp; CrewAI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#webscrapinganddatacleaningwithpython"&gt;Web Scraping and Data Cleaning with Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#learnnetworkprogrammingwithpython"&gt;Learn Network Programming with Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#dataanalysiswithpandasandpython"&gt;Data Analysis with Pandas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#datamanipulationwithpandas"&gt;Data Manipulation with Pandas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#microsoftazureaiclouddeveloperassociateai-200_prepandpass"&gt;Microsoft Azure AI Cloud Developer Associate (AI-200): Prep &amp; Pass&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#10practiceexamsformicrosoftazureaiclouddeveloperassociateai-200"&gt;10 Practice Exams for Microsoft Azure AI Cloud Developer Associate (AI-200)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="webscrapingwithpythonandbeautifulsoup"&gt;&lt;a id="webscrapingwithpythonandbeautifulsoup" href="https://youtu.be/iHp29uXzjxE"&gt;Web Scraping with Python and BeautifulSoup&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Gathering data from a web page is known as &lt;em&gt;web scraping,&lt;/em&gt; and is typically performed either by fetching web page via URL and reading the data directly online, or by reading the data from a saved HTML file. Understanding web scraping is a skill crucial to anyone interested in data science or those just looking to obtain information from web pages.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This course covers:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Downloading and installing the Python library BeautifulSoup&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Inspecting a web page to identify the relevant data&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Scraping and parsing the data using BeautifulSoup (formatting it into arrays and variables)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Storing and sanitizing the data in a correctly formatted CSV sheet&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Reading from local HTML files instead of URLs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;How to read non-table data&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;...and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="readingdatafromapiswithpython"&gt;&lt;a id="readingdatafromapiswithpython" href="https://youtu.be/o25F7s5S_Eg"&gt;Reading Data from APIs with Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Master Python skills for gathering and cleaning data from APIs!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;APIs provide pre-built protocols for computer-to-computer data exchange - yet because real-world data is rarely analysis-ready, extracting and cleaning it remains an essential skill for data scientists. In this course, you'll learn how to use Python with APIs to retrieve, parse, and manipulate data across multiple file types to suit your specific needs. Understanding this aspect of data retrieval will give you a better grasp of how data is often transferred and let you navigate the world more informed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Understand what APIs are&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Make URL requests to retrieve data&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Format and parse JSON data&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Work with XML data using BeautifulSoup&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Write data to a CSV file&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Read data from a local file&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;...and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="pythonautomationproject_scrapingtabulardata"&gt;&lt;a id="pythonautomationproject_scrapingtabulardata" href="https://youtu.be/V1KlCiH_CDY"&gt;Python Automation Project - Scraping Tabular Data&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Master web scraping for data analytics!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Being able to analyze web-scrapped data is not only important, but one of the core components of why web scrapping is used. In this course, you'll build a Python app from scratch that collects data from Wikipedia, cleans the data, and then analyzes the data to answer key questions using Beautiful Soup. These skills will allow you to both unlock the true power of web scrapping and render you able to make powerful, data-backed decisions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Create data sets from tables&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Clean blank cells, inconsistent data, etc.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Pull data from other web links&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Craft code to analyze clean data&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Produce full web scrapping projects&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use web scrapping to answer questions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="introtowebscrapingwithpython"&gt;&lt;a id="introtowebscrapingwithpython" href="https://youtu.be/CzJ94uhuIFQ"&gt;Intro to Web Scraping with Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Master the fundamentals of web scraping with Python!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The internet is a massive container of information, and automating data collection from it provides powerful ways to leverage it for data analysis and more. In this course, you'll explore the fundamentals of requesting data from web pages and using the Python library Beautiful Soup to parse the HTML. These skills will provide you with the foundations to explore further web scraping topics and set you up to start utilizing the data for your own projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Understand web scraping &amp;amp; ethics&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Set up Beautiful Soup &amp;amp; Requests&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Target specific HTML tags&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Find single and multiple elements&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Traverse HTML tree structures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Retrieve data from the web&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt25"&gt;Pay $25 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="introtoagenticcodingwithcodex"&gt;&lt;a id="introtoagenticcodingwithcodex" href="https://youtu.be/KDU0JOGgD9k"&gt;Intro to Agentic Coding with Codex&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Start coding with Codex confidently!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;AI coding tools are most useful when you understand how to guide them and keep their actions under control. In this course, you'll build strong foundations for working with Codex, progressing from your first session to structured, controlled project work. With this grounding, you can move on to complete AI-assisted coding projects while keeping every step reviewable and predictable.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You'll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Install and configure Codex&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Navigate Codex's terminal interface&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Manage context across sessions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Write outcome-focused prompts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Build AGENTS.md rules and skills&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Configure permissions and sandboxing&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="practicalagenticworkflowswithcodex"&gt;&lt;a id="practicalagenticworkflowswithcodex" href="https://youtu.be/vngGApQH1dU"&gt;Practical Agentic Workflows with Codex&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take control of every Codex coding session!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;AI-assisted coding becomes more reliable when speed is paired with structured workflows that keep developers in control. In this course, you'll practice complete, real-world workflows for guiding Codex through coding tasks while keeping progress verifiable and predictable. With these workflows, you can move on to larger AI-assisted development projects while keeping every change reviewable and your codebase under control.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You'll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Automate checks for Codex output&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Debug failures with structured prompts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Review AI-generated diffs rigorously&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Delegate focused tasks to subagents&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Coordinate isolated parallel sessions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Build reusable skills and hooks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildareal-worldapplicationwithcodex"&gt;&lt;a id="buildareal-worldapplicationwithcodex" href="https://youtu.be/KAdc63F79i0"&gt;Build a Real-World Application with Codex&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build a complete full-stack app with Codex!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Structured AI-assisted development helps transform complex application ideas into reliable, maintainable software. In this course, you'll use Codex to plan, build, review, and test a complete full-stack invoice tracker from start to finish. With these skills, you can move on to larger AI-assisted web applications while keeping architecture, changes, and quality under control.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You'll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Plan projects in Codex plan mode&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Define durable AGENTS.md rules&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Build Next.js and SQLite workflows&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Coordinate subagents and parallel sessions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Review changes with Git diffs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Test and harden edge cases&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="bestpracticesforagenticcodingwithcodex"&gt;&lt;a id="bestpracticesforagenticcodingwithcodex" href="https://youtu.be/me2ZAd2z2TY"&gt;Best Practices for Agentic Coding with Codex&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take command of your Codex workflows!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Successful agentic coding depends on clear direction, focused context, and disciplined verification to keep AI-generated changes under control. In this course, you'll adopt Codex best practices and develop the judgment and complete operating toolkit needed to turn weak sessions into structured, repeatable workflows across individual and team projects. With these skills, you can move on to larger AI-assisted development projects while avoiding correction spirals and keeping progress predictable.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You'll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Direct Codex with clear intent&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Write precise, flexible prompts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Design focused session contexts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Scale AGENTS.md guidance across teams&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Verify changes through careful diffs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Diagnose and reset failed sessions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="agenticaiwithclaudecodeandmcp"&gt;&lt;a id="agenticaiwithclaudecodeandmcp" href="https://youtu.be/ewqM7ZWw49k"&gt;Agentic AI with Claude Code &amp; MCP&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Master agentic AI workflows and scale your development with Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Modern software engineering increasingly relies on connecting intelligent AI models to specialized tools to solve complex development challenges. In this course, you'll explore real-world examples that connect AI models to external tools, data, and structured capabilities. These advanced techniques will allow you to design custom, reusable agentic workflows that significantly streamline your professional development pipeline.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You'll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Configure Model Context Protocol servers&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Integrate external file system tools&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Automate GitHub issue-to-PR workflows&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Navigate live sites using Playwright&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Define behaviors with agentic configurations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Package reusable AI-driven skill sets&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="bestpracticesforai-poweredcodingwithclaudecode"&gt;&lt;a id="bestpracticesforai-poweredcodingwithclaudecode" href="https://youtu.be/3w814AaiAFY"&gt;Best Practices for AI-Powered Coding with Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Unlock the secrets of AI-powered coding with Claude Code!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;AI is transforming the way software is built, but mastering it means going far beyond simple prompts. In this course, you’ll gain hands-on experience working inside a real-world project - learning how to use Claude Code and tools like it with precision, safety, and confidence from start to finish. As you master structuring, refining, and controlling AI workflows, you’ll be equipped to apply advanced best practices for integrating AI into any production codebase.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Direct AI tools with strong prompts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Prevent "architectural drift" in projects&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Design and implement guardrails effectively&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Implement safe project modification workflows&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use scratchpads for structured planning&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Expand custom features in live apps&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildafull-stackappwithclaudecode"&gt;&lt;a id="buildafull-stackappwithclaudecode" href="https://youtu.be/1jSVVcHcP20"&gt;Build a Full-Stack App with Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Unlock streamlined, AI-assisted development with Claude Code!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;AI-assisted coding opens entirely new doors for building real-world projects quickly and intuitively. In this course, you’ll use Claude Code to vibe code a complete slide presentation generator, transforming Markdown into polished, interactive slide decks with conversational AI as your coding assistant. By learning these skills, you’ll be ready to leverage AI-powered development for your next web projects and bring innovative ideas to life.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Plan and scaffold apps using Claude Code&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Generate and debug code via conversation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Connect React and Node.js with AI help&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Integrate AI APIs for presentation features&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Refine user experience through AI feedback&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and iterate with AI guidance&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="introtoagenticcodingwithclaudecode"&gt;&lt;a id="introtoagenticcodingwithclaudecode" href="https://youtu.be/fmAo0iRWRzw"&gt;Intro to Agentic Coding with Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;AI-assisted development is changing how software is built by helping developers plan, make, debug, and refine real projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this course, you’ll learn how to use Claude Code through a practical workflow that includes managing context, writing better instructions, using Plan Mode, and creating reusable project files for more consistent coding sessions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;By the end of the course, you'll be able to confidently direct Claude Code through real development tasks while staying in control of the code it produces.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You'll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Set up and use Claude Code effectively&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Manage context and write better prompts for reliable results&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Create reusable workflows&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Direct AI coding tasks with greater confidence and control&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Build a foundation for modern agentic AI development&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="practicalaidevelopmentworkflowswithclaudecode"&gt;&lt;a id="practicalaidevelopmentworkflowswithclaudecode" href="https://youtu.be/gL0NXJj2DNA"&gt;Practical AI Development Workflows with Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sharpen your Claude Code workflow for real-world development!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;AI-assisted development becomes far more powerful when paired with reliable debugging, automation, and context management habits. In this course, you'll create a personalized system for guiding Claude Code through complex projects while keeping outputs focused, testable, and aligned with your standards. These skills will help you improve daily coding workflows from start to finish with stronger oversight, cleaner iteration, and less repetitive manual work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You'll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Apply advanced debugging strategies&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Run parallel Claude sessions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Manage context with sub-agents&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Automate tasks with hooks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Create custom workflow commands&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Build verification habits&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="agenticaidevelopmentwithopencode"&gt;&lt;a id="agenticaidevelopmentwithopencode" href="https://youtu.be/V4eS9N_y9Yg"&gt;Agentic AI Development with OpenCode&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Master professional-grade AI agent integration to supercharge your development workflow!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Modern software engineering increasingly requires structured, repeatable AI workflows rather than unpredictable prompt-based coding. In this course, you will master the open-source tool OpenCode to integrate intelligent agents directly into your codebase, ensuring a safe, transparent, and fully-fledged development process. These techniques will empower you to leverage powerful AI models to maintain, refactor, and scale your applications with complete control.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You'll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Set up custom OpenCode environments&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Connect diverse AI model providers&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Navigate codebases using intelligent agents&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Customize agent behavior with guidance&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Execute secure code review loops&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Run local models for privacy&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="learnvibecodingwithcursor"&gt;&lt;a id="learnvibecodingwithcursor" href="https://youtu.be/jNKvCF6RxtE"&gt;Learn Vibe Coding with Cursor&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Unlock productivity with vibe coding and AI-driven development using Cursor.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Vibe coding is transforming how projects get made: simply share your ideas and let AI handle the technical details - so you can build more, faster. In this course, you’ll immerse yourself in the vibe coding approach as you use Cursor to create a complete, real-world Flask image resizer from start to finish. With practical exercises and step-by-step guidance, you’ll discover how Cursor and vibe coding supercharges your workflow, letting you focus on creativity and results.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Adopt the vibe coding mindset&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Boost productivity with Cursor’s features&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Write powerful, effective AI prompts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Build a Flask image resizer app&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Test, secure, and expand your code&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Apply vibe coding to any project&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildmulti-modalaiappswithollama"&gt;&lt;a id="buildmulti-modalaiappswithollama" href="https://youtu.be/jmwEGqr-DlE"&gt;Build Multi-Modal AI Apps with Ollama&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6c870991157f9764913a5096a0418c0bae224356.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e6f3d4499c69d8a6f747b33561813ada"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bring AI-powered apps to your local machine with Ollama!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ollama is a cutting-edge application designed to simplify and unify the process of accessing Large Language Models (LLMs) on your own computer hardware. Through this course, you'll explore how to work with Ollama's efficient API to create chatbots and multi-modal projects using popular LLM models such as Llama 2 and LLaVA. These skills will enhance your privacy control for AI projects and give you ways to build projects offline.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Understand local LLM pros and cons&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Set up Ollama and different models&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Send and receive text requests&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Work with API calls for images&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Create a fully-fledged chatbot&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Log image data to CSV files&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="promptengineeringforprogrammers"&gt;&lt;a id="promptengineeringforprogrammers" href="https://youtu.be/YoSgdwuYs_Y"&gt;Prompt Engineering for Programmers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Modernize your approach to development with AI!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;AI is vastly changing the tech industry with new and intuitive techniques for development. You'll explore how to apply AI to your coding projects and render prompts that help you code, debug, and learn programming - fast! These skills will give you amazing tools to boost your productivity and overall enhance how you code.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;With AI, you will learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Prompt AI for different scenarios&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Generate code in different languages&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Clean &amp;amp; optimize current code&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Produce commit messages &amp;amp; documentation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Get testing and debugging help&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Tune prompts for certain outcomes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="introtodevelopingaiagentswithpythonandcrewai"&gt;&lt;a id="introtodevelopingaiagentswithpythonandcrewai" href="https://youtu.be/T74czwa3PXc"&gt;Intro to Developing AI Agents with Python &amp; CrewAI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Master multi-agent AI and create intelligent applications!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In the world of AI, multi-agent systems are a groundbreaking approach where intelligent agents work together to solve complex tasks. Through this course, you'll unlock the power of CrewAI – a robust framework for building collaborative AI systems – by exploring real-world projects where agents communicate, share knowledge, and collaborate on research tasks seamlessly. These skills will allow you to create increasingly complex AI solutions and optimize workflows efficiently.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Set up and configure CrewAI projects&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Create and customize multi-agent systems&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Integrate cloud-based and local LLMs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Define and execute agent-specific tasks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Optimize agents for long-running operations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Develop custom AI tools for unique needs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="aiagentprojectwithpythonandcrewai"&gt;&lt;a id="aiagentprojectwithpythonandcrewai" href="https://youtu.be/3l1AhJLiO3M"&gt;AI Agent Project with Python &amp; CrewAI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create an AI-powered study assistant with Python and CrewAI!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;AI-powered applications are revolutionizing productivity and education, making learning smarter and more personalized. In this course, you’ll develop a complete Study Buddy app using the CrewAI framework that processes PDFs, generates concise summaries, and creates quizzes and flashcards to reinforce knowledge. With these skills, you’ll understand how to build advanced multi-agent AI systems and gain the expertise to design similar real-world applications.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Set up an AI-driven agent app&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Manage multi-agent tasks seamlessly&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Process text with OpenAI’s API&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Integrate local large language models&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Create terminal-based flashcard commands&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Generate quizzes from summarized content&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="webscrapinganddatacleaningwithpython"&gt;&lt;a id="webscrapinganddatacleaningwithpython" href="https://youtu.be/vIGFNVncJxI"&gt;Web Scraping and Data Cleaning with Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Master data filtering, cleaning, and more for web scraping projects!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Data cleaning is an integral topic for data science as it allows us to leverage data easily and in more powerful ways. In this course, you'll use Beautiful Soup and Python to discover how to ethically extract data from the web, parse the information through intermediate techniques, and filter the data to produce clean data sets. These skills will allow you to masterfully clean data from anywhere and provide your projects with a solid base to more easily manipulate and analyze the data.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Write and read to local files&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Obey ethical standards with robots.txt&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use lists, lambdas, and custom functions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Filter through headings and tables&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Create dictionaries of links&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Extract and save images&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="learnnetworkprogrammingwithpython"&gt;&lt;a id="learnnetworkprogrammingwithpython" href="https://youtu.be/6l-pJNi1R7k"&gt;Learn Network Programming with Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/80067cd11cdf3bbb361e561dc384f047590b4f26.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5ba9edad9adf501414176f588c1c31e1"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explore network programming for Python-based projects!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Network programming is an essential backbone of the internet that allows computers to communicate with one another. In this course, you'll learn how to code clients and servers to send messages to each other - and the networking principles that guide these communications. These skills will provide you the fundamentals to start working with network programming and enhance your understanding of how the internet works.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Understand networking concepts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Connect servers and clients&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple client connections&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Implement HTTP methods for APIs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use asynchronous programming&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Work with IPv6 &amp;amp; IPv4&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="dataanalysiswithpandasandpython"&gt;&lt;a id="dataanalysiswithpandasandpython" href="https://youtu.be/1WX__G4ZaDc"&gt;Data Analysis with Pandas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Master techniques for data analysis using Python and the Pandas library.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In our modern times, data is the main force behind any major decision - from how a product changes to even which streets in your city get repaired. Using real-world flight data, you'll explore techniques for preparing data for analysis and plotting it using the tools provided by the Pandas library. Whether you want to become a data scientist or simply want to make educated, data-based choices, this course will provide you key skills to change how you approach data in general!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will learn how to: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Clean and validate data&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Plot data with various charts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Understand the basics of statistics&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Analyze with means and standard deviations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Implement basic machine learning techniques&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="datamanipulationwithpandas"&gt;&lt;a id="datamanipulationwithpandas" href="https://youtu.be/9dZ_VtZ-KHM"&gt;Data Manipulation with Pandas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn how to prepare your data for insightful analyses with Python and Pandas!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Data has become one of the most integral driving forces behind every industry - from retail marketing to machine learning application development. Using Pandas, a data analysis Python library, you'll explore techniques for reading data from different sources and structuring that data for different forms of analysis. No matter what kind of data you're working with, these skills will help you organize data quickly and efficiently for whatever decision-making obstacles come your way.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Access the Pandas library&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Obtain data from CSV and Excel files&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Utilize DataFrames to structure data&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Select certain sets of data&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Sort data with various criteria&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Group data by properties&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="microsoftazureaiclouddeveloperassociateai-200_prepandpass"&gt;&lt;a id="microsoftazureaiclouddeveloperassociateai-200_prepandpass"&gt;Microsoft Azure AI Cloud Developer Associate (AI-200): Prep &amp; Pass&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e7c6ed2c57d5803eb93774898946278414a807e9.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ed3ae67b9d79b1c555f832dc36ce55e9"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Prepare for and pass Microsoft's AI-200 certification exam!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Azure has become a prime platform where production AI systems are built, and the Azure AI Cloud Developer Associate (AI-200) credential proves you can develop, deploy, and secure them end-to-end. Through this course, you'll work through every skill the exam measures - from containerized inference services and vector databases to event-driven pipelines. Passing this exam positions you to build production AI back-ends on Azure and step into senior cloud developer roles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You'll learn how to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Build and deploy containerized AI services&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Store and search vector embeddings&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Connect services with messaging and functions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Secure secrets with Key Vault&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Monitor solutions using OpenTelemetry and KQL&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Practice with exam-style knowledge checks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="10practiceexamsformicrosoftazureaiclouddeveloperassociateai-200"&gt;&lt;a id="10practiceexamsformicrosoftazureaiclouddeveloperassociateai-200"&gt;10 Practice Exams for Microsoft Azure AI Cloud Developer Associate (AI-200)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/590f5577d57d4628fb564ea573a08bb8ed4ad68f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=968aec2dd67311cbb757617115ad65f7"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Test your AI-200 readiness!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Practice exams are the fastest way to turn preparation into a confident pass, surfacing exactly which topics still need work before you book the real test. Through this course, you'll work through ten complete practice exams that mirror the format, scope, and difficulty of the Microsoft Azure AI Cloud Developer Associate exam from start to finish, each weighted to the official skills outline. Every miss points you straight back to the concept to review, so your final study time goes exactly where it counts with AI cloud development.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You'll practice with:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Ten full-length practice exams&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;500 unique exam-style questions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Questions weighted to the outline&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Realistic best-fit scenario wording&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Section-tagged questions for tracking&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Timed, exam-condition sittings&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;... and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
