t;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Beowulf's RPG Monster Loots Pixel Art Asset Pack This is a collection of Fantasy monster loot itens , parts and dropables. These icons can be used in fantasy role-playing games, and roguelike games and much more. What includes in this asset pack? TOTAL of 90 pixel art unique icon sprites 3 different sizes for each sprite&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="minianimalsassetpack"&gt;&lt;a id="minianimalsassetpack"&gt;Mini Animals Asset Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e64cf23507d3cf940bb5c4c1df32c9a94fda7194.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=0e04cef0f1213e6a0e963d4896efbbf1"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;This is a collection of small critters , animals, wild and domesticated , animated in walking position ( south, north, west, east ) in a size of 16x16px. These assets can be used in fantasy role-playing games, roguelike games, dungeon crawling , farming games and much more. What is included in this asset pack?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;22 Animals sprites with full four-direction walking animations&lt;br /&gt;9 Bugs with simple 2 frame animation!&lt;br /&gt;Spritesheets prepared for Unity &amp;amp; other modern game engines&lt;br /&gt;Animated gif files for each sprites also included!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pixelartcyberpunkcharacters"&gt;&lt;a id="pixelartcyberpunkcharacters"&gt;Pixel Art Cyberpunk Characters&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/21260f3883195daf64a465639c9d97ea5bda4607.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2f2a17057a913e946bb2126dd698dab9"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;5 animated characters&lt;br /&gt;4 directions up, down, left and right&lt;br /&gt;Walking animation and idle sprites&lt;br /&gt;5 sheets included on PNG+Alpha format&lt;br /&gt;Sprites are 64&amp;times;64&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="orcconqueror2dcharacter"&gt;&lt;a id="orcconqueror2dcharacter"&gt;Orc Conqueror 2D Character&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/68a5340fb0d29d4ab5aef208615421b514aa8724.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=37abd9a8b382d4f6acb345f2ab07511d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;The Orc Conqueror is an animated character asset. It's been set up and animated in Unity. It's perfect for a fantasy themed game, but feel free to use it however you chose. For users that don't have Unity, spritesheets are includes as well as PSDs of the art files.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Features include:&lt;br /&gt; 11 animations: idle, walk, jump up, jump down, attack 1-3, special attack combo, die, dead and resurrect&lt;br /&gt; Melee attack visual fx&lt;br /&gt; Optional Helmet&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Everything is setup and ready to go: prefabs can be dragged and dropped and all characters come with individual animation controllers ready for customization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pixelartrogue-likerpg"&gt;&lt;a id="pixelartrogue-likerpg"&gt;Pixel Art Rogue-Like RPG&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/028be0902810b51551d20e43a6feddd015ea8110.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e2ee8e9d7a9cdf5806369a75c87176cd"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;This asset contains 400+ 32x32 sprites to use in your tiled Dungeon Crawler pixel art game, it has all the essentials such as UI to create your game without any other assets!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You can make your Dungeon Crawler more alive than ever with the animated monster and character!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Update added 70+ new sprites:&lt;br /&