ni Adventure Heroes Elves&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7ff4b79fe00de343689eee76d1dea1974d090f1e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=87d90dc35cee71c90bfbf8d60d2ff8d7"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;This is a collection of charismatic fantasy Elven Heroes, animated in walking position ( south, north, west, east ) in a size of 16x16px. These assets can be used in fantasy role-playing games, roguelike games, dungeon crawling games and much more. &lt;br /&gt;What is included in this asset pack?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;6 Heroes character sprites with full four-direction walking animations&lt;br /&gt;6 base character sprites so you can make your own characters!&lt;br /&gt;Hurt and dead frames included!&lt;br /&gt;Spritesheets prepared for Unity &amp;amp; other modern game engines&lt;br /&gt;Animated gif files for each character including the bases also included!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gamedevmarket_coupon_15off10dollars"&gt;&lt;a id="gamedevmarket_coupon_15off10dollars"&gt;15% off any order over $10&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Please note: This cannot be used on anything that is already discounted.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="futuristiccharacters"&gt;&lt;a id="futuristiccharacters"&gt;Futuristic Characters&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/41596dc8118ce963eedacf180137db2d35766bd5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=0a10c1944e6a6d7acfab6d94fc59abdf"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Enliven your cities with Rinober's Futuristic Characters! With this pack, 12 brand-new characters plus some handy animations join your game, and they are a perfect addition to the other packs' characters. Make your character pool grow and create 