;br /&gt;Perfect for RPGs, idle games, and mobile titles, this set integrates seamlessly into HUDs, skill systems, inventory interfaces, and upgrade mechanics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="minicityinteriorstilesets"&gt;&lt;a id="minicityinteriorstilesets"&gt;Mini City Interiors Tilesets&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9627ed516fdd5210e8252b20187c7c639744289d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c99b566aab85e335373805745e5775bd"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Beowulf's Mini City Interiors Tilesets This is a collection of tiles for Fantasy cities interiors, you will find furniture props , walls , mattress, beds , chairs and tables . These tiles can be used in fantasy role-playing games, roguelike games, dungeon crawler games and much more. What includes in this asset pack?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Objects &amp;amp; Walls tileset on 16x16&lt;br /&gt;Dozens of furnitures &lt;br /&gt;Many different interior props, walls, stone ground, wooden ground , tables and chairs, paintings and wall hangings, and much more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="spellsandabilityicons"&gt;&lt;a id="spellsandabilityicons"&gt;Spells and Ability Icons&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b8de1cb7afd5b0c9c5d7c9f292d7bd2f0abfa2bb.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=748679f465d6f5f67d994a146fe427ac"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;This is a set of 72 magical spells and abilities for fantasy and other kind of games. 4 types of background: physical, magical, physical weaknes and magic weakness. Different types of magic and abilities: ice, fire, lightning, weapons and arrows, throwing.. Sizes from 512x512 to 60x60.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Best suits for developers for iOS and Android devices, desktop and browser-based games. 512X512 icon size is good for Retina and big screen resolutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="tilemaptopdownvectorpack"&gt;&lt;a id="tilemaptopdownvectorpack"&gt;Tilemap Top Down Vector Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/83ee7227e88fb582eb8c0a4d74fef43a0aad0eac.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=748144476fe1331522a16ab4f465565b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;27 Various Sets (9 Different Designs, 3 Color variations each) Topdown TileSets for Tower Defense, RPG, or Adventure games, etc. Great starting point to build off of.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pixelartdungeonlevel4"&gt;&lt;a id="pixelartdungeonlevel4"&gt;Pixel Art Dungeon Level 4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/be499598d2a619fb7214b72d6d8169db7167dc03.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=78f65dd93a28a073d57c495b31f3d757"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;29 pixel arts elements&lt;br /&gt;Animated sequence for torch&lt;br /&gt;Format PNG + Alpha&lt;br /&gt;Animated enemy Golem:&lt;br /&gt;walk in four directions and Attack on all directions&lt;br /&gt;Base resolution 64&amp;times;64 pixels&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pixelartgreentemple"&gt;&lt;a id="pixelartgreentemple"&gt;Pixel Art Green Temple&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/053b4b64a991e3e7c3f2937a2ce2dc2142375325.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=59d5804cb5e0eaeac10797fd682fec7c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;-Top down perspective set.&lt;br /&gt;-50 pixel art images.&lt;br /&gt;-Colorful and retro.&lt;br /&gt;-Environmental set with doors, switches and more.&lt;br /&gt;-based on a 64x64 pixel resolution.&lt;br /&gt;-PNG + Alpha format.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="cyberpunkhudelements"&gt;&lt;a id="cyberpunkhudelements"&gt;Cyberpunk HUD Elements&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9ef02b0613e026e8b5dd026a6e3898354e11b088.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=388b882688c30032438492a86443ba9d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;24 User Interface Vector elements&lt;br&gt;All vectors, all editable&lt;br&gt;Cyberpunk style Ui with panels, emojis, buttons and more&lt;br&gt;Included Formats: Ai, EPS and PNGs render of each elements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pixelartwasteland"&gt;&lt;a id="pixelartwasteland"&gt;Pixel Art Wasteland&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/319a25cf1d89987bd22da552eb0eadf193cd5380.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a5a0daa1f8f4c146f117552cc85b9f9c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;-50 pixel art sprites&lt;br /&gt;-Post apocalyptic theme tile set&lt;br /&gt;-retro and colorful&lt;br /&gt;-top down perspective&lt;br /&gt;-PNG + Alpha format&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="robots_gamedevmarket"&gt;&lt;a id="robots_gamedevmarket"&gt;Robots&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a00946b53fab029cf9a6f5628f64064eb409cf9a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=166325404b6e861ff3322bd37cea834a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;There is no futuristic city without some robots, so prepare to make your futuristic or modern city look more lively and mechanical with this new expansion pack. The sets in this pack feature &amp;ldquo;classic-looking&amp;rdquo; robots to battle machines as well as human-looking androids and more.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;- 17 unique robots with numerous variations, of which 2 are human-looking robots (male and female) with several clothing options&lt;br /&gt;- The robots are designed to cover different sizes, appearance (from cute to more boss-like) and their probable use for humans&lt;br /&gt;- 5 unique character sets with objects such as animated gears, a door, crosshairs and shoot animations&lt;br /&gt;- Each graphic comes in two possible styles: one with black outlines, the other one with colored outlines for less contrast. As there are also many variations for characters, there is a numeration system which is utilized throughout every resource pack&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="futuristicvehicles"&gt;&lt;a id="futuristicvehicles"&gt;Futuristic Vehicles&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bf1a321c8ca41bf79bc56c61a59fbd4783a8cfc5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=498ccfce028171c82f885e8b9bc59d11"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Not only providing modern vehicles but also futuristic ones, this pack gives you everything you need to realize traffic in your game - be it a modern or futuristic setting. Create stations and bus stops with the A5 and B tileset included (RPG Maker MV/MZ formats, 48x48 px tiles), and let cars, buses or a train pass by.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;- 12 unique vehicles such as cars, buses and a train with color variations, fitting modern AND futuristic settings&lt;br /&gt;- 3 more objects: barriers and garage doors&lt;br /&gt;- 2 tilesets (A5 + B) for the creation of stations, bus stops and more&lt;br /&gt;- Each graphic comes in two possible styles: one with black outlines, the other one with colored outlines for less contrast.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pixelartminingcrafting"&gt;&lt;a id="pixelartminingcrafting"&gt;Pixel Art Mining Crafting&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2e80c3bcea39cfcfd5b0d5393ebb9594ca49f5c4.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=638b72c85e54cf6c9ef33a106643da5f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;This is a pack that allows you to create your 2d pixel art mining &amp;amp; crafting prototypes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This pack contains:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- 136 Sprites for you to make a game!&lt;br&gt;- 2 Characters (Male/Female) with interchangeable heads, torsos, legs &amp;amp; arms (5 of each)&lt;br&gt;- The characters have an Idle Animation (No other animations are provided)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt25"&gt;Pay $25 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="manaseedpixelarttilesetcollection"&gt;&lt;a id="manaseedpixelarttilesetcollection"&gt;Mana Seed Pixel Art Tileset Collection&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3387c6906409a4da55b183d92911754d8c5ec2e8.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d9730f4091c0390a32277b010dee5eb1"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;This is a massive collection of hand-drawn pixel art tilesets inspired by 16-bit RPG classics. Whether you're making an epic globe-spanning action RPG, or a cozy slice-of-life farming sim, this pack covers just about any place your players need to go! This package contains more than 20 unique environments, each with various customization elements: ground textures, cliffs, walls, doors, trees, rocks, etc. There are also many standalone environmental objects suitable for any environment, like fences &amp;amp; walls, bridges, signposts, furniture, and more! Lastly, I've included a set of weather effects so you can simulate rain, snow, and cloud cover.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="childrencharactersbundle"&gt;&lt;a id="childrencharactersbundle"&gt;Children Characters Bundle&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e1be8bdb7e786e7d5a46ab85e1283c82de3094b0.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d4994475ba670a27ca400519eccb311f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;A large variety of MALE and FEMALE CHILD/TEEN HEROES and NPCs (Non-Player Characters), recorded by AUTHENTIC children/teens (not computer generated). All you need for your next project.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;That's 9410 files TOTAL! ~3 hours of sound!&lt;br&gt;They can be used as a Heroes, Villager, Merchant, Bartender, Newsboy, Beggar, Servant and more.&lt;br&gt;These packs can be used for games such as: RPG, Fantasy, Medieval, MOBA, FPS, RTS, Survival, Shooter, Action-Adventure and more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="allinonepackrpgmaker"&gt;&lt;a id="allinonepackrpgmaker"&gt;All in One Pack RPG Maker&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/51c0e73678c646554d185e6c6736fd298de7a5ee.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a76a8b3e8770915f2685bba893308ccd"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;ALL - IN -ONE -COLLECTION.---------------------------------------------&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;RPG MAKER MV / MZ READY.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is a complete set of all sets from Neonpixel. AL- IN-ONE -COLLECTION will be &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;updated with the new sets that will be released.Now 27x packs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;RPG MAKER MV/MZ &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;ALL IN ONE SET.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="cuterpggamebuilder"&gt;&lt;a id="cuterpggamebuilder"&gt;Cute RPG Game Builder&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e376b602e1f2575ae1dfcd760fe70b86246abb1f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=298bd5591ef4b4c8d9974d0bcfc23997"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;This asset was designed to jump start your game project. It includes 2 full scrolling customizable backgrounds (with multiple layers), 12 fully animated characters, spell FX, a full user interface, a full set of icons, and a full set of buttons. There are 19 premade menus that are all RPG themed and ready to go.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;It's perfect for any 2D RPG game!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="fantasynordicgui"&gt;&lt;a id="fantasynordicgui"&gt;Fantasy Nordic GUI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e7a2699b3133d0b189914f92ca16f169497dffeb.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=92cf5f9df91e55eca2b42cd245ed7c35"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Presenting a fantasy-inspired Scandinavian UI kit, designed to bring a unique atmosphere and style to your game project. This kit is perfect for PC, Xbox, and PlayStation platforms and makes an excellent addition to any fantasy-themed game.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Inspired by classic RPGs and original artistic elements, this UI kit highlights the uniqueness of your game world, creating a memorable interface.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gamefantasyguikit"&gt;&lt;a id="gamefantasyguikit"&gt;Game Fantasy GUI Kit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a27bdfdc94394f4a5768b7846a478bb74e4d20ce.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=52623f060408a8be69729d4be03a5ff7"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Presenting an extensive fantasy-style UI pack that perfectly complements your games, adding a stylish modern design in 4K resolution (3840x2160).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Advantages:&lt;br&gt;All elements are provided in PSD (Photoshop) as smart objects, allowing easy scaling without quality loss. Most effects are achieved through layer styles, enabling you to copy any effect, style, and color effortlessly.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The archive includes 10 different color schemes, giving you the freedom to choose the one that suits you best. Additionally, each object comes in various shapes or patterns, providing greater design versatility. Combine, edit, and customize colors to create your dream interface.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="girlpowerpack2"&gt;&lt;a id="girlpowerpack2"&gt;Girl Power Pack 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/61723dd0b7fd5e980d37e23b5d4e23c796bbbf64.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e77c8edd425af874089a866f4c4cc2fc"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Pack of 10 heroes for your game. Each containing 5 animations for 2 directions. Warriors, Archers, Mages, etc.&lt;br&gt;5 Animations(for 2 directions):&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;– Idle&lt;br&gt;– Go&lt;br&gt;– Attack&lt;br&gt;– Death&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="girlpowerpack1"&gt;&lt;a id="girlpowerpack1"&gt;Girl Power Pack 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/70f420b7b853c6710cce82e23856abfc8f314551.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2140f1764bacca895311389bff5e84ce"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Pack of 10 heroes for your game. Each containing 5 animations for 2 directions. Warriors, Archers, Mages, etc.&lt;br&gt;5 Animations(for 2 directions):&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;– Idle&lt;br&gt;– Go&lt;br&gt;– Attack&lt;br&gt;– Death&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="rpgandmmoui5"&gt;&lt;a id="rpgandmmoui5"&gt;RPG &amp; MMO UI 5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/18e68cf56a81c2da6301a5a09d49ab53083e55ca.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=34f8ed169af0d9a4a8a515623a87f198"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;The best interface is a flexible interface. This collection represents an overall collection of assets designed for both MMORPGs and traditional RPGs interfaces. The grunge design with unique coloring makes this the perfect interface solution to make your project stand out from the rest.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The product features:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;More than 35 elements &amp;amp; Icons&lt;br&gt;PSD Files&lt;br&gt;Sliced Images (PNG)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="spellsvariationscompletecollection2"&gt;&lt;a id="spellsvariationscompletecollection2"&gt;Spells Variations Complete Collection 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f3880db6c52accb1c65cdb77d6c26d2f792472d5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=90eb4406fcc48a090bc9c48c34eee091"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Spell Variations – Complete Collection is the ultimate magic sound bundle, combining all 4 spell sound libraries into one powerful package. Inside, you’ll discover an extensive range of spells, elemental forces, dark incantations, arcane rituals, healing charms, summonings, enchanting whooshes, and much more, delivering a complete arsenal of magical sound effects for any creative project.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This collection features 1,268 premium-quality sound effects, meticulously organized into 143 unique spell types, each with multiple variations to ensure no spell ever sounds the same, even when reused.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every spell type is carefully named and organized into dedicated folders, giving you intuitive navigation and maximum flexibility for magical scenes, game mechanics, cinematic transitions, or immersive soundscapes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="guiprosurvivalclean"&gt;&lt;a id="guiprosurvivalclean"&gt;GUI Pro Survival Clean&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ea23f104498120f2e4c7f699ee8c67ae700a996d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=193d3c19bab622798acaa79cc2a8b1d2"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;◼ Key Features&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- 2560x1440 resolution graphics&lt;br&gt;- Various pictogram icons and item icons provided&lt;br&gt;- Sliced elements and white elements for customizable size and color&lt;br&gt;- Coding and animation not included&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;◼ Assets&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- 1700+ sources as PNG&lt;br&gt;- 300 pictogram icons (64x64, 128x128, 256x256, 512x512)&lt;br&gt;- 90 unique item icons (128x128, 256x256, 512x512)&lt;br&gt;- ⛔ Important : Not included editable files. (PSD, SVG, etc)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="combatsoundsbundlecollection"&gt;&lt;a id="combatsoundsbundlecollection"&gt;Combat Sounds Bundle&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/469a70828c7c2128245b9272f3d082dae756a48c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b9f2e6f45b7ad68706a60882f64b7e2f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Combat Sounds Bundle&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A collection of 6 published packs. A total of 719 combat sound effects that will enhance the sound of your project!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Packs included:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Anime Combat Sounds&lt;br&gt;- Blood &amp;amp; Wound Sounds&lt;br&gt;- Fantasy Combat Sounds (volume 01)&lt;br&gt;- Fantasy Combat Sounds (volume 02)&lt;br&gt;- Punches &amp;amp; Fighting Sounds&lt;br&gt;- Sword Combat Sounds (weapons)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="userinterfacesfxbundle"&gt;&lt;a id="userinterfacesfxbundle"&gt;User Interface SFX Bundle&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6a7ad45baff8baae1d5ab783e842770262cd2c82.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=306c87b20703347b267d2c6e59280426"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;User Interface - SFX Bundle&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A collection of 7 published packs. A total of 883 combat sound effects that will enhance the sound of your project!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Packs included:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Clicks Sounds&lt;br&gt;- Coins Sounds&lt;br&gt;- General UI Sounds&lt;br&gt;- Inventory Sounds Volume 01&lt;br&gt;- Minimalistic Clicks&lt;br&gt;- RPG Inventory Sounds&lt;br&gt;- RPG Shop Sounds&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="guipro_fantasyrpg_gamedevmarket"&gt;&lt;a id="guipro_fantasyrpg_gamedevmarket"&gt;GUI Pro Fantasy RPG&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/27223ef3b40897243f93832134193726091cdb32.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=199e4fb5fa9abdabf473c3f89be6e9d7"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;◼ Key Features&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- 1920x1080 resolution graphics&lt;br&gt;- Various pictogram icons and item icons provided&lt;br&gt;- Sliced elements and white elements for customizable size and color&lt;br&gt;- Coding and animation not included ◼ Assets&lt;br&gt;- 1200+ sources as PNG&lt;br&gt;- 361 pictogram icons (White Icon : 32x32, 64x64, 128x128, 256x256, 512x512)&lt;br&gt;- 90 unique item icons (no shadow, shadow : 32x32, 64x64, 128x128, 256x256, 512x512) - 45 equip icons (no shadow, shadow : 32x32, 64x64, 128x128, 256x256, 512x512)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- ⛔ Important : Not included in the PSD (UI, All icons, Backgrounds, Characters)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="scificharactercreator"&gt;&lt;a id="scificharactercreator"&gt;SciFi Character Creator&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/62805ea88d304fab3859f91e8508f41393fb92a1.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d51902991eeb7eba9a135e30fe0ef776"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;The Scifi Character Creator will enable you to create your own Scifi themed characters. With over 1000 parts, you can create the perfect character for your game.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Features include:&lt;br&gt;Male and female models&lt;br&gt;Pistol, SMG, and Blaster Weapons&lt;br&gt;Completely customizable outfits with thousands of combinations&lt;br&gt;Customizable Eyes, Eyebrows, Nose, Mouths, Head Shape, and Hair&lt;br&gt;6 animations without weapon: idle, walk, jump up, jump down, die, dead&lt;br&gt;9 animations with weapon: idle, walk, jump up, jump down, die, dead, shoot, raise gun, drop gun&lt;br&gt;Muzzle flare visual fx&lt;br&gt;Character Creator UI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="humanvocalsvol1"&gt;&lt;a id="humanvocalsvol1" href="https://youtu.be/Wgjk5MBcYQI"&gt;Human Vocals Vol 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e6965308e045790dce06ecf7e1e6946b613c566c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1d1695dce50591b1add1f45ecbe1ca67"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;A large variety of MALE and FEMALE VOCAL SOUNDS (adults, teens, kids and seniors).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;All you need for your next project.&lt;br&gt;This pack contains variations of different emotions, movement and interaction sounds. No dialogues.&lt;br&gt;These unique royalty-free phrases were carefully mixed and mastered to match your project.&lt;br&gt;They can be used for games such as: RPG, Fantasy, Medieval, Military, Sci-Fi, MOBA, FPS, RTS, Survival, Shooter, Action-Adventure and more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="humanvocalsvol2"&gt;&lt;a id="humanvocalsvol2"&gt;Human Vocals Vol 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e8ee3114bea55989d0219711eec323ad9ffb5d54.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ae31228d11fcdf633752b8deefd984a1"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;A large variety of MALE and FEMALE VOCAL SOUNDS (adults, teens, kids and seniors).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;All you need for your next project.&lt;br&gt;This pack contains variations of different emotions, movement and interaction sounds. No dialogues.&lt;br&gt;These unique royalty-free phrases were carefully mixed and mastered to match your project.&lt;br&gt;They can be used for games such as: RPG, Fantasy, Medieval, Military, Sci-Fi, MOBA, FPS, RTS, Survival, Shooter, Action-Adventure and more.&lt;br&gt;It is also perfect for animations, trailers, YouTube videos, and all other audio / visual productions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="monsterandmagicbundle"&gt;&lt;a id="monsterandmagicbundle"&gt;Monster &amp; Magic Bundle&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/23a1716bf198c54d08626ead58d4e9d2d2971baa.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=25faadb152e5052b78fbeb62ad2e1d49"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;A lot of monsters are appearing and to defeat them you will need a lot of magic and spells. With this pack you can be on the side of the monsters or get the power of magic and fight against them. Bring your video game to life with 512 monster and magic sounds, categorized in an intuitive and easy way. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Includes 4 libraries in total: &lt;br /&gt;Elemental Spells Vol 1: Defined for elemental magic of all types.&lt;br /&gt;Fantasy Magic Weapons Vol 1: Geared towards magical swords and bows&lt;br /&gt;Monster Library Vol 1: Small and medium sized monsters set in many famous games.&lt;br /&gt;Monster Library Vol 2: Oversized Monsters&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Features:&lt;br /&gt;521 Monster And Magics sounds Effects&lt;br /&gt;Number of Audio Waves: 512&lt;br /&gt;Number of Audio Cues: 512&lt;br /&gt;Sample rate / bit rate: 48.000 Hz &amp;amp; 44.100 Hz / 16 Bit&lt;br /&gt;Do Sound FX loop: Yes&lt;br /&gt;Minutes of audio provided: 18 minutes and 38 seconds&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="fantasyspellbook"&gt;&lt;a id="fantasyspellbook"&gt;Fantasy Spellbook&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d7704e09f89f47fe1a2ca5e8b018b7dcea95646f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f1fe67144010eacc56640e86ab65afda"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Customisable fantasy spellbook that will fit well any RPG, TCG and fantasy games. You will compose different magic books using this kit. For example: book of Fire, book of Earth, Book of Wind and book of Water by using appropriate layers. Or you can mix layers by your own and get your own version. Customization options also include different book corners, bookclasps, book covers and bookmarks for different types of magic and several versions for spell tooltips. There is also a set of card fronts: for Earth, Fire, Wind and Water. This means that you can use it for trading card game as well. It has realistic look and feel, rich textures and high level of details. This spellbook will work great both for AAA+ games and for indies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="2dfantasycharacterspack"&gt;&lt;a id="2dfantasycharacterspack"&gt;2D Fantasy Characters&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/484894e1bdf0d98d92065374a5410ce07bad41c5.png?auto=compress,format&amp;w=616&amp;s=bbe44d22aa2b5c752292de3a269eaa8e"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c92c705f55ed5b99a55bb9ef7b1d34d08c0ce772.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=edcc6349a51e1a8525324bb4c0c23ef4"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;This set includes 51 Fantasy characters with backgrounds. Also all characters have transparent background so you can place it on any surface you need.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="characteravataricons"&gt;&lt;a id="characteravataricons"&gt;Character Avatar Icons&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f78d9d21edad3b9176459661c7eacfc1b29a354f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=510b6050d089fa3c6d222cd857436421"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Set of 65 hand drawn character avatar icons. Each icon is 512&amp;times;512 pixels size (PNG). All Icons have transparent background.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="soundofsurvivalvol1"&gt;&lt;a id="soundofsurvivalvol1"&gt;The Sound of Survival Vol 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f3cb3404f36887762b57775db6937503c28b6bfc.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b9175cb47ca55a83ecf3d0461cf0cb9b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;"The Sound of Survival" is a comprehensive sound library designed for survival games, inspired by the most iconic titles in the genre. It consists of 598 fully categorized sound effects, recorded at the highest possible quality in 24 bits, and available in two sampling frequencies, 192Khz and 96Khz. This extensive sound collection has been meticulously crafted with the needs of those who want practically all the sounds of a survival game in one package in mind, offering an immersive and realistic auditory experience for your game project.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="rpgandmmoui4"&gt;&lt;a id="rpgandmmoui4"&gt;RPG &amp; MMO UI 4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0e48e0988d8653778c5e27cc6cc4dbd2028a45f2.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=727ea49d7642cb02ab5025768c1b9005"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;The best interface is a flexible interface. This collection represents an overall collection of assets designed for both MMORPGs and traditional RPGs interfaces. The sleak design and unique coloring make this the perfect interface solution to make your product stand out from the rest.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;WebGL Demo&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The product features:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;PSD Files&lt;br /&gt;Sliced Textures&lt;br /&gt;More than 35 elements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pixelrpgdungeonsmonsters"&gt;&lt;a id="pixelrpgdungeonsmonsters"&gt;Pixel RPG Dungeons Monsters&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7688e9661a60e4da1827758996db9b29ed9cbc71.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=56696c701458089ecb883f76ae6e811e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Pixel RPG Dungeons Monsters 16x16&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; This is a collection of various fantasy monsters, animated in idle position and in a size of 16x16px. These monsters can be used in fantasy role-playing games, roguelike games, dungeon crawling games and much more. What is included in this asset pack?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;TOTAL of over 100 unique monsters in 16x16 size in pixelart style&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;(117 different monsters in total).&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Dragoons, slimes, goblins, gnolls, elementals, lizard men, and much more to make your dungeon populated and much more interesting!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="futuristicoutlands"&gt;&lt;a id="futuristicoutlands"&gt;Futuristic Outlands&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/cff8238e0253665c6bae1902c0c691187d5f5cc1.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ae80ec5f1388a718361209ab17807b36"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;With the Futuristic Outlands pack you can finally create exciting environments for your heroes to explore - colorful forests, rough mountain areas, luminous lakes, poisonous swamps, wild jungles, bleak landscapes and more! As always, this pack is perfectly compatible with all of my other asset packs of the Futuristic series. It offers you graphics in common RPG Maker MV/MZ formats (48x48 px tiles).&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;- 17 unique tilesets + color variations (including A1, A2, A4 and A5)&lt;br /&gt;- 16 new character sprites with numerous variations&lt;br /&gt;- 4 unique animals (bird, butterfly, fish, alien creature)&lt;br /&gt;- 20 additional character sets such as character statues, animated bushes, fruits and water effects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="futuristicdungeons"&gt;&lt;a id="futuristicdungeons"&gt;Futuristic Dungeons&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/31705cf2f5e60dae9c5c08f9b77b519702ddf378.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1ba362d54b8296c39e38ffb2bf5c7418"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Rinober&amp;rsquo;s Futuristic Dungeons gives you everything you need to develop a basic game with a modern or futuristic setting. Create incredible dungeons in a futuristic, modern, or "classic" style with this pack, which offers you several possibilities for different settings: caves, mines, alien worlds, laboratories, server rooms, discos and more. This pack contains graphics in common RPG Maker MV/MZ formats, including all necessary tilesets (A1, A2, A4, A5, B, C, D, E), plenty of character sets ranging from people to objects, and parallaxes for background effects.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;- Each graphic comes in two styles: one with black outlines, the other one with colored outlines for less contrast.&lt;br /&gt;- 11 tilesets (22 sets in total, taking into consideration both outline styles)!&lt;br /&gt;- 16 unique characters with numerous variations (clothing, hair style, skin color), resulting in a total of 314 character sets!&lt;br /&gt;- 38 character sets with objects such as doors, chests, traps, character's holograms, puzzle elements and more!&lt;br /&gt;- 9 parallaxes for the creation of background effects!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="futuristiccities"&gt;&lt;a id="futuristiccities"&gt;Futuristic Cities&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4cc2f59669fc0261be1b5dd493b9625039dc6918.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e8e982854a5e8ccc2b1677251e8c3c8f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;The Futuristic Cities pack gives you everything you need to develop a basic game with a modern or futuristic setting. Create your own, incredible cities with both exteriors and interiors, as well as lots of details to make your cities come alive! This pack offers you graphics in common RPG Maker MV/MZ formats, including all necessary tilesets from A1 to A5 and several character sets ranging from people to objects.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;- There are two styles available: One with black outlines for strong contrasts and one with colored outlines for less contrasts. Choose the one you like the most or even combine them!&lt;br /&gt;- 11 tilesets which you can create modern and futuristic-looking cities with, including interiors and exteriors (22 sets in total, taking into consideration both outline styles)&lt;br /&gt;- 16 unique characters with numerous variations (clothing, hairstyle, skin color), resulting in a total of 405 character sets. Reuse your characters in certain situations, let them change their clothes and make the best of your NPCs!&lt;br /&gt;- 31 character sets with objects such as doors, chests, paintings and cupboard variations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="monstersavataricons"&gt;&lt;a id="monstersavataricons"&gt;Monsters Avatar Icons&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1627d44c96cecfbf9302c8fc7ccb98050e51cf76.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=22742cb7555e0c48a48777d9e5ed8a87"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Set of 97 hand drawn monsters avatar icons. Each icon is 512&amp;times;512 pixels size (PNG).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pixelartmedievalinteriors2"&gt;&lt;a id="pixelartmedievalinteriors2"&gt;Pixel Art Medieval Interiors 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2e11356bcc037b6a914f62f352e09cddc34fe419.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e6dece2c273acb336d8671c2ee605b97"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Medieval Interior set Retro style tile set 111 retro pixel art sprites (Top down perspective) format PNG and PNG+Alpha Base 64&amp;times;64 three tile sheets: Brick room-Stone room-Props Animated sequences for torches&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pixelartrpgvfx"&gt;&lt;a id="pixelartrpgvfx"&gt;Pixel Art RPG VFX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e130bd80b887b12e18b8a3f6bc765f158be82ff0.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a5633ffae98d4108d14b3b4ce2514618"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;This asset contains 636 VFX hand drawned sprites you can use to create your 2D pixel art RPG game!&lt;br /&gt;These are animated into 108 different animations. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="ambiencesoundspack"&gt;&lt;a id="ambiencesoundspack"&gt;Ambience Sounds Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e638c03c6d0fe8db046f8f59a016ae504f3aa693.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=cf405341806ab95741c860409e2a8acc"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Here's my new pack: &amp;ldquo;Ambience Sounds Pack&amp;ldquo;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I wanted to create a ambience pack covering different scenarios both in a nature and urban setting so you are all covered.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I hope you enjoy implementing this sounds in your project!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="2dtopdowncharacterbundle"&gt;&lt;a id="2dtopdowncharacterbundle"&gt;2D Top Down Character Bundle&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7337a70368d5b90d6e31d9f6a678e61f7c4a5bc5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=34d141863c060199d50c7fc1bf9bd42d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&amp;ndash; A Huge Bundle of 2D Characters for your games! &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;136 Flash Animated Characters (Animate CC) with sprite sheets!!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;2048 x 8029 Spritesheet Size &amp;ndash; 512 x 512 frames&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;ndash; Smaller frame sizes 128&amp;times;128 and 64&amp;times;64 are in unity project as well for use.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You can use these for tons of game ideas (platform, tower defense, rpg, etc&amp;hellip;).&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Characters are in 4 Views (up, down, left, right) and 4 animations Idle, Walk, Attack, Death.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="2dbuildingstown"&gt;&lt;a id="2dbuildingstown"&gt;2D Buildings Town&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e906438ab81e9822fca720146e1857cf890dfc1d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=bbc9e1b1849e3e744e3254501a82a16a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;A collection of 2D casual town buildings designed for village, base-building, and progression systems.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The pack includes castles, arenas, temples, markets, storage buildings, statues, altars, and other decorative objects. Several buildings feature visual upgrade stages, making it easy to represent town growth and progression.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Perfect for casual RPGs, idle games, tycoon games, and town-building projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="fantasyuibloodline"&gt;&lt;a id="fantasyuibloodline"&gt;Fantasy UI Bloodline&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/782454e6d4b867424ce955f6c8ea48962d0ff588.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=bcc7108caa2340ee5090349b666b1cac"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Designed to fit any RPG or MMO game, Bloodline contains all the base elements you may need for your game. Looking dark and stylish with fantasy elements this interface will bring your game to the next level.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every element is sliced and sorted in properly named folders for quick usage. In case you dont like how it's sliced, full version of the psd files are included with user friendly grouped layers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The package also contains a character platform 3D model, that fits the interface style.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The product features:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;More than 50 Elements &amp;amp; Icons&lt;br&gt;Sliced images&lt;br&gt;3D platform&lt;br&gt;PSD files&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="mmorpguikit"&gt;&lt;a id="mmorpguikit"&gt;MMORPG UI Kit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b063847c479b12c87369c08307f1f3a1485b35b9.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=759aaafa15720b7c85ed43a581fe8fe7"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;This is MMORPG user interface design kit.Included in this purchase is one large .PSD file in a big resolution 3300x2300.The file contains a number of premade elements, suitable for any MMORPG game UI. All the functional elements have differents states and can be edited and changed quickly. This interface kit has a high level of details and textures. All the files are well structured and layered. A .help file is also in place.Recommended for MMORPG developers and more!It has the pixel quality required for iOS and will be also perfect for building into Unity and Unreal engines and others as well.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pixelartrpgtopdowncharacters"&gt;&lt;a id="pixelartrpgtopdowncharacters"&gt;Pixel Art RPG Top Down Characters&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0c547524b60bd4cb921ada5ffb87e8588cd9fe9c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=70c3805ba78268a7408b5862eed83023"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;This asset contains 4 characters you can use to create your 2D pixel art Top-Down RPG game! &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This pack contains:&lt;br&gt;- A Viking (Animations: Idle, Attack 1, 2, 3, Dead, Get hit, Walk Right, Walk Left, Walk Down, Walk Up)&lt;br&gt;- A Druid (Animations: Idle, Attack 1, 2, 3, Dead, Get hit, Walk Right, Walk Left, Walk Down, Walk Up)&lt;br&gt;- A Blood Mage (Animations: Idle, Attack 1, 2, 3, Dead, Get hit, Walk Right, Walk Left, Walk Down, Walk Up)&lt;br&gt;- A Magic Rogue (Animations: Idle, Attack 1, 2, 3, Dead, Get hit, Walk Right, Walk Left, Walk Down, Walk Up)&lt;br&gt;- Select to show which one you are focusing or help on the targeting of your game.&lt;br&gt;- Spell effects (Blood explosion, Health recovery, Spikes, Spikes 2, Poison, Roots)&lt;br&gt;- All the sprites have a transparent background&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="sci-ficharactersicons"&gt;&lt;a id="sci-ficharactersicons"&gt;SciFi Characters Icons&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/771a003064b19bb4d9beef082530fffcf7369b4f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ed6763f8ecf9eddc0bd3214ada584556"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Set of 60 hand drawn Sci-Fi character avatar icons. All icons have transparent background so you can place it on any surface you need. Each icon is 256×256 pixels size (PNG).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="mobsavataricons"&gt;&lt;a id="mobsavataricons"&gt;Mobs Avatar Icons&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5fdca7342021d0c0d124adb452a1fa5c4ceb9a84.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=51855ae8c3c48f9ed075efcef886763a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Set of 133 hand drawn mobs avatar icons. All avatars have transparent background so you can place it on any surface you need. Each icon is 256&amp;times;256 pixels size (PNG).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pixelartmedievalinteriors"&gt;&lt;a id="pixelartmedievalinteriors"&gt;Pixel Art Medieval Interiors&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/014005dd68adcf2cd447517d05bdccac6c748f0d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b4067b4716b1a788a7d1e39803ef1891"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Medieval Interior set&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bedroom items, basements items and kitchen items&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Retro style tile set&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;64 retro pixel art sprites (Top down perspective)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;format PNG and PNG+Alpha&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Base 64×64&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pixelartrpgtopdownenemies"&gt;&lt;a id="pixelartrpgtopdownenemies"&gt;Pixel Art RPG Top Down Enemies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/19ea0146b9d76be75821803b8117a52373bce798.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2393dc4252e7169513a8f73cd70011ba"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;This asset contains 5 Enemies you can use to create your 2D pixel art Top-Down RPG game!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Each enemy has it's own animations. - Beaver enemy (Idle, Attack, Dead, Get hit) - Ghost enemy (Idle, Attack, Dead, Get hit) - Mage enemy (Idle, Attack, Dead, Get hit) - Necromancer enemy (Idle, Attack, Dead, Get hit) - Salamander enemy (Idle, Attack, Dead, Get hit) - All the sprites have transparent background&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="oldmagicianvoicepack"&gt;&lt;a id="oldmagicianvoicepack"&gt;Old Magician Voice Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/660df455ee94db6707b9b6dad1685c9aa7376453.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=87e337af55d84d6ca90ee4c7d32d4f84"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;291 Voice lines. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I hope this voices will help you give more life to your characters in your project. There's different voices for different situations: dialogues, attacks, hurts, expressions (like upset, laugh, nervous, afraid, confused, surprised)... Also there's sleeping sounds!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="monstersoundsvolume1"&gt;&lt;a id="monstersoundsvolume1"&gt;Monster Sounds Volume 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6a69e8bdc68776b5b6e9df93a6e2ce62b2cfc3bb.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3086191ab17b455432b952cae9204379"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;The approach for this pack was to create some disgusting and fearsome monster sounds so you can create cool experiences for your audience! In this pack there are: Attacks, Growls, Arachnid SFX, beasts SFX, demonic SFX, Hurt sounds, different type of monsters, Undead SFX, also I made some shorter monsters (more high-pith).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;They can be used in different styles of video games or other media projects.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;I hope you enjoy implementing this sounds in your project!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
