"#dwarfwizard"&gt;Dwarf Wizard&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#elfarcher_tmf"&gt;Elf Archer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#drowassassin"&gt;Drow Assassin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#halfelfqueen"&gt;Half Elf Queen&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#gnomewarlock"&gt;Gnome Warlock&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#humanking"&gt;Human King&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#humandemonhunter"&gt;Human Demon Hunter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#infiltrationsquad"&gt;Infiltration Squad&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#demolitionsquad"&gt;Demolition Squad&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#heavyassaultsquad"&gt;Heavy Assault Squad&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#snipersquad"&gt;Sniper Squad&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#tacticalsquad"&gt;Tactical Squad&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#valhallagate"&gt;Valhalla Gate&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#vikingchurch"&gt;Viking Church&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#vikingporthouse"&gt;Viking Port house&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#vikingroundhouse"&gt;Viking Round House&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#vikingwindmill"&gt;Viking Windmill&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#vikingfightingpit"&gt;Viking Fighting Pit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#dwarfbattlerager"&gt;Dwarf Battlerager&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#mountaingiant"&gt;Mountain Giant&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#stormherald"&gt;Storm Herald&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#zealotbarbarian"&gt;Zealot Barbarian&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#orcberserker"&gt;Orc Berserker&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#minotaurwarrior"&gt;Minotaur Warrior&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#stormgiant"&gt;Storm Giant&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#valkyrie"&gt;Valkyrie&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cart"&gt;Cart&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#gallows"&gt;Gallows&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bathtub"&gt;Bathtub&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bedset"&gt;Bed set&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#woodencrane"&gt;Wooden Crane&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#storehouse_v1"&gt;Store House_v1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#storehouse_v2"&gt;Store House_v2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#treehouse"&gt;Tree House&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#aarakocra"&gt;Aarakocra&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#armourer"&gt;Armourer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#dwarvenking"&gt;Dwarven King&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#balistarcanonandcrew_dwarfarmy"&gt;Balistar Canon &amp; Crew - Dwarf Army&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#berserkerdwarves_setof5"&gt;Berserker Dwarves - Set of 5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#highelves_horsecrew"&gt;High Elves - Horse Crew&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#highelflionclanfighter"&gt;High Elf Lion Clan Fighter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#boltthrowercrew_highelves"&gt;Bolt Thrower Crew - High Elves&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bonebreaker_dwarfarmy"&gt;Bone Breaker - Dwarf Army&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#burialmound"&gt;Burial Mound&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#butchershop"&gt;Butcher Shop&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#carnivalset"&gt;Carnival Set&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#chariotcrew_highelves"&gt;Chariot Crew - High Elves&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cogship"&gt;Cog Ship&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#goldendragon"&gt;Golden Dragon&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="animalcompanionpack_setof5"&gt;&lt;a id="animalcompanionpack_setof5"&gt;Animal Companion Pack - Set of 5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/61e265b9982bcf846d7ff3d1012786bf59379ee3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=db077a22340907f8afadad86188805e6"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Animal Companion Pack gathers five faithful familiars—wolf, bear, panther, hawk and owl—each sculpted at crisp 32 mm heroic scale. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Supplied in both pre‑supported and clean STL files, every creature is keyed to scenic bases and test‑printed on 8 K MSLA machines for plug‑and‑play success. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Perfect as ranger beasts, druid's wild‑shape options or painting projects, this set lets you populate a bestiary with a single download and a lifetime personal licence.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="frostgiant"&gt;&lt;a id="frostgiant"&gt;Frost Giant&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/fcbf39bfdb363a10eed1bbd8aab0cfa13c665ff1.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=aa9986675c9909831f232413394489b9"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ice‑forged conqueror towering at 115 mm, wielding runic great‑sword and glacier shield. Snow drift base supplied.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="taverncounterset"&gt;&lt;a id="taverncounterset"&gt;Tavern Counter Set&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/cb5b89cc755840bc9e0b6abbfeb4175acee39fa7.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=570a4f9c22244896f2e901c8c675821e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bar counter, ale kegs, mugs, shelves and cash box for instant inn dressing. Pegged joins for sturdy assembly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="weaponry"&gt;&lt;a id="weaponry"&gt;Weaponry&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/de33579a40446fc53cec77246e8a2f5050659cf6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=12bacf847d382ede08573fa4f3e9399c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Racks of swords, spears, maces and shields—perfect armoury scatter. Files arranged both single‑part and separated.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="tortureset"&gt;&lt;a id="tortureset"&gt;Torture Set&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ff7df1982a454704c1af085ffa7465884363e5c4.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=df5db316c5ccc2510be6675b1914bbc5"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dungeon accessories including rack, iron maiden, shackles and branding brazier. Each prop pre‑supported.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="longhouse"&gt;&lt;a id="longhouse"&gt;Long House&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2134c1a2c36272bf96f04d504ea866134a84b733.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6d0f6b870604890cbaa8dc7343156e03"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build your stronghold with the Long House, a grand Norse hall featuring a steep-pitched timber roof, carved gable beams, sturdy plank walls and a removable roof for interior play. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Perfect as a chieftain's seat, feast hall or village centrepiece, it brings authentic Viking-age character to any tabletop. Scaled for 28-32 mm play, the building prints in sectional slices with both pre-supported and unsupported STL files, hollowed for resin efficiency on consumer machines. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Knotted woodgrain, shingle and carved-dragon details reward washes and dry-brushing. Pair it with other Norse structures to raise a complete settlement. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Supplied with a lifetime personal licence for unlimited prints.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="highelves_theslayer"&gt;&lt;a id="highelves_theslayer"&gt;High Elves - The Slayer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9ab89b1bce25f675f88e64e84de6eecd640eae20.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=837e25cf92487a991d7400352e7d22d0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Field a deadly duellist with The Slayer, a lithe high-elf warrior caught mid-lunge with twin blades flashing and a flowing cloak trailing behind. &lt;br&gt;Sleek scale-armour, braided hair and an intense expression capture elven martial precision in a dynamic action pose. &lt;br&gt;Sculpted for 32 mm play, the model arrives in keyed parts with both pre-supported and raw STL files, hollowed for resin efficiency. &lt;br&gt;Crisp armour edges and fabric folds reward washes and edge-highlighting on consumer MSLA machines. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ideal as a unit champion, character model or skirmish hero, The Slayer brings speed and lethality to any high-elf force. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Supplied with a lifetime personal licence for unlimited prints.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="mausoleum"&gt;&lt;a id="mausoleum"&gt;Mausoleum&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f2f7e8cecbccc906ea44cb67346887bcb6101ddc.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3fb3c9760c2a0ab85a3abec030d0bffa"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Haunt your battlefield with the Mausoleum, a gothic stone tomb crowned with statuary, iron gates and weathered relief carvings. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This brooding terrain piece serves as a graveyard centrepiece, dungeon entrance or objective marker for undead encounters and horror scenarios. &lt;br&gt;Scaled for 28-32 mm play, it prints in sectional pieces with both pre-supported and unsupported STL files, hollowed with drain channels to save resin. &lt;br&gt;Mossy masonry, cracked statues and rusted ironwork reward washes and dry-brushing on consumer machines. &lt;br&gt;Drop it into cemeteries, ruined estates or cursed crypts to add narrative atmosphere and verticality. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Supplied with a lifetime personal licence for unlimited terrain prints.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="highelvesprince"&gt;&lt;a id="highelvesprince"&gt;High Elves Prince&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b096c03e82ad601910cf8a54adc3d5954d88be5d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=aad677a30b8203ee8d4f511bfcb7ec50"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lead your host with the High Elves Prince, a regal commander in ornate scale-armour and flowing cloak, sword raised to rally the line. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Filigreed pauldrons, a crested helm and an embossed shield capture noble elven majesty, rewarding dedicated painters with abundant surface detail. &lt;br&gt;Sculpted for 32 mm heroic scale, the model splits into keyed parts with both pre-supported and raw STL files, hollowed for resin efficiency. &lt;br&gt;Print cleanly on consumer MSLA machines and anchor your high-elf army with a charismatic leader. Ideal as a command stand, character model or display centrepiece. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Supplied with a lifetime personal licence so the prince can lead as many battles as you wish.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="giantsandheroesbustcollection_setof8busts"&gt;&lt;a id="giantsandheroesbustcollection_setof8busts"&gt;Giants and Heroes Bust Collection - Set of 8 Busts&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/03851c03ff41e6e65f4535f72f008d5820fb9fef.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2beb6dee63d216f18ed8119d584b2fa4"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Eight epic busts—Frost Giant, Storm Herald, Mountain Giant, Zealot Barbarian, Orc Berserker, Minotaur Warrior, Dwarf Battlerager and Valkyrie—capture larger‑than‑life personalities in showcase scale. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Each bust is hollowed, keyed and pre‑supported for resin efficiency while retaining razor‑sharp detail in skin, armour and braided hair. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ideal for display painting or campaign props, the collection comes with clean meshes, printer‑friendly wall thicknesses and a lifetime personal licence.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="abandonedbuildingspack_setof5"&gt;&lt;a id="abandonedbuildingspack_setof5"&gt;Abandoned Buildings Pack - Set of 5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6ebcccfc348d683b4a96aa9e8f9c75e06abd5aec.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4686c712be509ffb58598b44314c594f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Transform any tabletop into a forsaken hamlet with five modular ruins featuring shattered timber frames, cracked stone foundations and printable interiors. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Walls cap at 120 mm to fit most resin vats, and each piece is hollowed with drain channels to save resin. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Mix‑and‑match floor plates allow endless board configurations while keyed joins ensure easy assembly. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Pre‑supported files plus unsupported masters give you complete control under The Master Forge lifetime licence.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="woodlandmonsters_setof3"&gt;&lt;a id="woodlandmonsters_setof3"&gt;Woodland Monsters - Set of 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bda1ed86814bdaf6284db43431a6d45733113a7c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=7919c96168b208f302a031f7762a99a2"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;This trio of sylvan terrors—Tree Ent, Vine Wraith and Bog Crawler—emerges from the forest with twisted bark textures and creeping roots. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sculpted for 32 mm encounters, the monsters stand 65–90 mm tall atop integrated scenic bases. &lt;br&gt;Pre‑supported and unsupported files are included; each model prints in two to three keyed parts for painting access. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Add them as boss fights, druid summons or terrain scatter with unlimited personal prints.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="vikingraiderlongship"&gt;&lt;a id="vikingraiderlongship"&gt;Viking Raider Longship&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/154498242b3ac08f11924506fe02c8a268f42745.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c6e49037711e22c74316c3f34d80e77f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A 10.5‑inch long drakkar brimming with Norse flavour: carved dragon prow, Viking shields, working oar ports and removable mast. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The hull prints in segmented, keyed sections sized for mid‑size resin vats; interior planking is recessed for easy dry‑brushing. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Optional stretcher bars let you convert to an on‑table terrain piece or a seaworthy gaming prop. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Pre‑supported variants included—just slice, print, glue and set sail.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="campfiresceneset"&gt;&lt;a id="campfiresceneset"&gt;Campfire Scene Set&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5e1b4b9d629271e79559caa8eb7e2de5c10682f1.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2a35c8f16b3e4a3bf89e43f5fa71927f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Complete campsite diorama featuring flickering‑log firepit, Ring‑of‑Stones base, bedrolls, cooking tripod, stewpots and scatter logs. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Everything is scaled to 28–32 mm minis and provided in both print‑in‑place (all props on one plate) and standalone STL options. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Pre‑supported files use minimal contact points to keep surfaces clean; hollowed logs reduce material. A one‑stop download for wilderness encounters and storytelling vignettes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="midgardserpentminiature"&gt;&lt;a id="midgardserpentminiature"&gt;Midgard Serpent&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ffdf1431220df40e73e2422bcbf304555717f755.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1c7288b2a7d650b53da11e8873a395b0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Coil the seas around your players with the Midgard Serpent: a 200 mm‑long leviathan curling over a rocky base. Supplied in six keyed, hollow parts and fully pre‑supported for large‑format resin printers, the sculpt showcases scale plates, horned frills and an open maw bursting with fangs. Unsupported masters and a prescaled 75 % version are included for smaller vats. Print once or a fleet—your lifetime licence never expires.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="birdmonk"&gt;&lt;a id="birdmonk"&gt;Bird Monk&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3d8613741e3e2da991950255d5dc1e5d0096ac3f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d32c8ae16d9f48ed564beb3446b47c95"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grace in motion: this avian martial‑artist stands poised on one talon, wind‑ruffled robes sweeping around feathered limbs. Designed for 32 mm play, the model arrives in two keyed parts with both pre‑supported and raw STL files. Perfect as an Aarakocra PC, NPC mentor or exotic boss encounter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="orc_blacksmith"&gt;&lt;a id="orc_blacksmith"&gt;Orc Blacksmith&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d2866d1dacf3b0ed49285dfae6d9a57e1ace6854.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=070221954f34c053278f83dcddfdbfa4"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Add grit to your warband with the Orc Blacksmith, a hulking greenskin smith mid-strike at his anvil, sparks flying from a crude but powerful weapon-in-progress. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Muscled arms, tusked grimace and a soot-stained apron capture brutal craftsmanship perfect for orc encampments or quest-giver NPCs. Scaled for 32 mm play, the model arrives in keyed parts with both pre-supported and raw STL files, hollowed for resin efficiency. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Crisp leather, iron and hide textures reward washes and dry-brushing on consumer MSLA machines. Use him to forge narrative around orc war-camps, weapon-shops or boss lairs. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Supplied with a lifetime personal licence for unlimited prints.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="outhouse"&gt;&lt;a id="outhouse"&gt;OutHouse&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2b50ede01c127387ec18fcb312b44acf3f02eff9.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=0586bb5f893c6ea2d86629569a34de48"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Add humble charm to your settlement with the Outhouse, a rickety timber privy complete with crescent-moon door cut-out, weathered planking and a slumping shingle roof.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This compact scatter piece brings everyday realism to villages, farmsteads and frontier towns, and makes for a great comedic objective or hiding spot. Scaled for 28-32 mm play, it prints quickly support-free on FDM or resin machines, with both pre-supported and unsupported STL files included. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Knotted woodgrain and gappy boards reward washes and weathering. A tiny but characterful addition that fills out any tabletop scene. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Supplied with a lifetime personal licence for unlimited prints.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="potionshop"&gt;&lt;a id="potionshop"&gt;Potion Shop&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e936013c4dab1f63e84a94fe3d09c8beff7cc586.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4e92a6fac63f85b81d3a44e967ac7239"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stock your town with the Potion Shop, an enchanting alchemist's storefront brimming with bottle-lined shelves, a hanging sign, mortar-and-pestle details and a timber-framed facade. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The removable roof reveals a detailed interior ready for spellcasting NPCs and mysterious side-quests. Scaled for 28-32 mm tabletop play, the building prints in sectional slices with both pre-supported and unsupported STL files, hollowed for resin efficiency on consumer machines. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Mix-and-match with other shops to build a magical market district. Crisp glasswork, woodgrain and signage textures reward painters. A story-rich centrepiece for urban adventures.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Supplied with a lifetime personal licence for unlimited prints.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="rivermill"&gt;&lt;a id="rivermill"&gt;River Mill&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/fe197641cec84995f326351881653917dab53cbc.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c0105dd02c274cb7de6c688dd433ef4f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Set the scene with the River Mill, a picturesque waterside mill featuring a turning wheel on a printable axle, stone foundation, timber upper storey and a removable roof for interior access. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Perfect as a village landmark, ambush site or objective, this terrain piece evokes pastoral fantasy settings with rich character. Scaled for 28-32 mm play, it prints in sectional pieces with both pre-supported and unsupported STL files, hollowed with drain channels to save resin. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Weathered stone, woodgrain and waterwheel textures reward washes and dry-brushing. Pair it with riverbanks and bridges to build a complete waterside scene. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Supplied with a lifetime personal licence for unlimited prints.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="smithhouse"&gt;&lt;a id="smithhouse"&gt;Smith House&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/13c6016a93b2b5d06ff646dc0bcd3a14dd02e055.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=37a98b9df9aa99a1c979c8a9b42188f4"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anchor your village with the Smith House, a sturdy blacksmith's dwelling combining a stone-and-timber forge with a comfortable living quarter and a removable roof for interior play. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Detailed chimney, workbench and shuttered windows make it both functional terrain and an atmospheric quest location. &lt;br&gt;Scaled for 28-32 mm tabletop gaming, the building prints in sectional slices with both pre-supported and unsupported STL files, hollowed for resin efficiency on consumer machines. &lt;br&gt;Crisp masonry, thatch and woodgrain textures reward painters. Mix-and-match with other buildings to grow a bustling settlement. A versatile centrepiece for town encounters.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Supplied with a lifetime personal licence for unlimited prints.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="stable_tmf"&gt;&lt;a id="stable_tmf"&gt;Stable&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e5abfb18fa0b5c1661ddc1d847e650a9e3898ee2.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5325d6d7c9db4feeae45106f30ab29fd"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Complete your settlement with the Stable, a rustic timber horse-barn featuring stall partitions, a hayloft, double doors and a removable roof for full interior access. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ideal as a coaching-inn outbuilding, ambush location or atmospheric town dressing, this terrain piece adds everyday life to any fantasy village. &lt;br&gt;Scaled for 28-32 mm play, it prints in sectional slices with both pre-supported and unsupported STL files, hollowed for resin efficiency on consumer machines. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Weathered planking, straw and ironwork textures reward washes and dry-brushing. Mix-and-match with other rural buildings to build a complete homestead. Supplied with a lifetime personal licence for unlimited prints.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt22"&gt;Pay $22 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="paladinaasimar"&gt;&lt;a id="paladinaasimar"&gt;Paladin Aasimar&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7a200e8f1448a416578ddc92018ec05197c72c09.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5b5cede4d84b3427e40425dd351e0792"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Haloed champion clad in celestial plate, longsword raised in righteous challenge. Layered armour panels, angelic sigils and flowing cape all resolve crisply on consumer resin printers thanks to thin but sturdy supports. Includes alt‑helmeted head and separate shield arm for kit‑bashing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="firbolgcleric"&gt;&lt;a id="firbolgcleric"&gt;Firbolg Cleric&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ac39f2b9c87b7c2fcda6957193246843a36f1f54.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a0391729045541ca021942e7cd0064d5"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Gentle forest giant wielding rune‑etched staff and crystal focus. Layered leaf‑cloak, carved totem accessories and a serene expression reward dedicated painters. Prints in three keyed sections, each pre‑supported and hollowed for resin efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gnomebarbarian"&gt;&lt;a id="gnomebarbarian"&gt;Gnome Barbarian&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/22430c461b9304a86f99e9198ffa8c219f704445.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=cc28bfaa29a1db8a3a60f9b2179eb5cc"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Don’t judge his size—this ferocious gnome swings a double‑headed axe as big as he is. Dynamic overhead strike pose, fur‑mantle texture and braided beard detail guaranteed to hold paint washes. Pre‑supported STL plus unsupported master included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="hobgoblinartificer"&gt;&lt;a id="hobgoblinartificer"&gt;Hobgoblin Artificer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/598ef7b84cdb5b80c747810bc714d65ee5cbc6cd.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=41c503bdac240547535bb6039e98c1e6"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Armoured tinkerer with arc‑pistol and modular backpack forge. Mechanical limbs, tool pouches and glowing rune‑cores make great NMM or OSL practice. Model splits at waist and backpack for easy airbrushing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="kenkurogue"&gt;&lt;a id="kenkurogue"&gt;Kenku Rogue&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0992389818040ab8ff13a0baac0b55fbe446e0df.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=80a70eb5de5a2e6adfce7673ca7ef3cf"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Knife‑wielding corvid skulker in layered leathers. Feather textures recessed for sharp prints; cloak underside hollowed to save resin. Choice of hood‑up or hood‑down head sculpts in the zip.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="halforcmerchant"&gt;&lt;a id="halforcmerchant"&gt;Half Orc Merchant&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4b5ef052a1302aaca09cba80ba1b8e526e411bdd.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=12f25009c8e475c9d634bf7b8a43bd86"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;World‑weary trader hefting cargo crate and ledger, ideal as quest‑giver NPC. Robust folds, coin‑pouch details and removable display base included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="halflingthief"&gt;&lt;a id="halflingthief"&gt;Halfling Thief&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f42971842db3a3683825a85e97534a6f56167ff0.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5d3ceb641918698ba72adda8080ba8b0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Clever burglar mid‑sprint with loot bag and lock‑picks. Supported at just 28 mm tall yet retains crisp facial features; unsupported file supplied for custom scaling.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="lizardfolkranger"&gt;&lt;a id="lizardfolkranger"&gt;Lizardfolk Ranger&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e636b07b3830480e4a1342390e0a8602b25fe56a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4f399f5736c775c2242456023302828d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Scale‑armoured hunter drawing recurve bow, quiver of bone‑fletched arrows, optional spear arm. Split across torso and tail for support‑free interior surfaces.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="plaguedoctor"&gt;&lt;a id="plaguedoctor"&gt;Plague Doctor&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5273031a274cb86032157ebb8b18b9e1ffcee075.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b07227d1c49f0d1049cdb6abb0cd3718"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dark‑age medic gripping torch and apothecary satchel. Beak mask, stitched leathers and potion vials textured for contrast. Includes alt hand with scalpel for horror scenarios.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="warforgedfighter"&gt;&lt;a id="warforgedfighter"&gt;Warforged Fighter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3006a82e6d0be77f99053ca37ff8ef3def35564b.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e2eceec3fa336c16d1866f5730ed643f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Arcane‑steel construct advancing with greatsword. Interlocking plate segments, glowing‑core chest and gear‑motif base: perfect for washes and edge highlights.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="changelingspy"&gt;&lt;a id="changelingspy"&gt;Changeling Spy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d35fcada2210ceec40fca194ecf35ff5b9f0afaf.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=df4fc065b3784243670d8582342dce2f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shapeshifter mid‑transition: half‑masked face and morphing limbs. Optional fully revealed and fully disguised heads provided.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="dragonbornknight"&gt;&lt;a id="dragonbornknight"&gt;Dragonborn Knight&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bf29ba0ab1ef4293abde3dbd5737e833460b7a89.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=0d8a7c3efa23efe0a73c4ff19f01c347"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Scaled paladin in drake‑themed armour, tower shield and flame‑engraved longsword. Prints in four keyed pieces; horns reinforced with internal pegs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="dwarfwizard"&gt;&lt;a id="dwarfwizard"&gt;Dwarf Wizard&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/52f80365225bfbe353cc63a2df62e447dce6a356.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=eecc6a7fc197c6f6a594791c2a04c113"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Runesmith sage clutching spellbook and rune‑hammer. Cloak embossed with Khazad script; separate smoke‑spell effect included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="elfarcher_tmf"&gt;&lt;a id="elfarcher_tmf"&gt;Elf Archer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/016f63c8079d2b8e96b41115cc7faf9c60b8c6d8.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1b052fe0a8a974c4d61327ebcb2f3e2f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Longbow champion in flowing leafmail drawing fletched arrow. Comes with quiver‑on‑hip and quiver‑on‑back variants.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="drowassassin"&gt;&lt;a id="drowassassin"&gt;Drow Assassin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a26bf00495b96b3c55479830688b262544a9f1f5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d647daebb91fb0c354686ceba850c653"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shadow‑stalker balanced on stalagmite, dual poisoned daggers ready. Includes alt posing arm with hand‑crossbow.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="halfelfqueen"&gt;&lt;a id="halfelfqueen"&gt;Half Elf Queen&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7a30eec7087ec3e167c89c325862fa22b2202fcc.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=80206df09592db785bfa0dc5c4a7cc48"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Regal sovereign on gem‑inlaid base, sceptre raised. Flowing gown drapes designed for clean support removal.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gnomewarlock"&gt;&lt;a id="gnomewarlock"&gt;Gnome Warlock&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/247fd78b61d642b150dc835f2b086338d837bdec.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=0b42b829ce79330088a42ac8b7a796a4"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Arcane prodigy casting eldritch blast; swirling energy effect prints in transparent resin beautifully.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="humanking"&gt;&lt;a id="humanking"&gt;Human King&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/767dd0a835ae52c6b9ba43f22f67b1099c390a27.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c08649b1c170b10f72debe47fc09a92b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stalwart monarch on lion‑carved throne base. Throne provided as separate STL for standalone terrain use.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="humandemonhunter"&gt;&lt;a id="humandemonhunter"&gt;Human Demon Hunter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4bfb934bf085cc4cec9db7299ae6d1ba65cb48c6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a17569c91247cab52dbdea00ea4c6ff6"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Leather‑clad hunter brandishing rune‑pistol and silvered blade, dynamic trench‑coat swirl ideal for OSL.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="infiltrationsquad"&gt;&lt;a id="infiltrationsquad"&gt;Infiltration Squad&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3a81669ee06283781e39e58a3e75267a7333be49.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9c37197718bf07f54ac56b14a9972b0a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Five covert‑ops Brokk‑r troops with suppressors, hacking rigs and stealth packs. Modular heads and weapon options, fully pre‑supported and hollowed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="demolitionsquad"&gt;&lt;a id="demolitionsquad"&gt;Demolition Squad&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bc498f0fc03ebc0392b5c7365722ac65560313e9.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5b60385b5e81efb98c6a01b97f1b7ed7"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explosive experts with breacher shields, remote charges and wrist‑fuse igniters. Modelled smoke plume effect supplied separately.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="heavyassaultsquad"&gt;&lt;a id="heavyassaultsquad"&gt;Heavy Assault Squad&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d04a45681e56bb444fcac7dd4f3e046d4dbf7c99.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a58c24d55a34881cc8a7ed73ddc46aff"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Armour‑plated juggernauts wielding rotary cannons and heat shields. Prints flawlessly at 0.03 mm layers; keyed arm sockets for pose swaps.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="snipersquad"&gt;&lt;a id="snipersquad"&gt;Sniper Squad&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bee4b32e8b0fc01192c5b6f9225da6afb4d64add.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=96bd2a38d80bec1c5e3c60dd033075f0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Long‑range marksmen with anti‑materiel rifles and deployable camo cloaks. Optional bipod‑down parts included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="tacticalsquad"&gt;&lt;a id="tacticalsquad"&gt;Tactical Squad&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/26f260e0483781e5769fce61d1470f553455f87d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=bef1d95ef912a797ff7cd917949efe41"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Core infantry unit with modular rifles, axes and banner. Squad leader has swap‑out head and power‑fist options.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="valhallagate"&gt;&lt;a id="valhallagate"&gt;Valhalla Gate&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/73a169fb54828bb3714ff0e0985729c91238a766.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=7a776f0dbbf10d5eee33194a162a2609"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grand portal crowned with rune‑arch and shield murals, scaled for 28–32 mm minis. Double doors are separate, printable pieces.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="vikingchurch"&gt;&lt;a id="vikingchurch"&gt;Viking Church&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6981878fb4a75c26e7401be02fe096fdff1ad450.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=8e2cb6c3324fba83a399b5ff9a5f5114"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stave‑style sanctuary complete with removable roof and interior pews. Prints in sectional slices for any consumer resin printer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="vikingporthouse"&gt;&lt;a id="vikingporthouse"&gt;Viking Port house&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/fea8ba7d6b34a12b606ad782d4fc0959f467d980.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=277cb035da7fca7b7b2426cb60b9e0db"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Waterside warehouse with dock posts and cargo stacks. Modular pier extension lets you build full harbour scenes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="vikingroundhouse"&gt;&lt;a id="vikingroundhouse"&gt;Viking Round House&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bbab7245869b5e9e2a74e381bf73c6b19548ddc4.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9848bc3816037779b11c06e714587e0d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Residential hut featuring timber‑plank walls, thatch roof and functional doorway. Roof halves removable for interior access.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="vikingwindmill"&gt;&lt;a id="vikingwindmill"&gt;Viking Windmill&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8930e0f90a34531c9eb7e639e86f8e426aa1e935.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d0d4685adae488ef487eac07271a37e0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rotating mill blades supplied on printable axle; stone base and timber upper storey print separately.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="vikingfightingpit"&gt;&lt;a id="vikingfightingpit"&gt;Viking Fighting Pit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/290ac22aaa53dbb70eb559680fa2482831c9b7e7.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=87545043bd59af49a4735cb82ce8732d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sunken arena with timber palisade, spectator stands and bone‑strewn floor. Perfect for gladiator side‑quests.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="dwarfbattlerager"&gt;&lt;a id="dwarfbattlerager"&gt;Dwarf Battlerager&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/33e34f0296afcf95f83a0575f6d4852d183e85a6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4bdacc500f1d2ca75e174fde4365bd1d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Armoured berserker bristling with spike plates, roaring mid‑charge. Optional helmeted head and twin‑axe arms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="mountaingiant"&gt;&lt;a id="mountaingiant"&gt;Mountain Giant&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/934bc79e6058ec516217ba037405cfb10c12ca64.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=46bc7da33ec45e4972d6f13071f7b84d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Looming 130 mm titan hefting boulder club; skin etched with cliff‑face cracks. Supported and hollowed for safe curing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="stormherald"&gt;&lt;a id="stormherald"&gt;Storm Herald&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0b0bf8472b268c3d691b71e11919646e5d608a9b.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=268aa2ee5e0bad4a5d42647eef6cf430"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Storm‑charged warrior with lightning‑wreathed hammer and billowing cape. Separate lightning effect prints in clear resin.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="zealotbarbarian"&gt;&lt;a id="zealotbarbarian"&gt;Zealot Barbarian&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2887a625648141a94af44d06b3727ebc7caa2f26.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=65edfda58590c240c3002713f4403ffb"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bare‑chested fanatic swinging twin great‑axes. Includes optional fur cloak and alternate shouting head.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="orcberserker"&gt;&lt;a id="orcberserker"&gt;Orc Berserker&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a19382f944a1e2e4ea4e376f93eea9eaf861b350.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d82e5cd8acf817084a2954bd75da4928"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Savage orc mid‑leap, cleaver raised high. Base features shattered shields and skulls for narrative impact.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="minotaurwarrior"&gt;&lt;a id="minotaurwarrior"&gt;Minotaur Warrior&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b74dd9ac7c633744513d0da4cc2feace27a39c09.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=34500a81d4b3be4bb70e47f829fbafee"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Horned labyrinth guardian gripping double‑bladed greataxe. Musculature and fur maps reward dry‑brushing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="stormgiant"&gt;&lt;a id="stormgiant"&gt;Storm Giant&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4d7782ac1f56a5e7d87faccd2d4fd63ff4f1c911.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b254e74155740db3051b6f32ba20e469"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sky‑borne monarch cloaked in thundercloud cape, trident crackling with energy. Prints in 9 keyed parts for easy painting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="valkyrie"&gt;&lt;a id="valkyrie"&gt;Valkyrie&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f4613bd553de8bf562cf53e9f5c32f1e026eb461.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=601c001375c1e644172909b68d1ed59b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Winged shield‑maiden descending with spear and round shield. Optional helmet plume and scenic rock base parts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="cart"&gt;&lt;a id="cart"&gt;Cart&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/414d04ab5f450a43611999e22136bf942153cd8f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1e3561618fcc447d8b51dde0d8969ced"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sturdy two‑wheeled cart with removable yoke and cargo bundle scatter. Prints support‑free on FDM or resin machines.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gallows"&gt;&lt;a id="gallows"&gt;Gallows&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3e791352764e7f2c865b35b08512eb39f8636460.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6ceb8ea97dac7c8d0aeb5e30358b632c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grim wooden gallows with working trap‑door platform and rope piece. Ideal for frontier towns or horror scenarios.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="bathtub"&gt;&lt;a id="bathtub"&gt;Bathtub&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/efdf59e00c819af73433cbd06d9268fd19a4c0b2.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=fe20aaf63c316488f91b24ec7dfeafc8"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Claw‑foot tub, stack of towels, soap dish and splash insert—everything you need for a medieval bathhouse scene.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="bedset"&gt;&lt;a id="bedset"&gt;Bed set&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c6961a48a2c9815d832bc49f9b49c67d5f8f0c66.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=abc98e7b22bb239a07678867ed237eb4"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Carved four‑poster bed with draped curtains, pillow stack and folded quilt. Prints in two hollow halves.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="woodencrane"&gt;&lt;a id="woodencrane"&gt;Wooden Crane&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/afb5ec318338ea019fb8f127804c5b74a73c4c65.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=57555fd4198aefd4b90208451f4fe86a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Functional dockside crane with winch gear and hanging cargo net. Joints engineered to glue flush or pin.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="storehouse_v1"&gt;&lt;a id="storehouse_v1"&gt;Store House_v1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/445054516e71e41a1808e58c306c83469ce96c90.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c4c3de6e885440ddbca267382c126562"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Two‑storey timber warehouse with ladder, hatch and hinged doors. Floors slot in without glue for playable interiors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="storehouse_v2"&gt;&lt;a id="storehouse_v2"&gt;Store House_v2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/870af5e1d19683cdf4f943d0da6c12a83891a450.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=38fb496d9088d7236167eb311a85334e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Alternate stone‑foundation storehouse with raised loading dock and detachable roof. Prints in sectional pieces.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="treehouse"&gt;&lt;a id="treehouse"&gt;Tree House&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d91e5b5cbb92754808a81cecf51493054efebba3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f9f252f6c64265a7db5654e03f7ddf26"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elevated woodland dwelling with rope bridge segment, hollow trunk interior and lookout deck. Modular stilts fit any terrain board.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="aarakocra"&gt;&lt;a id="aarakocra"&gt;Aarakocra&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6f5cde231386b4dd5074337d7a8e989453d13444.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2c0e47a4149e64755850b59f9e7fabdd"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take flight with the Aarakocra, a noble bird-folk warrior poised mid-stride with outstretched wings and a hunting spear at the ready. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sculpted for 32 mm play, this avian adventurer captures every layered feather, taloned grip and keen-eyed glare in razor-sharp detail. The model arrives in two keyed parts, body and wing assembly with both pre-supported and raw STL files for hassle-free resin printing. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Perfect as a player character, sky-borne scout NPC or exotic encounter, it prints cleanly on consumer MSLA machines and rewards painters with crisp plumage textures ideal for vibrant washes. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Includes a lifetime personal licence so you can print your flock as often as your campaign demands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="armourer"&gt;&lt;a id="armourer"&gt;Armourer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7ac26b7ef349cc3ce4078291b4aa29edbfef8628.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=37cb4069b29a1a8f3305b16e45165a0a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Outfit your settlement with the Armourer, a hard-working blacksmith bent over his anvil mid-strike, hammer raised above a glowing blade. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Detailed leather apron, muscled forearms and a workbench strewn with tongs, helmets and breastplates make this the perfect quest-giver NPC or atmospheric town dressing. Scaled for 28-32 mm tabletop play, the model comes in keyed parts with both pre-supported and unsupported STL files for clean, reliable resin prints. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Hollowed where possible to save material, the sculpt holds fine detail in chainmail rings and tool textures. A versatile centrepiece for forges, armouries and market scenes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Supplied with a lifetime personal licence for unlimited prints.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="dwarvenking"&gt;&lt;a id="dwarvenking"&gt;Dwarven King&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b984e6015da142940a1e18871b57ec2f1f51a27e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1da3ca5bc3414776b300548e77a364e2"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Command the mountain halls with the Dwarven King, a regal monarch enthroned in rune-etched plate armour, war-axe resting at his side and a braided beard cascading over an ornate breastplate. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sculpted for 32 mm heroic scale, every gemstone, forge-mark and knotwork engraving resolves crisply on consumer resin printers. &lt;br&gt;The model splits into keyed sections for painting access and arrives with both pre-supported and raw STL files, hollowed to conserve resin. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ideal as a campaign boss, faction leader or display centrepiece, this stoic ruler anchors any dwarf army or throne-room diorama. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Includes a lifetime personal licence so the king can reign over as many tables as you like.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="balistarcanonandcrew_dwarfarmy"&gt;&lt;a id="balistarcanonandcrew_dwarfarmy"&gt;Balistar Canon &amp; Crew - Dwarf Army&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/559d6ee25842400c38e690237ba5967502eb107b.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e2be32b94c7ddc6118cdc78cbd28b063"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bring siege firepower to the field with the Balistar Cannon &amp;amp; Crew, a heavy dwarf war engine manned by three industrious gunners. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The bolt-throwing cannon features turning gears, riveted iron plating and a stout timber carriage, while the crew load, aim and brace with characterful poses. Scaled for 28-32 mm rank-and-file gaming, the set ships in keyed, pre-supported parts plus unsupported masters for flexible resin printing. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Hollowed components and clean wall thickness ensure efficient curing on consumer MSLA machines. A must-have artillery piece for dwarf battle-lines, fortress defences or narrative scenarios.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Supplied with a lifetime personal licence for unlimited regiment-scale prints.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="berserkerdwarves_setof5"&gt;&lt;a id="berserkerdwarves_setof5"&gt;Berserker Dwarves - Set of 5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4d33e86306e81d8d7779192fe2589aaa8176dde4.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=989eb6f56353d9abe10f562f8390ba41"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Unleash fury with the Berserker Dwarves, a set of five bare-chested warriors charging headlong with twin axes, war-hammers and roaring battle-cries. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Each miniature bristles with knotted muscle, braided beards and spiked bracers, frozen in dynamic combat poses ideal for rank-and-file units or champion models. Sculpted at 28-32 mm scale, the set includes both pre-supported and raw STL files with keyed joints for painting access and resin-friendly hollowing. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Print flawlessly on consumer MSLA machines and reinforce your dwarf army with a unit that hits as hard as it looks. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Supplied with a lifetime personal licence so you can muster an entire warband from a single download.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="highelves_horsecrew"&gt;&lt;a id="highelves_horsecrew"&gt;High Elves - Horse Crew&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3d103f3ed49b70a8bd948ffd528e1b3896665f55.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1e7ed738a891cde7b87d05ac7b3a39be"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Charge into battle with the High Elves Horse Crew, an elegant mounted unit pairing noble riders with finely caparisoned steeds. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Flowing manes, layered scale-mail and tasselled banners capture the grace of the elven cavalry, while spears and crested helms add martial flair. Scaled for 28-32 mm gaming, the set arrives in keyed parts, rider, mount and accessories with both pre-supported and unsupported STL files for clean resin prints. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Hollowed bodies and reinforced legs ensure stable curing on consumer machines. Perfect for flanking manoeuvres, command stands or display pieces, this crew brings speed and splendour to any high-elf force. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Includes a lifetime personal licence for unlimited prints.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="highelflionclanfighter"&gt;&lt;a id="highelflionclanfighter"&gt;High Elf Lion Clan Fighter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/15e602c3bdbb3510e95669b5f4db843358ed0456.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f1c0cdb6d962dd2b6e6f29001b345b15"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stand proud with the High Elf Lion Clan Fighter, an elite warrior clad in lion-pelt cloak and ornate scale armour, blade poised in a confident guard stance. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Intricate mane detailing, embossed shield heraldry and flowing tabard reward dedicated painters with abundant surface texture. Sculpted for 32 mm play, the model splits into keyed parts with both pre-supported and raw STL files, hollowed for resin efficiency. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ideal as a unit champion, character model or display centrepiece, this noble fighter anchors any high-elf battle-line with regal presence. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Prints reliably on consumer MSLA machines and comes with a lifetime personal licence for unlimited tabletop musters.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="boltthrowercrew_highelves"&gt;&lt;a id="boltthrowercrew_highelves"&gt;Bolt Thrower Crew - High Elves&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a01293cc26e205dc374afac3fcfcf9bcb4b003fd.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=fe2a2d7274bf386b9ec938316369efe9"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pin the enemy with the High Elves Bolt Thrower Crew, a precision war machine operated by two graceful elven artillerists. &lt;br&gt;The repeater bolt-thrower features carved limbs, taut bowstrings and a filigreed frame, while the crew aim and reload in characterful poses. Scaled for 28-32 mm rank-and-file gaming, the set ships in keyed, pre-supported parts plus unsupported masters for flexible resin printing. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Hollowed components and clean wall thickness keep curing efficient on consumer MSLA machines. A vital ranged support piece for high-elf battle-lines, fortress defences or narrative skirmishes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Supplied with a lifetime personal licence so you can field a full artillery battery from one download.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="bonebreaker_dwarfarmy"&gt;&lt;a id="bonebreaker_dwarfarmy"&gt;Bone Breaker - Dwarf Army&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7e76819f615243b246aa76d1cb43086bfd1095c0.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1e7830b2ed622ac8a50ba81c671fa552"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Crush the line with the Bone Breaker, a towering dwarf champion hefting a massive two-handed maul over spiked plate armour. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Knotted muscle, riveted pauldrons and a snarling battle-helm make this hero a commanding presence at the front of any warband. Sculpted at 32 mm heroic scale, the model arrives in keyed parts with both pre-supported and raw STL files, hollowed for resin efficiency and reinforced at stress points. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Print cleanly on consumer MSLA machines and lead your dwarf army with a brutal melee specialist built to smash through shield-walls. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Includes a lifetime personal licence so the Bone Breaker can anchor as many tables as your campaigns require.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="burialmound"&gt;&lt;a id="burialmound"&gt;Burial Mound&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8b5a8c90a15727440bb8ece247dd83001ea77117.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=dc39356cbab7c9228ac86eccac93cadc"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Set the scene with the Burial Mound, an ancient grave-barrow crowned with weathered standing stones, carved runes and a brooding entrance arch. &lt;br&gt;This atmospheric terrain piece evokes forgotten kings and restless dead, perfect as an objective marker, dungeon entrance or scatter for haunted moors. Scaled for 28-32 mm play, it prints in sectional pieces with both pre-supported and unsupported STL files, hollowed with drain channels to save resin. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The textured earthwork and mossy stones reward washes and dry-brushing. Drop it onto any battlefield to add narrative weight and verticality. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Supplied with a lifetime personal licence for unlimited terrain prints.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="butchershop"&gt;&lt;a id="butchershop"&gt;Butcher Shop&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a8b9ac621ffcd18b761009eccef40e238f390588.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d96f47a29e784775762222407977e6ce"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Flesh out your town with the Butcher Shop, a characterful medieval storefront complete with hanging meat, chopping block, awning and timber-framed walls. &lt;br&gt;The removable roof reveals a detailed interior ready for shopkeeper NPCs and grisly side-quests. Scaled for 28-32 mm tabletop play, the building prints in sectional slices with both pre-supported and unsupported STL files, hollowed for resin efficiency on consumer machines. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Mix-and-match with other market stalls to build a bustling village square. Weathered planking and shingle textures reward washes and edge-highlighting. A vivid centrepiece for urban encounters.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Supplied with a lifetime personal licence so you can populate entire settlements from a single download.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="carnivalset"&gt;&lt;a id="carnivalset"&gt;Carnival Set&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d67e5d4383dbed461b7f3488d4ce6319daa12247.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=da3e63669555f53c6f6c289def49a9c6"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bring festivity to the table with the Carnival Set, a lively collection of fairground props including striped tents, market stalls, banners, barrels and scatter decorations. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Perfect for travelling-fair encounters, town celebrations or atmospheric urban dressing, every piece is scaled for 28-32 mm play and supplied in both pre-supported and unsupported STL files. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Hollowed canvas and timber components keep resin use efficient on consumer MSLA machines, while crisp fabric folds and woodgrain textures reward painters. Mix-and-match the modular pieces to lay out a complete carnival in minutes. A versatile, story-rich terrain bundle.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Supplied with a lifetime personal licence for unlimited prints.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="chariotcrew_highelves"&gt;&lt;a id="chariotcrew_highelves"&gt;Chariot Crew - High Elves&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/cb808ef178f7e165a406b434090835c3f406b27e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e92b58a2e8de673e4e48c0b0461095c2"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thunder across the field with the High Elves Chariot Crew, a swift war-chariot drawn by spirited steeds and manned by noble riders wielding spears and bows. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ornate scrollwork, scaled barding and fluttering banners capture elven elegance in motion, while spinning wheels and a sturdy axle ground the piece in tabletop practicality. Scaled for 28-32 mm gaming, the set arrives in keyed parts with both pre-supported and unsupported STL files, hollowed for resin efficiency. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Reinforced wheel spokes and horse legs ensure stable curing on consumer machines. A spectacular centrepiece or fast-attack unit for any high-elf force.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Supplied with a lifetime personal licence for unlimited prints.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="cogship"&gt;&lt;a id="cogship"&gt;Cog Ship&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/88b31b5f38f24153337a35fcffe34e8ed882a514.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=58caa68112f9fb730b31c26f03dda21f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Set sail with the Cog Ship, a sturdy single-masted medieval merchant vessel featuring planked hull, raised fore and stern castles, rigging points and a removable mast. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ideal as a harbour centrepiece, naval encounter or seafaring terrain prop, the ship prints in segmented, keyed sections sized for mid-size resin vats. Interior decking is recessed for easy dry-brushing, and both pre-supported and unsupported STL files are included for flexible printing on consumer machines. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Weathered timber and rope textures reward washes and weathering. Convert it to a gaming objective or display model.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Supplied with a lifetime personal licence so you can build a whole trading fleet from one download.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="goldendragon"&gt;&lt;a id="goldendragon"&gt;Golden Dragon&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6b3336499270537ad3ea1da116c343f039bb553c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2d3e693de7697af03c6c98c9828c76fa"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dominate the table with the Golden Dragon, a magnificent winged wyrm reared on powerful haunches with jaws agape and wings flared wide. Overlapping scales, curling horns and razor talons resolve crisply on consumer resin printers, making this an unforgettable campaign boss or display centrepiece. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sculpted for 32 mm encounters, the dragon arrives in multiple keyed parts, body, wings, head and tail with both pre-supported and unsupported STL files, hollowed and reinforced for safe curing of the large components. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The dynamic pose and intricate membrane detailing reward ambitious painters. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Supplied with a lifetime personal licence so this golden terror can menace as many adventuring parties as you wish.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
