      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e1e100254a373e42b2ad7d6a45d74c2dbc5c631f.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=3229a4e5a44db051e472ee2213961463"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3b8e237c17edc534db26ce15126227395f8ad211.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=3f74c52f9ae2e911dc891cbc03a34a22"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Cyberpunk worlds demand A+ audio&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Game developers, rejoice! Crack open a cache of A+ cyberpunk audio assets so the neon signs you create hum within the rich symphony of an illuminated super city. A finely tuned audioscape sets the tone for your project, so don’t sacrifice quality for quantity—unlock this bundle and get the best of both worlds! Pay what you want for audio packs like &lt;em&gt;Signal Bleed, Vol. 1&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Urban Exploration, Vol. 1 Audio Pack&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Combat - Full Assault, Vol. 1 Audio Pack&lt;/em&gt;—and help support Make-A-Wish with your purchase! &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;span style="color: orange;"&gt;This bundle contains content created with or partially created with A.I. tools&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#infiltrationprotocol_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;Infiltration Protocol, Vol. 1 Audio Pack (Cyberpunk)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#interfaceandsystems_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;Interface &amp; Systems, Vol. 1 Audio Pack (Cyberpunk)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#nightcitystreets_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;Night City Streets, Vol. 1 Audio Pack (Cyberpunk)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt10"&gt;Pay $10 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#corporatearcologies_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;Corporate Arcologies, Vol. 1 Audio Pack (Cyberpunk)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#neondivesandbackalleys_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;Neon Dives &amp; Back Alleys, Vol. 1 Audio Pack (Cyberpunk)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#networkintrusion_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;Network Intrusion, Vol. 1 Audio Pack (Cyberpunk)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#safehousesandhideouts_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;Safehouses &amp; Hideouts, Vol. 1 Audio Pack (Cyberpunk)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#combat_fullassault_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;Combat - Full Assault, Vol. 1 Audio Pack (Cyberpunk)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#combat_streetskirmish_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;Combat - Street Skirmish, Vol. 1 Audio Pack (Cyberpunk)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#signalbleed_vol1"&gt;Signal Bleed, Vol. 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#urbanexploration_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;Urban Exploration, Vol. 1 Audio Pack (Cyberpunk)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="infiltrationprotocol_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;&lt;a id="infiltrationprotocol_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;Infiltration Protocol, Vol. 1 Audio Pack (Cyberpunk)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/36071e3e61f39da09c7a41556632108fa9ce637f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=21f4c21177b020b5f8b8b9b8b5bcbf01"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Infiltration Protocol, Vol. 1 is a collection of tense, methodical soundscapes designed for covert entry, restricted access, and operations where detection means failure. Subdued electronic pulses, restrained rhythms, and evolving layers of digital tension capture the careful momentum of bypassed security, silent movement, and plans unfolding under pressure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Built for stealth missions, secured facilities, surveillance-heavy environments, and moments of calculated intrusion, this pack provides the sonic identity of slipping through systems designed to keep you out. Ideal for games, narrative environments, interactive worlds, and any scene where patience, precision, and timing are the difference between success and exposure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Includes 50 tracks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="interfaceandsystems_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;&lt;a id="interfaceandsystems_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;Interface &amp; Systems, Vol. 1 Audio Pack (Cyberpunk)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/736c6a1299f0af70e890142f215deac67437e6ca.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=7bf308efa1e48d9bf20a647b862dbffd"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Interface &amp;amp; Systems, Vol. 1 is a collection of focused electronic soundscapes designed for menus, terminals, diagnostics, data displays, and the digital spaces between moments of action. Clean pulses, restrained rhythmic patterns, and precise synthetic textures create a sense of function, connectivity, and controlled technological motion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Built for user interfaces, system navigation, equipment management, communications, and information-heavy environments, this pack provides the sonic identity of technology operating beneath the surface of the world. Ideal for games, interactive experiences, digital installations, and any setting where systems, networks, and machine logic shape the experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Includes 50 tracks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="nightcitystreets_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;&lt;a id="nightcitystreets_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;Night City Streets, Vol. 1 Audio Pack (Cyberpunk)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/80b170f4c4497f1176563070a0c6260138fe07d1.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=236dabd0e9353bb8a41d8b4f17a6c17f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Night City Streets, Vol. 1 is a collection of atmospheric electronic soundscapes designed for exploring dense urban environments after dark. Distant traffic, neon-lit ambience, low mechanical hums, restrained rhythms, and shifting synthetic textures evoke crowded districts, rain-slicked avenues, elevated transit lines, and the restless energy of a city that never truly sleeps.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Built for nighttime travel, street-level encounters, environmental storytelling, and moments of movement between larger events, this pack provides the sonic identity of a futuristic city experienced from the ground up. Ideal for games, narrative environments, interactive worlds, and any setting where technology, isolation, and constant motion define the streets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Includes 50 tracks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt10"&gt;Pay $10 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="corporatearcologies_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;&lt;a id="corporatearcologies_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;Corporate Arcologies, Vol. 1 Audio Pack (Cyberpunk)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/cd848b2fd8fffeb3c47dbe305623f421eb25b822.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2ef634b3e42c5dca3641895e8317d7e7"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Corporate Arcologies is a collection of sleek, controlled soundscapes designed for the towering headquarters, private enclaves, and sealed vertical cities of a corporate future. Polished electronic textures, restrained pulses, and cold atmospheric detail evoke spaces built to project order, efficiency, and absolute institutional power.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Built for executive districts, research complexes, luxury interiors, security checkpoints, and environments where wealth and surveillance exist side by side, this pack provides the sonic identity of places where every surface is immaculate and every movement is monitored. Ideal for games, narrative environments, interactive worlds, and any setting shaped by corporate authority, technological privilege, and quiet intimidation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Includes 50 tracks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="neondivesandbackalleys_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;&lt;a id="neondivesandbackalleys_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;Neon Dives &amp; Back Alleys, Vol. 1 Audio Pack (Cyberpunk)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8c4cbf4c8c623fa5f43c2404fa3d7962ab311e9f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=0c4d9977b3305fb00d22f14427b00f27"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Neon Dives &amp;amp; Back Alleys, Vol. 1 is a collection of noir-infused urban soundscapes designed for the unstable spaces between nightlife, investigation, and danger. Moving through smoky bar interiors, rain-slicked alleys, shadowed streets, and tense late-night encounters, these tracks range from subdued observation and uneasy pursuit to deals unraveling and violence waiting just out of sight.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Built for investigations, covert meetings, tailing sequences, criminal underworld scenes, aftermaths, and moments where the city feels both alive and threatening, this pack provides a broad sonic palette for stories unfolding beyond the safety of the main streets. Ideal for games, narrative environments, interactive worlds, and any setting where mystery, tension, and urban decay overlap.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Includes 62 tracks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="networkintrusion_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;&lt;a id="networkintrusion_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;Network Intrusion, Vol. 1 Audio Pack (Cyberpunk)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1d76699119bc4f21b9aaca5bd6c1588645b42d09.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f413f0def9f4ba7250f0fa761b39f442"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Network Intrusion, Vol. 1 is a collection of tense electronic soundscapes designed for hacking, digital infiltration, and hostile movement through secured systems. Layered pulses, fractured data textures, and evolving synthetic patterns capture the pressure of breached firewalls, contested access, escalating trace activity, and information being extracted before the window closes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Built for cyberspace encounters, remote operations, system overrides, data theft, and moments where control of the network is actively disputed, this pack provides the sonic identity of conflict unfolding entirely through machines. Ideal for games, interactive worlds, narrative environments, and any scene where speed, precision, and digital survival are inseparable.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Includes 50 tracks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="safehousesandhideouts_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;&lt;a id="safehousesandhideouts_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;Safehouses &amp; Hideouts, Vol. 1 Audio Pack (Cyberpunk)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2e1caa72744266d2b3515143141105cb626c0ce0.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1cedbf504249439535f9c2c5d1fb2a28"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Safehouses &amp;amp; Hideouts, Vol. 1 is a collection of atmospheric electronic soundscapes designed for the guarded pauses between danger and action. Moving from the relief of finally reaching shelter to the quiet urgency of repairing gear, reviewing plans, restocking supplies, and preparing for what comes next, these tracks explore both the comfort and unease of places that are safe only for the moment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Built for recovery scenes, planning sequences, equipment montages, clandestine meetings, temporary refuge, and the calm before a major operation, this pack provides a broad sonic palette for moments spent regrouping beyond the reach of immediate threats. Ideal for games, narrative environments, interactive worlds, and any setting where rest, preparation, and uncertainty exist side by side.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Includes 49 tracks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="combat_fullassault_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;&lt;a id="combat_fullassault_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;Combat - Full Assault, Vol. 1 Audio Pack (Cyberpunk)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2a6504056e2633a1ac1b584126cc37610f839b3f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5f25d58a75dda461c6b75f6e4a859890"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Combat - Full Assault is a collection of high-intensity battle music designed for large-scale clashes, decisive confrontations, and moments when restraint gives way to total war. Driven by relentless momentum, forceful rhythms, and escalating cinematic energy, these tracks capture the chaos and urgency of armies colliding, defenses breaking, and every combatant being pushed to their limit.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Built for major encounters, battlefield sequences, climactic assaults, and overwhelming enemy forces, this pack provides the sonic weight of combat at its most aggressive and uncompromising. Ideal for games, action sequences, interactive worlds, and any scene where the conflict has reached its breaking point.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Includes 50 tracks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="combat_streetskirmish_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;&lt;a id="combat_streetskirmish_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;Combat - Street Skirmish, Vol. 1 Audio Pack (Cyberpunk)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6cefeed36271b01a95395fc2fe1d01e414f15709.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6343a6f1965a418048b5b0c3d231cf00"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Combat - Street Skirmish: Combat - Street Skirmish is a collection of tense, fast-moving battle music designed for close-quarters clashes, sudden ambushes, and violent confrontations in dense urban environments. Sharp rhythms, aggressive electronic textures, and restless momentum capture the danger of fights unfolding across alleys, rooftops, transit platforms, and crowded city blocks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Built for gang conflicts, pursuit sequences, tactical encounters, and unpredictable bursts of urban violence, this pack provides the sonic identity of combat where space is limited and every corner presents a new threat. Ideal for games, action sequences, interactive worlds, and any scene where survival depends on reacting faster than the opposition.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Includes 50 tracks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="signalbleed_vol1"&gt;&lt;a id="signalbleed_vol1"&gt;Signal Bleed, Vol. 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/59af906346cd60567ffd9b56e526d1478213a6a9.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=0e1cc28c589d6149925a01efb70e769c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Urban Exploration, Vol. 1 is a collection of atmospheric electronic soundscapes designed for moving through the overlooked, abandoned, and hidden spaces of a futuristic city. Industrial ambience, subdued rhythmic motion, distant machinery, and evolving synthetic textures evoke derelict buildings, maintenance tunnels, forgotten transit routes, rooftops, construction zones, and infrastructure stretching far beyond the public eye.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Built for environmental exploration, scavenging, traversal, investigation, and discovering what exists beneath the city’s polished surface, this pack provides the sonic identity of places shaped by neglect, industry, and time. Ideal for games, narrative environments, interactive worlds, and any setting where the city itself becomes a landscape to uncover.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Includes 49 tracks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="urbanexploration_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;&lt;a id="urbanexploration_vol1audiopackcyberpunk"&gt;Urban Exploration, Vol. 1 Audio Pack (Cyberpunk)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9b978a3e5a4ab243b65eb013c543afce0fe3528b.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f5ac84ab0233354c20b1ebe16a625f8e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Urban Exploration, Vol. 1 is a collection of atmospheric electronic soundscapes designed for moving through the overlooked, abandoned, and hidden spaces of a futuristic city. Industrial ambience, subdued rhythmic motion, distant machinery, and evolving synthetic textures evoke derelict buildings, maintenance tunnels, forgotten transit routes, rooftops, construction zones, and infrastructure stretching far beyond the public eye.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Built for environmental exploration, scavenging, traversal, investigation, and discovering what exists beneath the city’s polished surface, this pack provides the sonic identity of places shaped by neglect, industry, and time. Ideal for games, narrative environments, interactive worlds, and any setting where the city itself becomes a landscape to uncover.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Includes 49 tracks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
