ysis in ArcGIS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="pythonfromscratch"&gt;&lt;a id="pythonfromscratch"&gt;Python From Scratch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/acf5d0eacd4ee465878be51cd6f2c484d745b14a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=96ed80f3d8e180af7bc8d27c028e1711"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Start your programming journey with this beginner-friendly course covering Python from the ground up. Learn core concepts including variables, data types, loops, conditionals, and functions while writing your first working programs. Through hands-on exercises, you'll build a solid foundation in problem-solving and logical thinking, understand Python syntax and best practices, and gain the confidence to tackle real coding challenges. Perfect for absolute beginners with no prior programming experience, this course prepares you for more advanced Python topics and practical software development.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="python3forbeginners"&gt;&lt;a id="python3forbeginners"&gt;Python 3 For Beginners&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f5d03e0bbb2a4162f78e47e0a8b3a8c29f816cc3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=0f973c6a6c308f7ad9e462cf21e5fc8b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get started with Python 3, the most widely used version of the language, in this beginner-focused course. Learn essential concepts including variables, data types, loops, conditionals, and basic functions through simple, easy-to-follow lessons. You'll build small programs, understand Python's clean syntax, and develop the fundamental skills needed to progress to more advanced programming topics. Ideal for complete beginners, this course lays the groundwork for a successful start in coding.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="codingwithpython3"&gt;&lt;a id="codingwithpython3"&gt;Coding With Python 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0924c9