b"&gt;Sci-Fi Hands With Pistol (Animations)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cartooncharactercharmingcharacter_fab"&gt;Cartoon Character (Charming) (Character)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#werewolfgerlcharacter_fab"&gt;Werewolf Gerl (Character)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="astronautspack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="astronautspack_fab"&gt;Astronauts (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5f96956ecf220c1fd96bd3ba3aea192a7903394a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4f8bd9201465fd47dca1d94be664f0c9"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A pack of 3 characters, perfect for space odyssey-style projects. The set includes various suits, ranging from heavy to light ones.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="creaturesinsectspack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="creaturesinsectspack_fab"&gt;Creatures Insects (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5482b5b0541a23ec13bdf95e237a49b173ce5ffe.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=fcb67be2ddb9a121253dd9c441a63a26"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;5 insect-style characters — they will strike fear into any player and are perfect for horror games or sci-fi worlds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="humanoidsmonsterspack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="humanoidsmonsterspack_fab"&gt;Humanoids Monsters (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3239c8765c2871eed13846e68b15943abf824cc5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5cfaa86ef1adfca2071a52d688bc5849"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A pack of 5 humanoid-type monsters — a perfect addition to your project. Monsters have always been an essential part of immersive and thrilling games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="geekroom_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="geekroom_fab"&gt;Geek Room&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ad135116c1b8d833b2eb2292ab3a0f8f3d1f6081.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=003838ca28500c553be111c5a11ee7c8"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A great room filled with various Soviet-style props for your project, along with a character wearing a cyberpunk mask.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt20"&gt;Pay $20 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="fantasyanimalpack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="fantasyanimalpack_fab"&gt;Fantasy Animal (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/478da37eea4b9786093b704d5c6cc6965502c403.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=8198207f426345096f638f7bd10f9df1"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Five awesome fantasy-style animals: a dragon, buffalo, camel, elephant, and a unique mythical creature. All characters are fully animated and ready to use in your projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="adventurecharacterspack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="adventurecharacterspack_fab"&gt;Adventure Characters (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1e1b42da3e6177f6c740dd1da0f76e4a4766f9c3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a3a06211e2d1491907266c4ea5fa5c65"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;5 awesome characters for adventure and survival games — perfect main heroes for your projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="sci-fimercenariespack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="sci-fimercenariespack_fab"&gt;Sci-Fi Mercenaries (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8d4c3b139c142540f2a4276f9c0c006bad2deabe.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=36773b113399011cc771741731c536e1"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;An excellent pack of 5 sci-fi characters. They were originally designed as mercenaries, but you can use them in many other creative ways.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="dwarfspack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="dwarfspack_fab"&gt;Dwarfs (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/14a03b27845a13d28dc25ed7d906fddb36ef1528.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a6a1f33176d09d1dae56b7c79a9e6c8c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;An excellent pack of 5 dwarves to enhance your fantasy, RPG, or MMO project. The pack includes warrior dwarves, a blacksmith, and the dwarf king.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="parasitespack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="parasitespack_fab"&gt;Parasites (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b03c8881230f6bd3a88192a07cc73e79514edbd1.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=92670452a3aeaa7b5ba8c9e77474c861"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The “Parasites” pack includes 5 animated characters, featuring a massive monster that can emerge from the ground. A highly impressive creature, perfect for serving as a boss in your game.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="npcprisoners_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="npcprisoners_fab"&gt;NPC Prisoners&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b638282556e21548a6cda5f593068e5bd79db047.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3403670057b21f8257201755342e2e61"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Great set of NPC prisoners, you can create a great game level&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="babyincapsule_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="babyincapsule_fab"&gt;Baby In Capsule&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1449632a263e55475b6b002ae32d41251cd21d77.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e9516e8f932822eeda9f86d26aab0a74"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pre-assembled futuristic environments for quick level design.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="monsterincapsule_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="monsterincapsule_fab"&gt;Monster In Capsule&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/fa7cecb745c0be4f0c0ba0e1c88ae3f0b51707a1.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3d6b1c781dfe0e0f316c09fcde99e234"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fully arranged sci-fi set pieces made from high-quality assets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="snipersoldier_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="snipersoldier_fab"&gt;Sniper Soldier&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/420cdb28f72580863dc6cfb89e0c2ca30effd5ae.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3409ac7ea5ac372096ab701d6e167f73"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Highly detailed custom sniper character built for modern tactical shooters.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pbrstatues_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="pbrstatues_fab"&gt;PBR Statues&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/009d8f4d744ae858f8a8c694ecdbebb5f5b81a26.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=7c8eaeaa75472d3f98e5413294391f96"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;High-quality statue props designed to enrich your environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="soldierfuture03_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="soldierfuture03_fab"&gt;Soldier Future 03&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b798a1c409617ce6009f9703e8c14c7fde0b1d8e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d8541acebfbffb5d45bf3d3ead802c5a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Advanced combat units designed for sci-fi battlefields.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="soldierfuture02_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="soldierfuture02_fab"&gt;Soldier Future 02&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b89ceaa1b99dbc2dc89c347bfccd4e22f086ca63.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=37f7b38ac1485afe2710fcd277a96143"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elite soldiers engineered for futuristic combat.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="soldierfuture01_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="soldierfuture01_fab"&gt;Soldier Future 01&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bf80ada489159d3c16076beab3b3d44852b1f6bb.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=8758a301a31654fa8ccb262fe443f4fd"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Futuristic soldiers built for next-generation warfare.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt40"&gt;Pay $40 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="fantasywarriorspack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="fantasywarriorspack_fab"&gt;Fantasy Warriors (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/83859bdd77f98e28c30aae4a2f913f9affd6a06a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=614cb1ae01e6e9ad89a442b592f5ae82"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you’re looking for great fantasy characters, this pack is for you! Inside, you’ll find a variety of ancient warrior-style heroes who can serve as both main characters and enemies in your game.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="npcsailoradventure_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="npcsailoradventure_fab"&gt;NPC Sailor (Adventure)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9b4681571b9e7321aeb9a1a8f5a1ac62779160d4.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=267db712c141549b16a93ff47c49803b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A perfect solution for adventure games! The pack includes a variety of customizable outfits that you can adjust and combine to fit your project’s needs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="npckingandqueen_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="npckingandqueen_fab"&gt;NPC King And Queen&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/08b8e1b0a2793db765762e3eded90b551af6bf06.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c8e5ec8c0e87d02ebebf10edaca2abb9"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a series of medieval-style NPCs. The pack includes a king, queen, plague doctor, executioner, and servant.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="npcbeggarspack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="npcbeggarspack_fab"&gt;NPC Beggars (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d9b56a3eb7f50e504f3a23c0c9c8c8428d3269be.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4deb52a91b045edfd32c52880007d1fa"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a series of medieval-style NPCs. The pack includes 8 peasant characters, perfect for populating markets, courtyards, and dirty streets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="npccharaterskidspack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="npccharaterskidspack_fab"&gt;NPC Charaters Kids (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b73564dda5887a12803d173db439b954ab4f9149.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9e466d2d0ac94f23b4677694910802ff"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;His is a series of medieval-style NPCs. The pack includes 5 child characters, perfect for RPG games to bring life and atmosphere to your environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="npccharactersfemalepack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="npccharactersfemalepack_fab"&gt;NPC Characters Female (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2afc15b4c4e9ba2bae385cc4e9b42b39ea618550.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=64ab24771c98432233fe8c8afad45e24"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a series of medieval-style NPCs. The pack includes 5 female characters, some of which feature cloth simulation for added realism.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="post-apocalypticcharacterspack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="post-apocalypticcharacterspack_fab"&gt;Post-Apocalyptic Characters (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7555b4ff09d336c039588873f00988935627a740.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a78167e0c24a4d5ee3a1b1a6f3ed74aa"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A great solution for post-apocalyptic projects! The pack includes 14 characters — various mutants that perfectly capture the atmosphere of a devastated world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="npccharactersmalepack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="npccharactersmalepack_fab"&gt;NPC Characters Male (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/552abc0ef2f363a9e7748fec58bb0a6bc6733e08.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b0c19977c4ae2e422f2643f11f7d5bbc"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a series of medieval-style NPCs. The pack includes 5 male characters, some of which feature cloth simulation for a more realistic appearance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="fantasyenemiespack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="fantasyenemiespack_fab"&gt;Fantasy Enemies (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bf3598de90486ebb54b6f0034f69190c48ee305e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=15c4d7710a070d738848cb355599f417"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A great set of 5 enemies for your game. The characters are designed in a fantasy style and are perfect for use as bosses.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="vikingcustomized_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="vikingcustomized_fab"&gt;Viking (Customized)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bca996af1ffab2e1c550bce696038dc989132ba0.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2fe88234dbf317d7a9cebe91143f99c7"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A customizable Viking with over 35 clothing pieces that can be freely mixed and matched.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="femalesoldierspack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="femalesoldierspack_fab"&gt;Female Soldiers (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9bd359a3c8859d9dfac6da170c411481c17202c2.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b360b1a5a9005d09a9fdaf165e7732a2"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A high-quality pack of 5 female soldiers designed in a futuristic combat style with different types of armor. These characters are perfect for military and sci-fi games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="fantasycharacterspack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="fantasycharacterspack_fab"&gt;Fantasy Characters (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f2eb413d4501de92ce7b179498f53e09d204f9af.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9bca25511e1e0d59220001d29d1bfc53"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;An excellent pack of 10 diverse fantasy characters — from a barbarian to an orc. This pack has everything you need to bring your project’s fantasy world to life.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="knightspack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="knightspack_fab"&gt;Knights (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/25980a11334b955edbb5ac9580d82e4d2c8fafce.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=265372152646cd3726ced0e9223c2c7d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Knight characters — 5 great heroes, including a female knight. All models feature high-quality textures, and some characters include customization options.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="sci-ficharacterspack_vol2_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="sci-ficharacterspack_vol2_fab"&gt;Sci-Fi Characters (Pack) Vol.2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f4315c91902bd722f655b13c78c899ff903b8571.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4b1bcf31c61be17a7ead75bd00b8ce98"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bestseller — 7 characters in cyberpunk and sci-fi styles. The pack includes a giant robot and a child — one of my best creations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="sci-ficharacterspack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="sci-ficharacterspack_fab"&gt;Sci-Fi Characters (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f4289d60de50924e7c43f61550eecfc875799363.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9bf3e8814ba9e95bc5fd4e3ca98f661a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bestseller — a set of cyberpunk and sci-fi style characters. The pack includes 5 great characters that can be used in various types of games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="monstersunderwaterpack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="monstersunderwaterpack_fab"&gt;Monsters Underwater (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f92c0f93f8432e8376cb4557fbe78c02e80fe9ba.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6d45aec230cab199a673176f00e9de7e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;5 underwater world monsters — perfect for horror games. The characters have a humanoid form and bring a dark, eerie atmosphere of the deep sea.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="militarypack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="militarypack_fab"&gt;Military (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6212b284a61765f2fcdfe884b5115c988f0a118f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=84b00c131751f650f98163b56620ad4a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The military pack includes 12 soldier characters, perfect for various shooter games. Everything you need to create realistic combat scenes is included in this pack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="creepingcreaturespack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="creepingcreaturespack_fab"&gt;Creeping Creatures (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8e9ec59c2efcdd6bdba054561ff5030e83fbf332.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=69b05c9854149455a9e979e194fb4b5e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;5 horror characters that crawl on the floor and can serve as unexpected enemies in your project. All animations are included in the pack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="fighterspack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="fighterspack_fab"&gt;Fighters (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/019c92bf75621706c2097ad8028dcbd9bcaccf50.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=24cbd98d44422f87fc4a3540c3288616"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you’re making a fighting game, this pack is for you! A great collection of 15 characters in various styles for your project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="14orcspack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="14orcspack_fab"&gt;14 Orcs Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/331982c461ab2dc3bb9f3aa4f0930a7b1cb36339.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1946a392ea2e00ba6b04f13883abe608"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;14 orcs ready to go into battle in your game! All characters come with rigging and animations. The pack includes orcs of various sizes — from small to massive. Every model is crafted with great quality.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="customizedpostapocalypticcharacters_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="customizedpostapocalypticcharacters_fab"&gt;Customized Post Apocalyptic Characters&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2da42f734d31c977ccea0b93bcc07dbd12a26e5b.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=0057f4591bba8d6a738e8e382eb80a14"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A customizable post-apocalyptic character featuring various outfits, backpacks, masks, hats, and weapons. All items can be mixed and matched to create many unique character variations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="fpsdevices_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="fpsdevices_fab"&gt;FPS Devices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/39b0509643311c74b31afdfe706cc96ba2411363.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=03d25450b8ac58caf246458129cc503a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;An excellent pack for first-person games! It includes various items such as a radio, tablet, listening device, camera, and phone, along with a full set of animations for all these objects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="npcdystopiacharacters_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="npcdystopiacharacters_fab"&gt;NPC Dystopia Characters&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/abb5e9f5eb655abaaeb7865ea055b82fd3da9ed8.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=074f0e51c7298bd1129a46775f427340"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A set of dystopian-style characters. The characters wear jumpsuits and feature various male and female heads. Perfect for populating underground cities, tunnels, and bunkers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="primitivecharacterspack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="primitivecharacterspack_fab"&gt;Primitive Characters (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/107aa3a2e2b1c3c27892fd442e1d5e32a93248bc.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3e0a38ee682bf4f786b00eaf6c50e7be"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A very rare game genre — the prehistoric era. This pack includes 5 characters representing a family struggling to survive in the age when mammoths still roamed the Earth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="10creaturespack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="10creaturespack_fab"&gt;10 Creatures (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0018ab5af5e53dfaa3bb95f4a624dc0e03f2a685.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=934ea35b8405c29d2de3212059b53751"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;An excellent pack featuring 10 monster characters. All characters come with rigging and facial morphs for expressive animations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="dystopiasoldierspack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="dystopiasoldierspack_fab"&gt;Dystopia Soldiers (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a1c2d5d267fecdfa70d623b9fde46a67e35d2f81.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f0a45c30dc124af0d9c6a1d82732f7a5"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you’re creating a dieselpunk-style game, this pack is for you! It includes various soldiers, a general, and military vehicles — everything you need to build a full army.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="fpsstarterpack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="fpsstarterpack_fab"&gt;FPS STARTER (PACK)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b1d29e465183c7da68d2c620f896355c67b1bde8.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=461d661aa3152cd8e261477cdf06be69"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;FPS Starter Pack — the perfect way to kickstart your game. It includes a wide variety of items, 20 types of hands, and many objects ranging from knives to food and drink bottles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="animalswarriorpack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="animalswarriorpack_fab"&gt;Animals Warrior (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3f77df72a7af5480e624208f730bd2ff754ebd79.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=22a800c51394aff4c39aedcbcaeb54e3"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;It’s rare to see animal warriors, but in this pack, you’ll find 5 awesome battle-ready characters: an elephant, a bull, a crocodile, a bear, and a cheetah.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="cybercharacterspack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="cybercharacterspack_fab"&gt;Cyber Characters (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/672b3752796da9cfe72806f9891073e645f6f45e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1f7267f4e5f264bb8d826a8037d38a20"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;4 cyberpunk-style characters — they look modern and can be used both as NPCs and as main heroes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="creaturesmegapack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="creaturesmegapack_fab"&gt;Creatures Mega (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a6df60b8ce412d9e6560c4e1c9faf75b7407cf9d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d14a7ca5254599bf389fe829dd5a82f2"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;One of my largest monster packs. All creatures are unique and fully animated. Not all of them are humanoid, which adds great variety to your project. The pack includes 18 characters.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="tacticalmasks_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="tacticalmasks_fab"&gt;Tactical Masks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6b53de42b1ed27e02423e02fff623babe9883186.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=63be6669f98968935f440e7466dcf9ae"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this pack, you’ll find 10 tactical military masks with rigging for your customized characters. Perfect for military heroes and survival-style projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="oldgangster_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="oldgangster_fab"&gt;Old Gangster&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9fbf62640d9e5d0732761fe247d2c4280eccf774.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5c78127a71e0b483dabed8cd20e6b35d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;An excellent customizable character in a retro gangster style. You can change the outfit from a classic gangster to a prison inmate.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="cartoonzombiespack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="cartoonzombiespack_fab"&gt;Cartoon Zombies (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c59a72ebaebd18ef872c6c7fd47d54cd9097a173.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=fc40bf52a56bb9426b1c9b434b2d45e2"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;One of my favorite packs — cartoon-style zombies! A super pack perfect for mobile and other types of games. The set includes 11 characters, all fully animated.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="underwaterodyssey_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="underwaterodyssey_fab"&gt;Underwater odyssey&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3f1df2afb9908a05591ce0f0b4f58d5eb2a6f8f6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600