      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/955710a8dbb3036a63e1e7fe6ad13387a4260b78.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=4a10f50e5e628340136bfe922204b34c"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2dcc9b050256f0514bd1a079b754642f1e23ec4b.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=11ba80b3b51cfa64cd239c0c3e474424"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Reimagine your space.&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Turn your imagination and inspiration into a thoughtful blueprint for your home’s future this summer with the ultimate home design bundle from Richdale Ventures! Unlock professional-grade personal CAD software that helps you reimagine every inch of your property, from the bathroom to the backyard. Save big on ArchiMaster 3D, the hottest home-design platform, before this amazing deal disappears, and help support the American Cancer Society with your purchase! &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="color: #ef9741;"&gt;Keys expire. Please redeem before December 31st, 2026. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#archimaster3dlandscapeanddeck"&gt;ArchiMaster 3D Landscape and Deck&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt20"&gt;Pay $20 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#archimaster3dultimatehomedesign"&gt;ArchiMaster 3D Ultimate Home Design&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt30"&gt;Pay $30 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#archimaster3dexpert"&gt;ArchiMaster 3D Expert&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cadsoftpersonalarchitectonline"&gt;Cadsoft Personal Architect Online&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#archimaster3dkitchenandbath"&gt;ArchiMaster 3D Kitchen &amp; Bath&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="archimaster3dlandscapeanddeck"&gt;&lt;a id="archimaster3dlandscapeanddeck"&gt;ArchiMaster 3D Landscape and Deck&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0bbeec5f75df13395dab21280b6a21bf447ce78b.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a740f315305a87b27a52665f0254f958"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;ArchiMaster 3D Landscape and Deck is a dedicated design solution for creating beautiful and functional outdoor spaces. Designed for homeowners, landscapers, and outdoor living projects, it allows you to plan gardens, patios, decks, pathways, fences, and terrain with ease. Using intuitive tools and a rich library of plants, materials, and outdoor structures, you can visualize how your exterior spaces will look and evolve before construction begins. The software supports realistic 3D views, accurate dimensions, and flexible layout adjustments, helping you balance aesthetics and practicality. Whether designing a backyard retreat, a terrace, or a complete landscape concept, ArchiMaster 3D Landscape and Deck makes outdoor design clear, creative, and confidently planned.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt20"&gt;Pay $20 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="archimaster3dultimatehomedesign"&gt;&lt;a id="archimaster3dultimatehomedesign"&gt;ArchiMaster 3D Ultimate Home Design&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7727e30b823dc4e6966af2d4a0d3e9409ff350d6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=bcf1333f4e03b49c4e09e8e0e3853d37"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;ArchiMaster 3D Ultimate Home Design is a powerful and intuitive 3D design solution tailored for homeowners, interior designers, and creative enthusiasts. Designed to simplify the process of planning, visualizing, and presenting residential spaces, it lets you build detailed 3D models of your home with ease. From walls, doors, and windows to materials, furniture, and lighting, Ultimate Home Design provides a rich library of customizable elements and finishes so you can experiment with style and layout in real time. With realistic 3D renderings and easy-to-use editing tools, you can explore multiple design options, refine your ideas, and share stunning visuals with clients, family, or contractors. Whether planning a renovation, redesigning a room, or exploring new architectural ideas, ArchiMaster 3D Ultimate Home Design empowers your creativity without overwhelming complexity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt30"&gt;Pay $30 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="archimaster3dexpert"&gt;&lt;a id="archimaster3dexpert"&gt;ArchiMaster 3D Expert&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/24b4b512b9fdb6ea56103bb009b7ad9f108b9338.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a17a35905f555ad609b4522544a5ed2f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;ArchiMaster 3D Expert is the ultimate all-in-one architectural design solution built for professionals and ambitious creators. Combining advanced 3D modeling, precision drafting, and intelligent BIM workflows, it empowers architects, designers, and builders to take projects from concept to construction with ease. With powerful tools for comprehensive building design, accurate floor plans, elevations, sections, material specifications, and CAD import support, Expert delivers the depth and control needed for complex residential and commercial projects. Unlike basic home design tools, ArchiMaster 3D Expert offers robust documentation capabilities, real-world measurement accuracy, and professional export options, making it ideal for technical presentations, client proposals, and real project deliverables. Whether you’re producing detailed construction drawings or immersive 3D visualizations, ArchiMaster 3D Expert is the professional standard for architectural excellence.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="cadsoftpersonalarchitectonline"&gt;&lt;a id="cadsoftpersonalarchitectonline"&gt;Cadsoft Personal Architect Online&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3f98cebcea6b33a5a8fe023aa5fee5ebbd8d340d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=48117ecb1060716c5780007d5a85e1af"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cadsoft Personal Architect Online is a flexible, cloud-based home design solution that brings intuitive 2D and 3D planning directly to your browser. Designed for homeowners, DIY designers, and collaborative projects, it allows you to create floor plans, arrange interiors, and visualize living spaces without installing complex software. With real-time 3D views, smart layout tools, and online project access from any device, Personal Architect Online makes home design fast, accessible, and easy to share. Ideal for early-stage planning, renovations, and concept development, it complements professional desktop design tools by offering instant access, collaboration, and creative freedom wherever you work. Perfect for users who value simplicity, mobility, and modern cloud-based workflows.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="archimaster3dkitchenandbath"&gt;&lt;a id="archimaster3dkitchenandbath"&gt;ArchiMaster 3D Kitchen &amp; Bath&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b36960eb34cd8cc615572aa2d9a305991a0834de.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=18124a2a888e657cbd669a0e7d71c323"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;ArchiMaster 3D Kitchen &amp;amp; Bath is a specialized design solution created for planning and visualizing kitchens and bathrooms with precision and style. Perfect for homeowners, interior designers, and renovation projects, it allows you to design functional layouts while experimenting with materials, cabinetry, appliances, fixtures, and finishes in realistic 3D. With an intuitive interface and purpose-built tools, you can easily adjust dimensions, optimize space, and preview design choices before making real-world decisions. The software includes a curated library of kitchen and bathroom elements, enabling fast customization and accurate visualization. Whether you’re remodeling a single room or presenting ideas to clients, ArchiMaster 3D Kitchen &amp;amp; Bath helps turn concepts into clear, professional designs with confidence and ease.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
