- Tents&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#angeliccityscape"&gt;Angelic Cityscape&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#medievalprops_vol3_weaponrack"&gt;Medieval Props Vol. 3 - Weapon Rack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#elitelandscapes_rockymeadows"&gt;Elite Landscapes: Rocky Meadows&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#emberandsparkvfx"&gt;Ember &amp; Spark VFX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#elitescans_soli-pompeiruinsii"&gt;Elite Scans: Soli-Pompei Ruins II&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#yarrawahmaterialauditor"&gt;Yarrawah Material Auditor&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#ieslightingprofiles"&gt;IES Lighting Profiles&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#dynamiclightgobos"&gt;Dynamic Light Gobos&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt25"&gt;Pay $25 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#mattepaintingskyboxpack_chaoticskiesii"&gt;Matte Painting Skybox Pack: Chaotic Skies II&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#fantasydungeonenvironmentkitbashset"&gt;Fantasy Dungeon Environment Kitbash Set&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#modularwatercityenvironmentwatervillagetownseaside"&gt;Modular Water City Environment (Water Village,Town,Seaside)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#medievalhelmets_proppack"&gt;Medieval Helmets - Prop Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#mattepaintingskyboxpack_surrealskies"&gt;Matte Painting Skybox Pack: Surreal Skies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#marketstreetenvironmentkit"&gt;Market Street Environment Kit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#modularmedievalvillageandcastleenvironmenttownfarmmodularvillage"&gt;Modular Medieval Village / Castle Environment (Town,Farm,Modular Village)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#roadbike"&gt;Road Bike&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#mattepaintingskyboxpack_auroraskies"&gt;Matte Painting Skybox Pack: Aurora Skies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#fantasymedievalcastlekit"&gt;Fantasy Medieval Castle Kit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#modularpostapocalypticdesertenvironmentdesertcitydesertvillage"&gt;Modular Post Apocalyptic Desert Environment (Desert City,Desert Village)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#medievalandvikingweaponsandshieldsset18piecesunity"&gt;Medieval Shields - Prop Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#elitescans_soli-pompeiruinsi"&gt;Elite Scans: Soli-Pompei Ruins I&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#fantasyandmedievalarchitecturekit"&gt;Fantasy and Medieval Architecture Kit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#4WD_drivable_vehicles"&gt;4WD - Drivable Vehicles&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#elitelandscapes_coastalruins"&gt;Elite Landscapes: Coastal Ruins&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#fantasycaveenvironmentset"&gt;Fantasy Cave Environment Set&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#modularbabylontempleenvironmenttempledesertruins"&gt;Modular Babylon Temple Environment (Temple,Desert,Ruins)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#medievalprops_vol5_torchesandbraziers"&gt;Medieval Props Vol. 5 - Torches &amp; Braziers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#elitelandscapes_desertii"&gt;Elite Landscapes: Desert II&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="medievalprops_vol4_woodenchests"&gt;&lt;a id="medievalprops_vol4_woodenchests"&gt;Medieval Props Vol. 4 - Wooden Chests (Lootable)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8ebc5667b69f94e527c9eface6425d383f813cb0.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ff1a78fbcbe358e140b7bd7679cbbd1f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/af0cae83-3996-40ef-b628-3e37254d102b"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.4 - 5.6&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  Wooden chests for loot containers, household storage or castle treasury dressing. Large and small variants with separate open and closed lids, at 4K with collision and LODs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Large and small wooden chests&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Separate open and closed lid variants&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;9 unique meshes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;295 to 10,520 verts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K textures, 4 materials, 4 material instances&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Automatic collision and LODs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="medievalprops_vol1_barrels"&gt;&lt;a id="medievalprops_vol1_barrels"&gt;Medieval Props Vol. 1 - Barrels&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bf2b0df862c215a3e61bddb6fe19db36b6595dcc.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5e4b6220ebf6000b3149d8eeb8fad192"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/d7045bc7-ee60-484d-ac46-6cbc96e2cd1e"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.4 - 5.6&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  Wooden barrels for taverns, docks and battle-worn alleyways, supplied both intact and broken. Eight game-ready meshes at 4K with collision and LODs already set up.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;4 intact barrels&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4 broken barrels&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1,773 to 7,212 verts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K textures, 4 materials, 7 material instances&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Automatic collision and LODs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="yarrawahinstanceauditor"&gt;&lt;a id="yarrawahinstanceauditor"&gt;Yarrawah Instance Auditor&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7bc1cce453f8d1c58a0d54fc33f86853021db407.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ed5f94311095334a44d74672f501e1ab"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;An editor tool that turns loaded-level instancing into an actionable report, comparing loose Static Mesh Actors against ISM, HISM, Foliage, Packed Level Actor and PCG-owned components. Filter and sort renderer diagnostics, export the visible report to CSV, and run undoable actor-level optimization workflows without changing source mesh or material assets.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Per-component and per-mesh audit views&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Estimated current and post-conversion draw calls&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Search, sortable diagnostics, asset navigation and CSV export&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Transactional Convert, Separate, Merge, Add and Remove workflows&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;PCG-aware reporting when PCG is available&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Packaged in-editor documentation with external Markdown fallback&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="yarrawahtextureauditor"&gt;&lt;a id="yarrawahtextureauditor"&gt;Yarrawah Texture Auditor&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/682a831afdb4e65480480cd938e534f34c6c5526.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ae618865635deee4833e70e4b9ac665e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;An editor tool that turns project-wide texture review into a sortable audit, inventoried straight from the Asset Registry without loading a single texture. It reads the real material expression graphs, material functions and instance overrides included, to find sampler-type conflicts, then clears them, compression settings and orphaned textures in guarded batches.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Project-wide texture audit without loading textures&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Sortable compression, sRGB, Virtual Texture, LOD group and disk size&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Sampler-type conflict detection across materials, functions and instances&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;One-click resolution to the dominant sampler type&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Unused texture detection with size-aware batch delete&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Batch compression fixes with undo transactions&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Content Browser presets for normal, sRGB, masked linear and VT setup&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Referencer drill-down split by master material, instance and other asset&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Persistent content-hash cache with interruptible scans&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Source control auto-checkout&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;In-editor documentation through the free Slate Doc Reader&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="slatedocreader"&gt;&lt;a id="slatedocreader"&gt;Slate Doc Reader&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7ab2e0916e7f9d0aa031c5ce9e29fdf4a29e5fe6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4664dc509762f671cb0d24febaf41483"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.5 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A free editor plugin that renders Markdown as a dockable, searchable documentation panel inside Unreal. It finds docs in enabled plugins and content packs on its own, so any pack that ships Markdown becomes readable without leaving the editor.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Dockable two-pane documentation viewer&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Automatic discovery across enabled plugins and content packs&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Explicit registry API with deterministic precedence&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Search across source, title, category, page ID and body&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;YAML frontmatter for title, category, order and icon&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Headings, emphasis, code, links, images, lists, tables, blockquotes and rules&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Refresh without recompiling or restarting the editor&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;SlateDoc.Open console command for source and page navigation&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Win64, packaged documentation included, no external dependencies&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="medievalprops_vol2_tents"&gt;&lt;a id="medievalprops_vol2_tents"&gt;Medieval Props Vol. 2 - Tents&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f8abdc5b5acaf94e7395b12471383b2fb7f19fd1.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4c7a8a0357a58e3b0c73328d1e5648e2"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/1bdfd904-2f35-488d-a2bf-871efac7a590"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.4 - 5.6&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  Tents and a bedroll for building medieval encampments, whether soldier camps, adventurer rests or outlaw hideouts. Three tent sizes at 4K, recolorable through ready-made material instances.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;3 tent models: large, medium and small&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 bedroll&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Base material plus 3 pre-made instances for recoloring&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;8,887 to 52,166 verts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K textures, 21 material instances&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Automatic collision and LODs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="angeliccityscape"&gt;&lt;a id="angeliccityscape" href="https://youtu.be/xB7RnlAXtvI"&gt;Angelic Cityscape&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/faa33b6f-7ea0-4f35-9505-f4c3068e8903"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.0 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  Sixty-five modular pieces for building fantasy and sci-fi cityscapes, low poly with Nanite enabled. Day and night maps both ship complete, lit and ready to explore.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;65 modular static meshes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Nanite enabled, low poly and performance-friendly&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Animated skybox with day and night sky images&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Overview map plus day and night showcase maps&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;8K landscape with animated cloud shadows&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K textures, 7 base materials, 32 material instances&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="medievalprops_vol3_weaponrack"&gt;&lt;a id="medievalprops_vol3_weaponrack"&gt;Medieval Props Vol. 3 - Weapon Rack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b4c7479e99c6012ba0625b23c2d0d14fafb63f18.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=97e2302d090dbd623271b91bdee67bed"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/da7b6d2c-9f6d-4fa7-b48c-4a7d1669c450"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.4 - 5.6&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A fully stocked weapon rack for armories and training grounds, running from swords and axes to a bow and spear. A straw training dummy rounds out the set, all at 4K with collision and LODs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Weapon rack with shield, spear, sword, bow and two axes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Straw-stuffed training dummy&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;8 unique meshes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;388 to 36,202 verts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K textures, 4 materials, 7 material instances&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Automatic collision and LODs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="elitelandscapes_rockymeadows"&gt;&lt;a id="elitelandscapes_rockymeadows" href="https://youtu.be/VOQn19UVJfQ"&gt;Elite Landscapes: Rocky Meadows&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/0f10a4f5-2eee-4195-a560-6b3dd79a838f"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.20 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  Three 8K highland meadow landscapes with a matte painting sky sphere and three lighting setups. Original heightmaps ship with the pack, so your own landscape materials drop straight onto the terrain.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;3 landscapes at 8K resolution&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 movie-quality sky image&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;3 levels with different light setups&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Original 8128 x 8128 heightmaps included&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Basic landscape material&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="emberandsparkvfx"&gt;&lt;a id="emberandsparkvfx"&gt;Ember &amp; Spark VFX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/89ae41a7ce208b856a3d2146a633732c51da6ae5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=8198e9acc406bb5a2c76fcf6e77748e6"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/a44e46e3-65bd-4629-90f1-eb3104d69dca"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.7 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  Eight realistic Niagara ember and spark systems sharing one state-driven simulation. Every particle carries its own temperature, fuel, mass and ash, so embers cool, stick to surfaces, break away and settle on their own.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;8 Niagara systems, ready to drag into a level&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Per-particle thermal state machine: temperature, fuel, mass, ash, grounded&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Distance field collision with adhesion, breakaway and resting embers&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Four-slot character interaction, Blueprint only, no C++ and no plugin&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Wake vortices and underfoot re-flare driven by actor position and velocity&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Baked blackbody ember atlas, 1150 to 1950 K, with temperature-driven tiles&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;ColorHot and ColorMid fantasy colorways without editing a material&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;14 to 20 user parameters per system, DensityScale for linear cost control&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;BP_EMB_FireLight, a flickering 1900 K light to pair with fire systems&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Labeled showcase map, one bay per system, with pre-framed cameras&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="elitescans_soli-pompeiruinsii"&gt;&lt;a id="elitescans_soli-pompeiruinsii" href="https://youtu.be/_QuN3iJINsY"&gt;Elite Scans: Soli-Pompei Ruins II&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/ce1c304e-0ee5-4b87-b048-3c8c041c66e1"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.0 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  Carved capitals, columns and weathered stonework photoscanned from real Roman ruins at 8K. Ten Nanite-ready meshes with Lumen support and material instances for quick color and brightness changes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;10 photogrammetry meshes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;8K textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Nanite enabled&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Supports Lumen for Unreal Engine 5.0+&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Overview map included&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Material instances for color and brightness&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="yarrawahmaterialauditor"&gt;&lt;a id="yarrawahmaterialauditor"&gt;Yarrawah Material Auditor&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5c60ae35ccdafdec0a43ac1b70e057447128e67c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=315611dec4ac8b51c2f04534b4ddcb8b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;An editor tool that turns every master material in the project into a sortable audit, collecting shader and sampler statistics asynchronously and caching them so unchanged assets are never recomputed. Trace instances and mesh references, catch virtual texture mismatches and dead texture overrides, and apply guarded batch fixes with full undo and source control support.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Uses the engine's built-in AssetManagerEditor plugin for Size Map integration. It ships with Unreal and enables itself on install, and there are no third-party dependencies.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Sortable project-wide master material audit&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Pixel and vertex instruction counts with sampler statistics&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Instance counts, divergence and compiler errors&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Virtual texture and inverse-VT mismatch detection with guarded fixes&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Dead texture parameter override cleanup&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Quality Switch instruction comparison by quality level&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Persistent content-hash cache with interruptible scans&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Content Browser navigation and material editor integration&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;In-editor documentation through the free Slate Doc Reader&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="ieslightingprofiles"&gt;&lt;a id="ieslightingprofiles"&gt;IES Lighting Profiles&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/73a6be9007ca636d9e60280a0763230cfc7e58c6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=64c13c8cf1df7f94f7a2e5462699c4a9"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/8fe844fe-8223-46ad-8986-2063404d6b83"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.5 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  Twenty curated IESNA photometric profiles imported as Texture Light Profile assets, named by their measured beam behavior so the right one is obvious from the list. A light function master material projects any profile into volumetric fog as a real shaft, which plain IES textures cannot do.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Volumetric shafts use the Light Function Atlas. Enable it in Project Settings if you are not using the included DefaultEngine.ini.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;20 IES profiles as Texture Light Profile assets&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Narrow spots, wide floods, multi-lobe and ring distributions&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Descriptive names derived from measured beam and field angles&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Peak candela, beam angle, field angle and symmetry listed per profile&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;BP_IES_ProfilePreview with profile, intensity, color, distance and cone controls&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Normalized and non-normalized brightness preview modes&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Overview map lining all 20 profiles up side by side with labels&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Volumetric fog demo map, 7 hero profiles with pre-framed cameras&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;IES light function master material plus 7 ready-made instances&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Original .ies source files included for use outside Unreal&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="dynamiclightgobos"&gt;&lt;a id="dynamiclightgobos"&gt;Dynamic Light Gobos&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/aa4df757743b5fa8cd3010a0c418ba19b2314e03.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=bd44b35cad4e15deaff288bfb446cb8f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/8def4aed-78f0-45ef-a4da-6a1212fb44c6"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.5 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  Animated gobo textures that break light into patterned shadows and volumetric shafts, from water caustics and swaying foliage to spinning vents and drifting curtains. Every gobo material is Light Function Atlas compatible, so the pattern reads in fog as a real shaft of light rather than only on surfaces.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Volumetric shafts use the Light Function Atlas. Enable it in Project Settings if you are not using the included DefaultEngine.ini.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;26 gobo textures at 2K, single-channel grayscale&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;8 families: abstract, caustic, clouds, curtain, glitch, grunge, plants, vent&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Caustic shimmer, foliage sway, cloud drift and glitch flicker animations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4 true flipbook gobos at 64 frames each, with frame-rate control&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Static and animated light function master materials&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;One ready-made material instance per gobo&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;BP_LG_Projector with color, intensity, scale, rotation, pan and animation controls&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Works with spot and point lights&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt25"&gt;Pay $25 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="mattepaintingskyboxpack_chaoticskiesii"&gt;&lt;a id="mattepaintingskyboxpack_chaoticskiesii" href="https://youtu.be/4Indn8Naato"&gt;Matte Painting Skybox Pack: Chaotic Skies II&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/710bb906-5a72-452a-b80d-4795cbdd382c"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.26 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  Apocalyptic storm cloudscapes for the Matte Painting Skybox series. Among the most detailed skies in the range, fully animated and optimized for performance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;6 x 4K 360° matte painting skies&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Blueprint flowmap animation system&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Material instances for color, contrast, exposure and speed&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;8K landscape with animated cloud shadows&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Half-dome sky sphere, terrain and no-terrain versions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;23 textures, 4 base materials, 15 material instances&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="fantasydungeonenvironmentkitbashset"&gt;&lt;a id="fantasydungeonenvironmentkitbashset" href="https://youtu.be/AfE-Bg1D_FM"&gt;Fantasy Dungeon Environment Kitbash Set&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/a7958be6-3930-4e39-b458-d7348047f083"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.25 - 5.7&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A realistic dungeon kit aimed at AAA game, VR and cinematic work, built from 170 organic modular meshes. Treasures, skeletons and set dressing details come alongside the wall and floor modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;170 meshes (165 static, 5 skeletal)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;AAA quality demo level&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Organic and modular architecture&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Wall and floor modules&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Treasures, skeletons and set dressing details&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;49 materials and material instances, 111 textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Mostly 4K textures, LODs included&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="modularwatercityenvironmentwatervillagetownseaside"&gt;&lt;a id="modularwatercityenvironmentwatervillagetownseaside" href="https://youtu.be/V7ZyD2Z3B7I"&gt;Modular Water City Environment (Water Village,Town,Seaside)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/fd908d45-b194-4a7d-97c9-942c0cd22095"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.6 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A waterside settlement kit built from 277 modular meshes, spanning stilted houses, docks and seaside streets. Every house is enterable and furnishable, with drag and drop building blueprints and a custom tool for building bridges between structures.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;277 unique meshes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fully modular, enterable houses&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Drag and drop building blueprints&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Custom bridge creation tool&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Day and night lighting setups&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Showcase and overview maps&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Nanite geometry, built for Lumen&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;92 materials and material instances, 116 textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K, 2K and 1K textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="medievalhelmets_proppack"&gt;&lt;a id="medievalhelmets_proppack"&gt;Medieval Helmets - Prop Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/525077a68d4b6b97bf6c86778d6a9d8820c0ea64.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=788b405d25b390c0cbb8e40e17bdd208"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/545df762-a725-4737-a5d3-55515a7830c4"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.4 - 5.7&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  Historically styled medieval helmets built for real-time use, running from sallets and barbutes to great helms, flat-top helms and a banded kettle hat. Every form ships in multiple finishes, from polished steel through black and gold parade pieces to heavily pitted worn iron.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;9 helmet forms plus a leather cap and modular leather strap&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Norman and German sallets, open and visored barbutes, celata&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Great helm, flat-top helm with and without cross, banded kettle hat&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;26 material instances covering steel, black and gold, painted and worn iron&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;4K textures with packed AORM, 115 textures&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;2 master materials and 8 material functions&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Labeled overview level included&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="mattepaintingskyboxpack_surrealskies"&gt;&lt;a id="mattepaintingskyboxpack_surrealskies" href="https://youtu.be/D95uqwjTCcU"&gt;Matte Painting Skybox Pack: Surreal Skies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/4d40d3b0-d964-4b71-ab0d-de15e3cebff8"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.26 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  Surreal, high fantasy cloudscapes for the Matte Painting Skybox series. Towering painted cloud formations, fully animated and optimized for performance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;6 x 4K 360° matte painting skies&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Blueprint flowmap animation system&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Material instances for color, contrast, exposure and speed&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;8K landscape with animated cloud shadows&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Half-dome sky sphere, terrain and no-terrain versions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;23 textures, 4 base materials, 15 material instances&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="marketstreetenvironmentkit"&gt;&lt;a id="marketstreetenvironmentkit" href="https://youtu.be/PzwND6c6OSo"&gt;Market Street Environment Kit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/5ee4aa76-9fea-4fcd-91e8-146b9e601c2f"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.1 - 5.7&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A bustling bazaar kit that works realistic, stylized or cartoon, with architecture modules and market goods throughout. Stalls, canopies and produce fill the street, with a demo level showing the set at its best.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Modular architecture pieces&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Market stalls, canopies and bazaar goods&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Props and set dressing&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;PBR materials and material instances&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Demo level included&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="modularmedievalvillageandcastleenvironmenttownfarmmodularvillage"&gt;&lt;a id="modularmedievalvillageandcastleenvironmenttownfarmmodularvillage" href="https://youtu.be/h1T5PqPjRuI"&gt;Modular Medieval Village / Castle Environment (Town,Farm,Modular Village)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/469f3cd1-bc0a-4abc-a4f2-2e202de0089b"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.3 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A medieval village and castle kit built from 274 modular meshes, covering town houses, farm buildings and castle structures. Every house is enterable and furnishable, with drag and drop building blueprints and a choice of day or night lighting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;274 unique meshes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fully modular, enterable houses&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Drag and drop building blueprints&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Day and night lighting setups&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Showcase and overview maps&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Custom collision on complex assets&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Nanite geometry, built for Lumen&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;84 materials and material instances, 255 textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K, 2K and 1K textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="roadbike"&gt;&lt;a id="roadbike"&gt;Road Bike&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2ff07bc63637635c4741ab8643ac7af7ba9a9127.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=882a3345925188b7909255ac3d63d114"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/e2259a21-8595-4e0b-a025-b1e70c0426fe"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.1 - 5.7&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A fully rideable post-apocalyptic cruiser running on Chaos vehicle physics, with automatic leaning that reads speed and turn angle. Working handlebars, instrument cluster and a full audio and particle suite, multiplayer-replicated out of the box.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Important: enable the Chaos Vehicles plugin, then restart your editor.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Multiplayer-replicated riding on Chaos Vehicle Physics&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Automatic leaning and banking based on speed and turn angle&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Rigged bones for wheels, handlebars, forks, swingarm, chain and kickstand&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Visible suspension compression on forks and rear shock&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Functional handlebars and working odometer and RPM gauges&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Headlight, brake lights and turn indicators&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Engine revs, idle and tire skid audio&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Tire smoke, exhaust fumes and skid marks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;"Smart Actor" system for near-zero idle cost, hand-made LODs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="mattepaintingskyboxpack_auroraskies"&gt;&lt;a id="mattepaintingskyboxpack_auroraskies" href="https://youtu.be/zXe5hXqA7bY"&gt;Matte Painting Skybox Pack: Aurora Skies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/e433915e-b45c-458e-a1fa-fe4657eb658e"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.26 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  Animated aurora skyboxes for the acclaimed Matte Painting Skybox series. Multi-layered cloud detail beneath colorful arctic auroras, fully animated and optimized for performance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;6 x 4K 360° matte painting skies&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Blueprint flowmap animation system&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Material instances for color, contrast, exposure and speed&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;8K landscape with animated cloud shadows&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Snow particle effect included&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Half-dome sky sphere, terrain and no-terrain versions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;27 textures, 4 base materials, 10 material instances&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="fantasymedievalcastlekit"&gt;&lt;a id="fantasymedievalcastlekit" href="https://youtu.be/H-2ZQzkm1qc"&gt;Fantasy Medieval Castle Kit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/0748515c-18e0-48bc-bcaf-d5e39e66bc46"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.21 - 5.6&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A large, heavily customizable castle with 127 meshes and modular architecture for fast blockout. Blend materials and decals keep repeated pieces from reading as copies, and a landscape and foliage set is included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;127 meshes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Modular architecture pieces&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Blend shaders for customization&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Props: doors, cannons, ropes, cages, frames, fabrics, flags, rocks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Base landscape and foliage included&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Demo scene with flythrough camera setup&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K and 2K PBR textures, LODs on all geometry&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="modularpostapocalypticdesertenvironmentdesertcitydesertvillage"&gt;&lt;a id="modularpostapocalypticdesertenvironmentdesertcitydesertvillage" href="https://youtu.be/jgamIP-JPI8"&gt;Modular Post Apocalyptic Desert Environment (Desert City,Desert Village)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/be5ed72e-f542-41f4-b747-bdb343eef609"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.1 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A ruined desert settlement kit built from 93 modular meshes, covering sun bleached city blocks and outlying village structures. Building blueprints drop whole structures straight into the scene, and the decal set adds instant wear to these or any other environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;93 unique meshes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Drag and drop building blueprints&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Decal set for surface detail and wear&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Showcase and overview maps&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Custom collision on complex assets&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Nanite geometry, built for Lumen&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;69 materials and material instances, 181 textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K, 2K and 1K textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="medievalandvikingweaponsandshieldsset18piecesunity"&gt;&lt;a id="medievalandvikingweaponsandshieldsset18piecesunity"&gt;Medieval Shields - Prop Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a2cf32f16a303e4adaf4f8fd660674873ec6705d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=293d3cbbec6f69c9f436635fa920ce44"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/6a66aaa6-57e6-45e1-9461-14c0ba626070"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.4 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  Historically styled medieval shields covering the full range of European forms, from small bucklers and targes to heater, kite and tower shields. The Viking round alone ships in 17 painted and worn finishes, so a shield wall fills out without visible repetition.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;11 shield meshes, each with painted and worn variants&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Buckler, targe, rondache, two heaters, two kites and a tall tower shield&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Roman scutum and Greek Dipylon shield included&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;17 finishes for the Viking round alone, 39 material instances in total&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;4K textures with packed ORM, 179 textures&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Labeled overview level included&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="elitescans_soli-pompeiruinsi"&gt;&lt;a id="elitescans_soli-pompeiruinsi" href="https://youtu.be/f_IJcWAkMro"&gt;Elite Scans: Soli-Pompei Ruins I&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/d0ec2c2b-1ff5-4fe3-af82-842c68fdaf01"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.0 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  Roman ruins photoscanned on location and rebuilt at 8K, Nanite-ready for UE5. Ten meshes captured from real structures, with material instances for quick color and brightness changes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;10 photogrammetry meshes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;8K textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Nanite enabled&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Overview map included&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Material instances for color and brightness&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="fantasyandmedievalarchitecturekit"&gt;&lt;a id="fantasyandmedievalarchitecturekit" href="https://youtu.be/-Sz8ogeSU9k"&gt;Fantasy and Medieval Architecture Kit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/12f1ec38-c70d-4771-8f11-08f61f8956f5"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.18 - 5.7&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A medieval village kit with 139 meshes covering every base piece needed to build the setting. Props, decals, grass and blended materials handle the set dressing that brings a street to life.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;139 meshes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Modular architecture pieces and door frames&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Props, decals and grass&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Blended materials for environment variety&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Rock pieces for organic level support&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K and 2K PBR textures, LODs included&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="4WD_drivable_vehicles"&gt;&lt;a id="4WD_drivable_vehicles"&gt;4WD - Drivable Vehicles&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c73bf9911a99f2cc09c101d759ba4a14aad0e57a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=0ffbdd6c9a965a16fc7daf401607b884"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/59793af4-063e-4704-80da-6850502d5d49"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.1 - 5.6&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A fully drivable 4WD running on Chaos vehicle physics, multiplayer-replicated out of the box. Real-world friction surfaces and dynamic suspension handle the rough stuff, with a smart actor system that drops to near-zero cost when parked.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Important: enable the Chaos Vehicles and OpenXR plugins, then restart your editor.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Multiplayer-replicated driving on Chaos Vehicle Physics&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Rigged bones for each wheel, door, hood, boot, steering wheel and gear stick&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Multiple friction surfaces and dynamic suspension&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Working gauges, full lighting system and opening panels&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Engine and tire audio, tire smoke, exhaust and skid marks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Destructible windows and mirrors, flat and removable tire variants&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;~100 exposed procedural parameters and customizable number plates&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;"Smart Actor" system for near-zero idle cost, hand-made LODs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Sequencer ready with Control Rig support, 8 demo maps&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="elitelandscapes_coastalruins"&gt;&lt;a id="elitelandscapes_coastalruins" href="https://youtu.be/GqlgBhGTqsM"&gt;Elite Landscapes: Coastal Ruins&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/558372d8-3643-4d58-855d-738fbfdfcc96"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.20 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  Four 8K coastal landscapes with a matte painting sky sphere and ruined village props for set dressing. Original heightmaps ship with the pack, so your own landscape materials drop straight onto the terrain.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;4 landscapes at 8K resolution&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 movie-quality sky image&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;8 ruined village meshes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4 levels with different light setups&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Original 8128 x 8128 heightmaps included&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Basic landscape material&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="fantasycaveenvironmentset"&gt;&lt;a id="fantasycaveenvironmentset" href="https://youtu.be/CqIDFn7fRu4"&gt;Fantasy Cave Environment Set&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/73e0b9c2-e15e-409f-952e-59b038a57ad9"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.16 - 5.7&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A fantasy cave built around a sculpted tomb, with rock pieces for kitbashing caverns of your own. Wall paintings, a detailed sarcophagus and a full lighting setup come ready to explore.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;26 meshes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Rock pieces for kitbashing caves&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Floor, ceiling, facade and pillar modules&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Detailed sarcophagus model&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Wall paintings and lighting setup&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Demo and overview levels&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K and 2K PBR textures, LODs included&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="modularbabylontempleenvironmenttempledesertruins"&gt;&lt;a id="modularbabylontempleenvironmenttempledesertruins" href="https://youtu.be/z9biSLOas5M"&gt;Modular Babylon Temple Environment (Temple,Desert,Ruins)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/23711efc-ad24-43ba-9027-993f830a2e8d"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.0 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A Babylonian temple kit built from 71 modular meshes, spanning terraced stonework, desert ruins and interior chambers. Material instances expose controllable parameters across the stone and sand surfaces, with custom collision on the complex assets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Enable the Water and Water Extras plugins to see the water. On UE 5.3 and 5.4, drag a Water Body Lake actor into the level and delete it once to activate the water material shader.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;71 unique modular meshes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Terraced temple architecture, ruins and interiors&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Controllable material instance parameters&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Showcase and overview maps&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Custom collision on complex assets&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Default UE LODs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;56 materials and material instances, 140 textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K, 2K and 1K textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="medievalprops_vol5_torchesandbraziers"&gt;&lt;a id="medievalprops_vol5_torchesandbraziers"&gt;Medieval Props Vol. 5 - Torches &amp; Braziers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/17a9f405022e47ae057b04bc3ba7688236bf07d6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=fd4433fd4609582b9646c17a410928de"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/94864536-bd34-4729-8abc-92dd18f60144"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.4 - 5.6&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  Torches and a coal-filled brazier to light campsites, dungeons and castle interiors. Four game-ready meshes at 4K, with collision and LODs already set up.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Brazier with a bed of coals&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Large and small standing torches&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4 unique meshes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;3,420 to 25,189 verts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K textures, 4 materials, 5 material instances&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Automatic collision and LODs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="elitelandscapes_desertii"&gt;&lt;a id="elitelandscapes_desertii" href="https://youtu.be/3F6ROOc6Iek"&gt;Elite Landscapes: Desert II&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/b65e58ce-2e74-4c76-9fb0-8d64f6b81488"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.20 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  Four 8K desert landscapes with a matte painting sky panorama and bone props for set dressing. Original heightmaps ship with the pack, so your own landscape materials drop straight onto the terrain.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;4 landscapes at 8K resolution&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 movie-quality sky image&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;8 bone meshes for decoration&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4 levels with different light setups&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Original 8128 x 8128 heightmaps included&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Basic landscape material&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
