      <title>BUILD YOUR DREAM HOME - The Ultimate 3D CAD Bundle</title>
      <author>Ashampoo</author>
      <link>https://humblebundle.com//software/build-your-dream-home-ultimate-3d-cad-bundle-software</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">2388d35f61d63e9b56696f1a72fca973d78db660</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 18:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f6d4d1e3bf9f2c27fe1209454cc51dfdd6f118e8.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=2c84f35b026b9c3a9a7ee6dbceb2ad8a"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/45f835cdb52ff5f73d5a1f1089c2e370af9525a1.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=3e02d41c9886565de2d8c50c8f0f4ce0"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Unleash your creativity with CAD Pro 14!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Give your imaginary designs life—start designing like a pro with our latest 3D CAD bundle! Pay what you want for powerful CAD software and take your grand design ideas from your imagination to the real world. This curated library is highlighted by the latest editions of the hottest software like &lt;em&gt;Ashampoo 3D CAD Professional 14&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Ashampoo Home Design 11&lt;/em&gt;, and&lt;em&gt;Ashampoo 3D CAD Architecture 14&lt;/em&gt;. Get help designing for specific spaces with ultra-useful kitchen and office catalog extensions, and help support the American Cancer Society with your purchase! &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style="color: #ef9741;"&gt;Keys expire. All titles should be redeemed before September 15, 2027.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#ashampoohomedesign11"&gt;Ashampoo Home Design 11&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#interiorcatalogextension"&gt;Interior Catalog Extension&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt14"&gt;Pay $14 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#ashampoo3dcadarchitecture14"&gt;Ashampoo 3D CAD Architecture 14&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#officecatalogextension"&gt;Office Catalog Extension&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#kitchencatalogextension"&gt;Kitchen Catalog Extension&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt22"&gt;Pay $22 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#ashampoo3dcadprofessional14"&gt;Ashampoo 3D CAD Professional 14&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#interiorcatalogextension2"&gt;Interior Catalog Extension 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="ashampoohomedesign11"&gt;&lt;a id="ashampoohomedesign11"&gt;Ashampoo Home Design 11&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2aab2771e993290437d047266cf654a4a6629aa5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3b0e22e30ed8d2be5dcf17a3f6a6e214"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Design, expand, and furnish with this 3D home planning tool&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Find out how easy and innovative home design can be with Ashampoo Home Design. Import and edit millions of 3D objects in formats such as SketchUp and Collada and make your visions a reality. Plan roof-mounted photovoltaic systems with intuitive assistants and virtually design rooms with a wide selection of furniture and decorations. Ashampoo Home Design takes the complicated math off your shoulders, so you can fully concentrate on the design. Explore your projects in a realistic 3D preview and use the user-friendly multi-function bar for efficient and precise results. Ashampoo Home Design is the reliable partner for all your home planning needs!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Millions of ready-to-use objects for perfect furnishing results&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ashampoo Home Design supports loading, editing and saving of various new 3D object formats. This gives you access to millions of 3D objects! Simply import them and add them to your designs! With support for SketchUp or Collada models, you can now instantly use numerous generic and brand-specific models.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Plan photovoltaic installations with ease!&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Comfortable input aids help you plan sophisticated photovoltaic systems in minutes. For roof-mounted systems, you can already specify their layout, select modules from the object catalog and their placement during the setup phase. The program will automatically determine the settings for the roof as soon as you point at the target side. Once configured, the photovoltaic installation will be added to your plan.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 id="interiorcatalogextension"&gt;&lt;a id="interiorcatalogextension"&gt;Interior Catalog Extension&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/daf2aa01db1f73c2c996d383821be2f155687240.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=bc418945f4c9c55fd0292c419ada74d2"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A furniture paradise for your CAD needs!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Regardless of which Ashampoo CAD you have, the Interior Catalog Extension takes interior design to a new level! 500 3D objects are waiting to be utilized, helping you make your projects more flexible, more attractive and as realistic as possible! Treat your CAD to a virtual furniture store!&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-fledged interior design!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;The Ashampoo Interior Catalog Extension provides more options for your individual room designs. Shelves, sideboards, highboards, lowboards, mostly as series with different sizes and layouts, bring your project to life and can be combined at your convenience. For consistency, wardrobes, tables, beds, floor lamps and other furnishings are also included.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Great visuals, mild resource requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;The elements have a low polygon count. This allows for good visual quality without cluttering projects with unnecessary details and overloading the system. It also means you can use them in large numbers without performance hits. Different sizes and layouts offer numerous combinations for versatile room setups.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fine-tune the details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;All objects were created using the modeling functions built into each Ashampoo CAD edition and remain fully customizable. There are also individual components such as table legs that you can install yourself. Do you want to tweak the living experience in detail through other textures or materials from the standard catalog? Our Ashampoo CAD programs combined with Ashampoo Interior Catalog Extension make it possible!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt14"&gt;Pay $14 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="ashampoo3dcadarchitecture14"&gt;&lt;a id="ashampoo3dcadarchitecture14"&gt;Ashampoo 3D CAD Architecture 14&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d6ed1ef1251a2e76af2e7edf502f597bd1c6cf40.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=7ebbfd30ff72ff4acff7b3c2bd77d0f7"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Design your home virtually&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Want to plan your home in peace and comfort on your PC? Ashampoo 3D CAD Architecture is the user-friendly design software for anyone ready to turn their vision into reality! The step-by-step wizard delivers quick and easy results, even for beginners. With 2D, 3D, and cross-section views, you always know exactly where your project stands and can instantly spot what’s missing and where changes are still needed—perfect for identifying weaknesses and avoiding design bottlenecks. New: A powerful electrical planning assistant helps place outlets, switches, and lighting fixtures quickly and accurately. Whether building from scratch, renovating, or just redecorating, find out what your future space will look like today. Get the 3D home planner that truly moves your project forward!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Powerful electrical planning assistant included!&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Electrical planning has never been easier: With the new assistant, you can place outlets, switches, and lights exactly where you need them–with just a few clicks. Choose from predefined room types and equipment configurations or create your own templates. The assistant automatically analyzes your rooms and suggests optimal placements–saving you time and helping you avoid mistakes. Whether you're a beginner or a pro, this feature makes electrical planning faster, easier, and more intuitive!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Customization and full control over electrical symbols&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;In addition to the built-in symbols, you can add and manage your own electrical symbols. Use custom directories to directly integrate personalized elements into your plans. The assistant automatically creates a dedicated layer for electrical symbols, so you can show or hide the entire electrical installation with a single click. You can also manually move, rotate, and adjust all symbols–for maximum flexibility and precision! The assistant even auto-enhances your planning with a parts list of all electrical components used in your project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;New doors and sliding doors–enhancing design flexibility for more realistic drafts&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;New door models give you even more creative options. Innovative extra: Doors with asymmetrical wall openings. Now you can realistically depict sliding doors with track systems and without awkward overlaps. This added flexibility lets you design your floor plans even more accurately and individually, perfect for modern open concepts and advanced architectural projects!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;New feature highlights&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Hidden line optimization in elevation views&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fire Escape Plan plugin&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Wizard for scale, frame placement, and plan layout&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive 2D symbol catalog with automatic legends&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Exporting a List of 2D Symbols (PDF, RTF, Excel)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;More than 280 new, freely scalable 3D objects&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Extended PV objects including current solar modules and balcony power systems&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Photovoltaic installations - rooftop arrays and flat roofs&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;No good project design should be without photovoltaic installations. For roof-mounted system, you can already specify their layout, select modules from the object catalog and their placement during the setup phase. For flat roofs, you can simply specify which parts will be or will not be used for photovoltaic elements during the design phase. When you're done, you can place the entire installation in just two clicks and adjust distances between rows of panels or rotate and realign them - it's the perfect approach to preliminary planning!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="officecatalogextension"&gt;&lt;a id="officecatalogextension"&gt;Office Catalog Extension&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5c2682fd1606aa298036e4e193d431e3a496391d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=09dfca95c749283dff2fa4c0774977ef"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plan your new office in 3D on your PC&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Whether you're furnishing a small office at home or a bullpen, exact planning is a must. Home offices have to meet the same ergonomic requirements as company offices. Efficient work not only relies on good organization and filing skills but starts early in the planning stage. What is the ideal layout for your office? How do furniture, lighting conditions and technical appliances best harmonize with each other as part of a productive office concept? In a time where the boundaries between working and living are blurring, a perfect, wholesome working environment is essential because an eventful workspace with not only adequate but appealing furniture will contribute to better wellness, creativity and inspiration. Create the perfect, ergonomic office concept for increased vitality in your job with the help of detailed planning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="kitchencatalogextension"&gt;&lt;a id="kitchencatalogextension"&gt;Kitchen Catalog Extension&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/dc56c031e6ffb485d5aab87c3308295471518088.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9e640c3ca7663568e13d41d06a2a4a2e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The heart of a home is the kitchen!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;It is the center and central living space of an apartment or a house. It is also a meeting point for family and friends. In a kitchen people eat, work, talk, play, laugh – and, of course, also cook.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;In a building or modernization process special attention must be paid to the kitchen, because of its central function. The earlier and more exact the planning for the kitchen, the better. Planning mistakes in a kitchen concept can later hardly be altered without a great deal of construction work, which can also cost a lot of money.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;A good kitchen is always a large investment and will be part of your home for quite a while. The appropriate layout of kitchen appliances like for example cooker, sink, refrigerator etc. is vital for an optimized kitchen plan.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Well planned, money saved!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;The new Ashampoo Kitchen Catalog Extension enables you to plan your kitchen individually on your PC. The catalogue offers several 3D kitchen lines in different styles, from modern via simple through to elegant. Each kitchen line offers a large number of different objects and textures. This way you can exactly plan your dream kitchen.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Equip your kitchen with high-quality appliances on the highest standard. There is a large number of different appliances available to choose from. Furthermore the catalogue also contains objects like fittings to complete your project.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New kitchen? Plan it yourself on your PC!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;The Ashampoo Kitchen Catalog Extension includes seven kitchen lines in different designs. Each kitchen line contains a complete set of kitchen furniture with wall and floor units as well as different cupboards etc.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Plan your dream kitchen in 3D and choose your furnishing from over 1,200 objects in every kitchen line.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt22"&gt;Pay $22 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="ashampoo3dcadprofessional14"&gt;&lt;a id="ashampoo3dcadprofessional14"&gt;Ashampoo 3D CAD Professional 14&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/58f6b75e773fc89f478c96b2a3972daaf1b468eb.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=902b4cef244c124132b172137254fd62"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;IFC-compatible, precise in detail, and reliable in data exchange&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ashampoo 3D CAD Professional 14 is a comprehensive 3D CAD solution for professional architectural and construction planning. From detailed floor plans and sections to fully developed 3D building models, the software supports the complete design process with precision and technical reliability. Advanced construction tools, structured project management, and extensive object catalogs enable efficient planning of residential, commercial, and public building projects. With integrated IFC-2x3 export, optimized elevation views, and powerful tools for creating fire escape plans, Professional 14 goes beyond pure design—providing a CAD environment built for modern BIM workflows and demanding project requirements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Powerful electrical planning assistant included!&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Electrical planning has never been easier: With the new assistant, you can place outlets, switches, and lights exactly where you need them–with just a few clicks. Choose from predefined room types and equipment configurations or create your own templates. The assistant automatically analyzes your rooms and suggests optimal placements–saving you time and helping you avoid mistakes. Whether you're a beginner or a pro, this feature makes electrical planning faster, easier, and more intuitive!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Customization and full control over electrical symbols&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;In addition to the built-in symbols, you can add and manage your own electrical symbols. Use custom directories to directly integrate personalized elements into your plans. The assistant automatically creates a dedicated layer for electrical symbols, so you can show or hide the entire electrical installation with a single click. You can also manually move, rotate, and adjust all symbols–for maximum flexibility and precision! The assistant even auto-enhances your planning with a parts list of all electrical components used in your project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;New doors and sliding doors–enhancing design flexibility for more realistic drafts&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;New door models give you even more creative options. Innovative extra: Doors with asymmetrical wall openings. Now you can realistically depict sliding doors with track systems and without awkward overlaps. This added flexibility lets you design your floor plans even more accurately and individually, perfect for modern open concepts and advanced architectural projects!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;New feature highlights&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Plan Layout with multiple views on a single sheet&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Scaled plan layouts with PDF output&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;2D drawing functions for adding drawing details and enhancing floor plans&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Insert scanned floor plans (JPG, PNG) as images and use them as a blueprint to trace your 3D building model&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Extended 2D drawing functions with custom line types and hatching&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Create and edit custom 2D symbols&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Combinable roof extensions and roof openings&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Extended roof variants including hall roofs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Integrated 3D Converter with material and texture editing&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Standards-compliant fire escape plans directly from the project&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;With the integrated Fire Escape Plan Plugin, standards-compliant safety plans can be created directly based on existing floor plans. A wizard assists with scale, drawing frame placement, and layout, while a comprehensive 2D symbol catalog and automatic legend generation streamline implementation. In addition, a structured export of all used 2D symbols is available—ideal for documentation and coordination. Professional 14 significantly expands its application scope for commercial and public construction projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;IFC export for professional BIM workflows&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;With the integrated IFC-2x3 Export PlugIn, Ashampoo 3D CAD Professional 14 becomes fully BIM-compatible. Complete 3D building models can be exported, including structural elements such as walls, ceilings, floors, and roof structures, as well as finishing elements like windows, doors, and stairs. 3D catalog objects and custom 3D constructions are also reliably transferred. This allows planning data to be integrated into architectural, structural engineering, or cost-estimating software, enabling efficient collaboration within connected project environments. Professional here means full control over data and future-proof standards.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Powerful design an construction tools&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Numerical input tools are the ultimate solution for precise planning, which is why the program heavily emphasizes this aspect! Dedicated input modes for walls, windows, and doors make your work incredibly easy, while numerical editing tools for the same areas add more precision and flexibility to your projects. Together with custom components for windows and doors, roller shutter boxes, blinds and borders, the design and construction section is a genuine highlight of the software!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Extensive object catalogs&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ashampoo® 3D CAD Professional is popular also because of the vast number of included 3D objects. Select from a variety of suitable 3D objects and over 250 ready-to-use object groups in the object catalog! The catalog includes groups full of pre-designed garages, kitchen lines, garden houses, and saunas, among others. Create your own catalog directories and use them directly in the catalogs, it couldn't be more convenient! Look forward to a program that sets hardly any limits for you and your projects!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Less is more?&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Great, then our Ashampoo® 3D CAD Architecture is what you want! You don't need to import/export of 2D DXF/DWG files or export Maxon Cinema 4D files, and you don't want to construct windows yourself? But you still want a comprehensive, fully-fledged CAD application? Then the more affordable Ashampoo® 3D CAD Architecture is the ideal solution for you! After all, why should you pay for high-level professional features you won't be using anyway? Check out the comparison matrix and find the solution that is right for you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="interiorcatalogextension2"&gt;&lt;a id="interiorcatalogextension2"&gt;Interior Catalog Extension 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a68c7fb6fb5d6dce5c8f68a726fb2d76be8b76cd.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5f28336ede12271b729db616e644a3d1"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Over 380 new 3D objects for realistic interior design&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Ashampoo Interior Collection 2 Extension expands your CAD or Home Design software with an extensive selection of high-quality furnishing elements. More than 380 detailed 3D objects allow you to design and present modern living spaces with impressive realism—from cozy living rooms to fully furnished bedrooms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Wide selection of sofas, beds, and seating furniture&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;At the heart of the collection are around 160 sofas, including 2- and 3-seaters, L-shaped and U-shaped designs, as well as complete sofa series for cohesive interior concepts. The selection is complemented by approximately 46 beds, ranging from classic double beds and single beds to children’s beds. Around 90 armchairs and chairs—including bar stools, office chairs, dining chairs, recliners, and corner benches—provide maximum flexibility for living and working areas.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Decorative elements and rustic highlights for unique accents&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The collection also includes about 70 additional interior objects such as wood-burning stoves, rugs, lamps, and curtains. A selection of rustic furniture pieces—including desks, cabinets, display cabinets, and armchairs—adds distinctive character and opens up new possibilities for traditional or country-style designs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;AI-generated and fully optimized for CAD performance&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Most 3D objects were created using the latest AI technologies and then carefully optimized for use in Ashampoo CAD and Home Design software. Polygon counts were reduced to a performance-friendly level, materials were refined, and suitable 2D representations for floor plans were pre-calculated. This ensures realistic visuals while maintaining smooth and efficient performance during planning and presentation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Seamless integration into your software&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Interior Collection 2 Extension is an add-on and requires an installed version of Ashampoo CAD or Home Design software. It is not a standalone product. The installer automatically copies all included files into the standard 3D object catalog, making them immediately available for both new and existing projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt; &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
