els locally, this course covers the ground floor. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's a broad look at local LLMs and the tools around Ollama.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Get an overview of local LLMs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Set up and manage models with Ollama.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Cover core concepts and tools.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Build a foundation for later projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every local AI project starts with the same basics.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get your foundation in place and go from there.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt25"&gt;Pay $25 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="automatewithkimi"&gt;&lt;a id="automatewithkimi"&gt;Automate with Kimi&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6b4e5646502792ba2c88a4aa4e02b2d716e5fbe4.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9872794916c4a69bd14b6229c7a003ed"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explore Kimi in this beginner-friendly course and learn how to use one of the largest AI models available. Available on Kimi.com, Kimi Work, Kimi Code, and the Kimi API, Kimi works with images, large documents, extensive codebases, and long conversations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Kimi can sustain long engineering sessions, navigate large repositories, use terminal tools, and combine coding with visual reasoning for game development, frontend projects, and CAD workflows. Dive into this new AI to join the frontier of cutting-edge technology.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="claudecodeplusqwen36_buildlocalaicodingprojectswithanollamabackend"&gt;&lt;a id="claudecodeplusqwen36_buildlocalaicodingprojectswithanollamabackend"&gt;Claude Code + Qwen 3.6: Build Local AI Coding Projects with an Ollama Backend&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5d62375b1fba4c915f751f1285b5ed403e51d870.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b5688e4fe333ed89e3ac8ae461b9f7bf"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pairing Claude Code with a model running on your own machine changes how you build. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This video course starts with getting Ollama running, then moves into building and editing real projects with Claude Code and Qwen 3.6.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Install Ollama, run your first conversation, and explore terminal commands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Install the Claude Code CLI and create a website from a single prompt.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Improve and iterate on your website project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Edit existing repositories with Claude Code.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Watching a single prompt turn into a working site is where it starts to click.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Start your first project with this local setup.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildmultimodalaiapplicationswithollamaandqwen36vision"&gt;&lt;a id="buildmultimodalaiapplicationswithollamaandqwen36vision"&gt;Build Multimodal AI Applications with Ollama and Qwen 3.6 Vision&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/532611c697c062be057746f1d25cf3eff5510e8e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a2de95367a7b0108aaaafbd011ae6381"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Vision changes what a model can actually do with your input. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This video course walks through the multimodal side of Qwen 3.6, from how vision extends the stack to structuring real requests and responses.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► See how vision extends the Qwen stack and survey model capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Send multimodal requests and structure responses.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Design multimodal application architectures.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Weigh deployment tradeoffs and responsible positioning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Understanding the tradeoffs matters as much as getting the model to respond.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Give your applications the ability to see, starting now.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="localaiworkflowswithcodexandollama"&gt;&lt;a id="localaiworkflowswithcodexandollama"&gt;Local AI Workflows with Codex and Ollama&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6aafe2f06019eb048f2479b21b8c6664489a8cbc.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4b73f0f59db809ca14c3ab2ebe238d46"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pairing an AI coding assistant with a local model changes how you approach development. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This course pairs Codex with Qwen 3.6 for coding work you run yourself.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Pair Codex with Qwen 3.6 locally.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Build coding workflows step by step.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Use AI assistance without the cloud.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Work through practical scenarios.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your code, your machine, your workflow.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jump in and set up your own coding pipeline.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="builda3dmultiplayernpc-to-npcsimulatorwithollamaingodot"&gt;&lt;a id="builda3dmultiplayernpc-to-npcsimulatorwithollamaingodot"&gt;Build a 3D Multiplayer NPC-to-NPC Simulator with Ollama in Godot&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/477ed3dd5dc1748e46cd0cf875b7ac9b192601de.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=84783cfae6752980fe9dafa84077782c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build a conversation simulator in Godot 4.8 using locally hosted AI models through Ollama. Connect HTTPRequest nodes, test real model generation, build 3D characters, place chat boxes above them, and display each character’s dialogue in real time. Prompt-engineer distinct Einstein and Newton characters with different personalities, knowledge, and speaking styles. The finished conversation system generates new dialogue every 5 seconds and keeps persistent memory so the characters can continue a topic instead of starting over.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Add local text-to-speech with Kokoro, connect Godot to a FastAPI TTS server, and build a separate FastAPI multiplayer server for shared control. Viewers can submit and display topic suggestions, while a manager instance selects the active topic and controls the conversation. The networking system broadcasts generated dialogue, tracks the current topic and viewer count, and supports separate manager and viewer configurations through command-line arguments. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;By the end of the course, you will be able to run the multiplayer server, TTS server, manager client, and viewer clients together as one working local AI conversation app. Let’s build it!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="intelligentcustomersupporttriagewithgmailapiandollama"&gt;&lt;a id="intelligentcustomersupporttriagewithgmailapiandollama"&gt;Intelligent Customer Support Triage with Gmail API and Ollama&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f38a8e333026119cb6b007af4fe63de61ca47c16.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a0b3e47b3f9a3203d6702ee45db96471"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Support inboxes pile up fast. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This course connects the Gmail API with Ollama to help sort and prioritize incoming messages.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Connect Gmail API to local AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Sort and prioritize support tickets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Automate first-response triage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Build it all without the cloud.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A little automation goes a long way in a busy inbox.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Set up your own triage system this week.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="personalizedemailoutreachautomationwithgmailapiandollama"&gt;&lt;a id="personalizedemailoutreachautomationwithgmailapiandollama"&gt;Personalized Email Outreach Automation with Gmail API and Ollama&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0d9d850c43999f6e8206613428b7c45e6f68d9cb.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6e18209a28bd7cb6486dc731dcf182d2"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sending outreach one email at a time doesn't scale. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This course covers building a personalized outreach workflow using Gmail API and Ollama.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Automate outreach through Gmail API.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Personalize messages with local AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Build the workflow step by step.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Keep control over your own data.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Outreach works better when it doesn't feel automated.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Start building your outreach system today.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="ollamatoolcallingandfunctionintegration"&gt;&lt;a id="ollamatoolcallingandfunctionintegration"&gt;Ollama Tool Calling and Function Integration&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/196610f70863237e3e438c976947467f87ca2adc.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5ea3043d1f25002073f0bfd423549b17"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Getting a model to respond is one thing. Getting it to actually call functions and interact with real tools is another. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This course covers tool calling and function integration with Ollama.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Understand how tool calling works.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Connect models to external functions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Design function schemas that models can use.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Build practical tool-calling workflows.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is the piece that turns a chatbot into something that can actually act.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Add tool calling to your local AI setup and see what it can do.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="promptengineeringforaisystems"&gt;&lt;a id="promptengineeringforaisystems"&gt;System Prompt Engineering: Customizing Qwen 3.6 with Ollama Modelfiles&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c2e3b747a0af1189d574476ed9b0f18abfaae703.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=0746ca010331be498e418a9ecddba280"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;"The way you write a system prompt changes everything about how a model behaves. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This video course covers the Ollama Modelfile from the ground up, from system prompt foundations to building and sharing your own custom variants.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Cover system prompt foundations and the Qwen model family.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Break down the anatomy of the Ollama Modelfile.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Design effective system prompts, templates, and chat formatting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Tune behavior with PARAMETER, then build and distribute variants.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Small prompt changes can lead to very different results.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dive in and start shaping your own model behavior."&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="localaiagentswithollama_autonomousworkflowswithoutthecloud"&gt;&lt;a id="localaiagentswithollama_autonomousworkflowswithoutthecloud"&gt;Local AI Agents with Ollama - Autonomous Workflows Without the Cloud&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/402bc443ee544a5dc8b27d6e194f782d8e9b6934.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=8a1c4d2124511f40f58b57163d58951e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;There's a real difference between a model that answers and an agent that acts. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This video course walks through what it takes to build agents that run entirely on your own hardware.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Understand why agents make sense locally and how the model engine works.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Give agents abilities through tool calling and Model Context Protocol.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Add memory, retrieval, and autonomous multi-agent workflows.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Cover hardware, performance, and scaling locally.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;By the end, you'll see how each piece adds up to something that can work on its own.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Start building your first local agent today.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="ai-poweredresumeandcoverlettergenerationwithollamaandqwen36"&gt;&lt;a id="ai-poweredresumeandcoverlettergenerationwithollamaandqwen36"&gt;AI-Powered Resume &amp; Cover Letter Generation with Ollama and Qwen 3.6&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0a695ce01c524a48e8aaa95ff79c73ebc978e511.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6d966e76ea3023c853373b4a3e9ab29f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Job hunting is stressful enough without spending hours on paperwork. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This course shows you how to generate resumes and cover letters using a local AI setup.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Generate resumes with local AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Draft cover letters that fit the job.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Customize output using Qwen 3.6.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Keep personal data off the cloud.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A stronger application shouldn't cost you your whole weekend.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get started and build your next application faster.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="conversationalcsvanalysisusingkimi27codewithpythonandollama"&gt;&lt;a id="conversationalcsvanalysisusingkimi27codewithpythonandollama"&gt;Conversational CSV Analysis using Kimi 2.7 Code with Python and Ollama&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5df6f788a4b1322e56e943053f0900aa73ceb4fe.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=12675ded239dd44fa1af343d7011fece"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Asking your data questions in plain language works differently than typing another SQL query or building a dashboard. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This video course builds that conversational loop using Kimi K2.7 Code, Ollama, and Python, from the reasoning behind the stack to a working analysis agent.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Understand why this stack beats dashboards, fixed scripts, and SQL bots.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Explore Kimi K2.7 Code's architecture, context window, and agentic coding behavior.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Design system prompts, code-generation, and tool-calling patterns for analyzing CSVs conversationally.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Cover safety, sandboxing, multi-turn memory, visualization, and how the stack compares to alternatives.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's as much about knowing the tradeoffs as it is about getting the model to answer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;⚠️ Requires an Ollama Cloud sign-in or API key.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Start turning your CSVs into an actual conversation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="natural-languagesqlgenerationwithpythonandollama"&gt;&lt;a id="natural-languagesqlgenerationwithpythonandollama"&gt;Natural-Language SQL Generation with Python and Ollama&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e13ad40ee641d2ab33d9c3b388d7cdd99e7d9e7e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a466fdbfd1d12850e868b5ac64bc5041"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Writing SQL by hand isn't always the fastest path to an answer. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This course shows how to turn plain English into working queries using Python and Ollama.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Turn plain English into SQL.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Connect the pieces using Python.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Run everything locally.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Practice with real query scenarios.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sometimes describing what you want is faster than writing it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Start turning your questions into queries.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="contentcreationandrepurposingwithalocalaiwritingstudio"&gt;&lt;a id="contentcreationandrepurposingwithalocalaiwritingstudio"&gt;Content Creation &amp; Repurposing with a Local AI Writing Studio&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d67f6c0255cc8d06bc5d2ad2c64000bd7f8e7ec3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5d389079b176373c65f7f3e7968d10f1"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;One piece of content can go a lot further than a single post. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This course builds a local AI writing setup for drafting and 